window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3501,"title":"Chapter 3501: Going to the Hua Family","paragraphs":["Chapter 3501: Going to the Hua Family","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The empress dowager was furious. Everything Feng Wu said was like a needle poking at her. She wasn’t behaving like a proper girl at all! However, the empress dowager felt guilty, for fear that Feng Wu would spill the beans.","After all, the empress dowager still cared about her reputation.","Hence, she glared at Emperor Wu. “You spoiled her. Teach her some discipline!”","Having said that, the empress dowager left in a hurry. She walked so fast that no one could tell how old she was.","As soon as Emperor Wu approached, the empress dowager scolded him before he could ask anything. He looked at Feng Wu in confusion.","Strangely enough, he had thought that the empress dowager would pick on Feng Wu this time, but she had left so soon. After all, she was the empress dowager. Maybe she had become soft-hearted.","That was what Emperor Wu thought, and that was what he said to Feng Wu.","After saying that, he tried to persuade her. “Actually, the empress dowager is a gentle person who either loves and hates a person. She has misunderstood you, which is why she’s picking on you. You can coax her later and resolve the misunderstanding. Then everything will be fine.” Feng Wu gave Emperor Wu a strange look.","Master Gao didn’t know what to say.","With a wry smile, he told Emperor Wu about the conversation between Feng Wu and the empress dowager. Only then did Emperor Wu realize why his mother was in such a hurry and ran away without looking back.","Emperor Wu shook his head and didn’t say anything.","“Let’s talk inside.”","Feng Wu followed Emperor Wu into the study.","No one knew what they talked about in the study. All Master Gao knew was that Emperor Wu was lost in thought after Feng Wu left.","Emperor Wu was deep in thought when he suddenly looked up and asked Master Gao, “Do you think Feng Wu can really turn the situation around?”","Master Gao said, “What?”","Emperor Wu said, “Can she really turn a bad thing into a good thing with so many people after her?”","Master Gao asked, “Is that... possible?”","Emperor Wu said, “That’s right. Is that possible?”","No matter how Emperor Wu thought about it, he couldn’t figure out how Feng Wu could turn the situation around.","“What about the crown prince?” Emperor Wu asked. “Is he the key?”","Master Gao looked confused. “His Royal Highness hasn’t come back since he left the mansion a few days ago. No one knows where he is.”","Emperor Wu rubbed his chin. “That’s strange. I asked Feng Wu just now, and she said that what she was going to do had nothing to do with the crown prince. She even asked me if I wanted to work with her.”","Master Gao said, “Then Your Majesty, did you...”","Emperor Wu said, “Of course, I said yes! She’s my daughter-in-law!”","Master Gao thought to himself, “I wish you could have been so tough in front of Her Majesty just now.”","Feng Wu left the palace and went back to the Feng family with Feng Xun.","Feng Xun was confused the whole way. From time to time, he would glance at Feng Wu. What had she told His Majesty? What was her plan?","“You...” Feng Xun couldn’t help but ask curiously, “What’s your plan?”","Feng Wu said, “Don’t worry. You’ll get busy.”","Feng Xun said, “What?”","But he still couldn’t understand. What did she mean? Was it because he was too dumb?","Just then, Feng Wu said to herself, “His Majesty said that the ancient recipe is with the Hua family. They must have brought it out of the Flower Valley this time, right?”","Feng Xun was shocked.. “You’re going to the Hua family?!”"]},{"number":3502,"title":"Chapter 3502: The Divorce Letter","paragraphs":["Chapter 3502: The Divorce Letter","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor. Henyee Translations","Feng Wu nodded. “That’s right. I guess I have to go to the Hua family.” “No way!” Feng Xun disagreed. “Do you know what kind of relationship you have with the Hua family? You’re their daughter’s rival in love! Do you think you can walk out of there alive?!”","Feng Wu said, “So, it’s best if Hua Wushuang comes out on her own.”","Suddenly, Feng Wu turned around and gave Feng Xun a strange look.","Feng Xun’s heart sank. He felt like he had become her target. “W-What do you want?”","Feng Wu smiled a little. “Why don’t you lure Hua Wushuang out? It won’t be too much trouble. Just lure her out of the Hua family.”","Feng Xun said proudly, “I’m not going.”","Feng Wu was about to coax Feng Xun when she looked up and saw that they were almost at the entrance of her house. However, there was a commotion outside.","“There seems to be a problem.”","The two of them quickly rode forward on their mounts. The crowd parted to make way for them.","Feng Wu saw a carriage up ahead, in which a woman was sobbing, a child was crying, and a mean servant was reprimanding someone.","Feng Wu saw Feng Sang and Feng Yiran standing at the door, looking furious.","Feng Wu sat on her mount and watched from above.","There was also a mount on the other side. Riding on the tall horse was a handsome but malicious-looking man. His eyes were ruthless and cold.","Ignoring Feng Wu, he stared at the mother and daughter in the carriage and said in an extremely cold voice.","A piece of paper flew out of his hand and landed on the woman.","“This is your divorce letter. In the future, we’ll have nothing to do with each other! The girl is yours, and Haohao belongs to the Duke’s Estate. He has nothing to do with your family!” With that, the man was about to leave.","Was he divorcing his wife?","Feng Wu recognized the woman in the carriage as Feng Yi, the eldest daughter of the Feng family.","The girl in her arms was probably her daughter, Niuniu, but Feng Wu had never seen her before.","“Li Chaopan! Why?! Why?!” Feng Yi was dumbfounded.","She didn’t have a good life at her in-laws’ house, but she could still live on. However, for some reason, this afternoon, her mother-in-law suddenly told her that she had been divorced. Her husband actually wrote a divorce letter and threw it at her face...","Feng Yi was the weakest among the sisters... When she was divorced, she would only cry and ask why.","She cried, and so did Niuniu... For a moment, everything was in chaos.","Feng Yi rushed forward and wanted to hug Li Chaopan’s thigh, but Li Chaopan was extremely ruthless. He swung the horsewhip in his hand and hit the back of Feng Yi’s hand !","A bloody whip mark immediately appeared on the back of her hand!","The two-meter-tall horse raised its front hooves high and was about to step on Feng Yi.","“Sister!” Feng Sang rushed forward and pulled Feng Yi back.","Otherwise, Feng Yi would really have been trampled to death.","Feng Sang was still in shock. “Sister, what are you doing?!” Feng Yi was so shocked that she stood there in a daze.","Li Chaopan was about to leave with his group of evil servants.","Before he could leave, Feng Yiran bellowed, “Li Chaopan, stop right there!”","Li Chaopan did stop. He turned around and gave Feng Yiran a provocative look..","“What’s up? Feng Yiran, with your little strength, what can you possibly do?”"]},{"number":3503,"title":"Chapter 3503: Unforeseen Event (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3503: Unforeseen Event (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Feng Yiran, you’re so weak. What can you possibly do?” Li Chaopan’s words were too harsh.","Feng Yiran’s face flushed red, and his eyes blazed with fury!","“What? Do you really want to fight me? You’re just a Spiritual Grandmaster. How dare you?” Li Chaopan gave Feng Yiran a sidelong glance.","Feng Yiran used to be his brother-in-law, but not anymore.","“Let’s go!”","Li Chaopan flicked his whip and wanted to leave.","Niuniu and Feng Yi were crying. Feng Sang rushed up angrily, grabbed the tail of Li Chaopan’s horse, and roared, “Get down!”","Li Chaopan didn’t show any mercy and whipped Feng Sang in the face!","The long whip landed on Feng Sang’s face, leaving a bloody mark!","“Li Chaopan! Is your family going against the Feng family?!” Feng Yiran was furious. He stood in front of Feng Sang and shouted at Li Chaopan.","Li Chaopan said, “You’re right. Today, we’ll become enemies with the Feng clan!”","Feng Sang asked, “Why?!”","Why did Li Zhaopan have such a big reaction?","Of course, Li Chaopan wouldn’t say that it was because of Feng Wu because if he did, people would say that they were disloyal and that they couldn’t share the hardships of their in-laws.","Therefore, Duke Li had come up with an excuse.","Moreover, that excuse was enough to humiliate the Feng clan.","When the powerful cultivators dealt with the Feng clan, they wouldn’t associate Duke Li’s family with the Feng clan anymore.","Li Chaopan looked around and stared at Feng Yiran and Feng Sang. He stressed each word. “Are you sure you want me to say it in front of so many people? Fine. If the Feng clan isn’t afraid of humiliation, so be it!”","“What?!","Feng Yiran and Feng Sang blanched.","Feng Wu frowned as well.","Li Chaopan said, “Haven’t I made myself clear? Your sister has made me a cuckold. Do you understand what I’m saying now? Instead of drowning her in a pond, I brought her back to you in one piece. My family has shown you enough mercy!”","He turned to leave after that.","“I didn’t! You’re slandering me!”","Feng Yi, who had been hoping that Li Chaopan would take her back, was astonished.","“I didn’t do that! You’re lying”","Feng Yi shouted at Li Chaopan.","However, Li Chaopan didn’t even look at her. He said, “I’ve delivered her and the letter of marriage annulment. From now on, our families have nothing to do with each other!”","“I really didn’t...” Feng Yi cried in despair.","However, Li Chaopan didn’t even look at her. There was no warmth in his eyes.","Feng Sang helped Feng Yi, who was crying so hard that she was about to pass out, to her feet. Feng Yiran stepped out and blocked Li Chaopan’s way. “You have to catch an adulteress in bed to convict her! How did my sister make you a cuckold? Where’s your witness? Where’s your physical evidence? You can’t say whatever you want!”","Li Chaopan smirked. “Your Feng clan is so strange. You don’t seem to mind public humiliation at all. Do they have to tell everyone about it? No one will dare to marry a daughter of your clan in the future.”","Feng Yiran was too furious to speak.","“Out of my way!” Li Chaopan’s whip sent Feng Yiran flying backwvard.","Li Chaopan was about to leave with his men.","He was so bloated with pride, so domineering, and so swollen with arrogance.","It was simply too much!"]},{"number":3504,"title":"Chapter 3504: Unforeseen Event (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3504: Unforeseen Event (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Thump!","Feng Wu showed up when Li Chaopan kicked Feng Yiran away and wanted to storm off.","Without another word, she struck out.","To be more precise, she used her foot.","She kicked Li Chaopan in the chest, sending the arrogant second son of Duke Li flying.","“Young Master!”","The people around Li Chaopan rushed out to catch him.","However, Feng Wu’s kick was so hard that Li Chaopan flew back for dozens of meters before he fell to the ground.","Thump!","There was a human-shaped pit in the ground.","Li Chaopan was stuck in it.","A spiderweb-like crack spread out from the center of the pit.","The two guards tried to save Li Chaopan, but they couldn’t catch him.","Li Chaopan was baffled.","Blood trickled down the corner of his mouth as he struggled to crawl out of the pit.","He wasn’t the only one that was shocked.","Everyone was dumbfounded. He was the second son of the Li family, and no one dared to... Well, they all fell silent when they saw who had arrived.","It was Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was said to have the Divine Phoenix Blood and had made rapid progress in her cultivation. She was the top student of Imperial College and was suspected to be the crown prince’s fiancee.","“It’s you!”","Feng Wu didn’t see Li Chaopan, but Li Chaopan had seen her before.","For the past year, Feng Wu had been the center of attention of the younger generation. Moreover, for her birthday, all the fireworks in the city had lit up the sky, which was as resplendent as the stars. Li Chaopan wasn’t blind, so of course he could see it.","Therefore, Li Chaopan frowned when he saw Feng Wu.","Why was Feng Wu so capable now?","However, when he recalled what his mother told him, Li Chaopan smirked inwardly. No matter how capable Feng Wu was, she couldn’t be more powerful than a Spiritual Overlord, and so many of them were trying to kill her now. She wouldn’t survive!","At that thought, Li Chaopan sneered at Feng Wu.","With the help of his guards, he struggled to his feet, stared at Feng Wu with his cold eyes, and slowly walked toward her.","Meanwhile, Feng Sang was supporting Feng Yiran.","Feng Yiran was badly injured. He spat out a few mouthfuls of blood and hung limply on Feng Sang’s shoulder. His bones felt like jelly.","Feng Wu examined him and saw that three of his ribs were broken, and his internal organs were all injured... Before she knew it, Feng Wu was furious.","Feng Wu knew better than anyone else.","Since Li Chaopan choose today to leave his wife and had used such a vile excuse to offend the Feng clan, Feng Wu knew that Feng Yi would never have cheated on her husband.","Hence, Li Chaopan was telling everyone that Duke Li was no longer friends with the Feng clan.","Feng Wu handed Feng Sang a bottle of potion. “Give it to your brother.”","Feng Sang nodded.","She didn’t like Feng Wu at all, but when Feng Wu stepped out, she felt so safe.","Feng Sang was astonished when she saw the potion.","A Semi-divine potion?!","“OMG!”","What did she see? Was it really a Semi-divine potion?","Feng Wu gave it to her as if it was a bottle of water.","Feng Sang turned around to ask Feng Wu, but Feng Wu and Li Chaopan were facing each other in a staring competition.","Duan Chaoge had arrived at some point, and Feng Wu had sent her here to look after Feng Yiran.","Seeing Feng Sang standing there, Duan Chaoge uncorked the bottle and poured the potion into Feng Yiran’s mouth.."]},{"number":3505,"title":"Chapter 3505: Unforeseen Event (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3505: Unforeseen Event (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Hey! ”","Feng Sang stared at Chaoge and Duan Chaoge in astonishment. “Do you know what potion you just fed him?!”","Although Feng Sang couldn’t make potions, she could still recognize what it was.","She was sure that it was a Semi-divine potion.","Chaoge glanced at her and said, “It’s a Semi-divine potion.”","That matter-of-fact tone... Feng Sang was so shocked that she didn’t know what to say.","Meanwhile, Li Chaopan glared at Feng Wu and threatened her. “This is none of your business! Get lost!”","Feng Wu gave her a half-smile. “After what I did to you, you’re still threatening me. I see that you’re a barking dog.”","As the son of Duke Li, Li Chaopan couldn’t stand such sarcasm. He wanted to punch Feng Wu in the face.","However, he realized something when he saw the half-smile on Feng Wu’s face.","Feng Wu was so much more capable than he was that he knew he wouldn’t be her match.","However...","Li Chaopan said sarcastically, “I was wondering who it was. So, it’s you. You still have time to show off? If I were you, I’d be hiding in the mountains now.”","“Li Chaopan, do you have a death wish?”","Before Feng Wu could say anything, Feng Xun quickly walked up to her and stood next to her.","Li Chaopan frowned when he saw Feng Xun.","He was the Young Master of the Duke Li family, but Feng Xun was the heir to Northern General Feng. He couldn’t defeat Feng Xun in terms of his background or his own capability.","Moreover, he had been beaten up by Feng Xun once when he wouldn’t listen to Feng Xun, so he was a little intimidated.","“Young Lord Feng, here’s a piece of advice. You can’t protect her even if you want to!”","Li Chaopan didn’t want to confront Feng Xun directly, so he turned to leave.","He had tried to leave the Feng clan countless times, but he was stopped every single time.","It was the Feng clan’s business, and Feng Xun couldn’t get involved. Hence, Feng Wu nodded at him, telling him that she would handle it.","Feng Xun stood there with his arms crossed.","If Feng Wu could solve the problem, he would let her do it on her own. If she couldn’t, he would do it. But if he couldn’t, there was still the Northern Feng General’s family.","“Alright.” Feng Xun rubbed Feng Wu’s head. “Go ahead. My family will take full responsibility. Apart from being Feng Wu of the Feng clan, you’re also the only daughter of Northern Feng Mansion!”","He was showing off her power to Li Chaopan.","Li Chaopan’s face was livid. He threw a dirty look at Feng Xun.","Feng Xun gave him a provoking look.","Li Chaopan said, “Fine, fine. That’s why you dared to attack me. Northern Feng","Mansion is behind it. However, after what you’ve done, even Northern Feng","Mansion won’t be able to protect you! Feng Wu, you’re going to die!”","Feng Wu said coldly, “Is that why the Li family found an excuse to get rid of the daughter of the Feng clan?”","Li Chaopan was dumbfounded.","So, Feng Wu knew about it.","How could she not know she was being hunted?","Li Chaopan smirked. “Don’t make things up. Is the Li family that kind of a family? I’m going to court and accuse you of framing me!”","Feng Wu said, “The Feng clan will sue you first. Let’s go.”","After that, Feng Wu grabbed Li Chaopan’s arm and was ready to leave.","“Where are you going?” Li Chaopan wanted to shake Feng Wu off, but Feng Wu was much stronger than him, so he was as helpless as a chicken.."]},{"number":3506,"title":"Chapter 3506: The Unforeseen Event (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3506: The Unforeseen Event (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Didn’t you say you were going to sue me for framing you? Come, let’s go to see His Majesty. I’m going to sue you back.”","Feng Wu showed no mercy and dragged Li Chaopan away.","Li Chaopan panicked a little.","Duke Li’s family did this thing in a hurry, and they had no evidence whatsoever. Feng Yi had been kicked out because of their bullying.","“Let go of me!” Li Chaopan tried to break free.","Li Chaopan cracked his whip as he struggled.","Feng Wu took the whip, pinned Li Chaopan’s hands behind his back, and tied him up with a black whip.","Li Chaopan was furious.","Were they really going to see the emperor? If she made it formal...","At that thought, Li Chaopan shot warning glances at both sides.","Duke Li’s family had made this decision together, so Li Chaopan had brought quite a few goons with him. The most capable of them was almost a Spiritual Overlord.","As soon as that man made his move, Feng Xun stopped him, making it impossible for him to get close to Feng Wu.","By then, some of the men Li Chaopan had brought with him had already gone back home for help.","Li Chaopan still wouldn’t stop struggling. Feng Wu smacked him on the head and almost cracked his skull open. He grimaced in pain.","Just then, they heard a taunting voice a short distance away.","“I thought the Feng clan was quite a good family, but as it turned out, their daughter is an adultress. No family would want to marry the Feng family’s daughters anymore. Tsk, tsk, how dare they try to fawn at His Royal Highness?","Shame on them!”","Li Chaopan looked up, and his eyes lit up.","“Qingxi, help me!”","It was Zuo Qingxi, the only direct descendant of the Zuo family apart from Zuo Qingluan.","Zuo Qingxi wasn’t raised by Mrs. Zuo and was always by his master’s side. He only came back to the Zuo family once in a while, so only a handful of people knew him.","But Li Chaopan did.","He was Zuo Qingxi’s only childhood friend.","Zuo Qingxi nodded and turned to Feng Wu. “Let go of him.”","Li Chaopan turned around and smirked at Feng Wu. “Do you know who he is?","He’s Zuo Qingxi, the son of the Zuo family! He’s as talented as Zuo Qingluan!","You’re doomed!”","Feng Wu glanced at her.","Li Chaopan said, “He’s a few years older than Zuo Qingluan, and he’s more capable than her now. Feng Wu, you’re about the same level as Zuo Qingluan and a Level-2 Spiritual King. You’re so dead!”","“A Level-2 Spiritual King?” Feng Wu gave Li Chaopan a strange look. That was such a long way off.","She was already a Level-6 Spiritual King, but because she had saved Bao Er, she had temporarily dropped to a Level-4 Spiritual King. Given some time, she was confident that she could make it back.","“Zuo Qingxi?” Feng Wu glanced at him. “I’ve never met him.”","What a coincidence. As soon as Zuo Qingxi went back to the Zuo family, Mrs. Zuo held him in her arms and cried. She then told him that Feng Wu had destroyed Zuo Qingluan’s True Phoenix Blood. Yes, they could assassinate Feng Wu, but it wouldn’t feel as satisfying.","Since Feng Wu had destroyed Zuo Qingluan’s True Phoenix Blood, Zuo Qingxi felt that if he couldn’t kill Feng Wu in public, there was no point in taking revenge.","That was why he was here.","He happened to run into Feng Wu and Li Chaopan, so he stepped out without hesitation.","“You’re not just a Level-2 Spiritual King.” Zuo Qingxi stared at Feng Wu. Feng Wu stared back at him. “You’re not just a Level 2 Spiritual King either..”"]},{"number":3507,"title":"Chapter 3507: You ‘re a Bully","paragraphs":["Chapter 3507: You ‘re a Bully","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“You’re not just a Level-2 Spiritual King.” Zuo Qingxi stared at Feng Wu. Feng","Wu stared back at him. “You’re not just a Level 2 Spiritual King either.”","Zuo Qingxi stared at Feng Wu. “Bring it on.”","All eyes were on Zuo Qingxi.","The news that Feng Wu had single-handedly defeated the Military Academy students had already gotten around.","Therefore, the crowd knew how capable Feng Wu was.","They were astonished when they saw that someone had challenged Feng Wu. “I’m Zuo Qingxi of the Zuo family and a Level-7 Spiritual King,” Zuo Qingxi announced.","As soon as he showed his true capability, everyone was excited.","A Level-7 Spiritual King? Really? Was he that powerful?","Zuo Qingxi stared at Feng Wu with unblinking eyes. “Do you dare to fight me?","“I’m a Level-9 Spiritual King. Do you dare to fight me?”","Feng Xun walked out from behind Feng Wu and stared at Zuo Qingxi.","Zuo Qingxi didn’t know what to say. “Young Lord Feng, why are you doing this to me?”","“What did I do to you?” Feng Xun asked arrogantly.","Zuo Qingxi said, “Young Lord Feng is two levels higher than me...’","Feng Xun crossed his arms. “You’re three levels higher than Xiao Wu. What do you say about that??”","Zuo Qingxi was rendered speechless. “If he can’t do it, can I?”","Someone walked out of the crowd.","They turned around to find a pretty teenage girl. It was Hua Wushuang.","Hua Wushuang didn’t come alone. She had brought some maids and grannies with her.","One of the grannies had bright eyes and a calm look on her face. She was anything but ordinary.","Putting her hands behind her back, Hua Wushuang strolled toward Feng Wu. She stopped in front of Feng Wu with a cold look in her eyes.","“I’m a Level-4 Spiritual King. Don’t tell me you don’t even have the courage to fight me.” Hua Wushuang smirked.","A Level-4 Spiritual King?!","The others were all surprised.","What was wrong with this world?","Why was every one of the younger generations so talented?","Why did it feel like there were so many Spiritual Kings among the younger generation?","Zuo Qingxi stared at Feng Wu and smirked. “What? Aren’t you going to accept a challenge from a Level-4 Spiritual King?”","Feng Wu glanced at him and ignored his question.","Zuo Qingxi had never been ignored like this before, and he felt awful.","Feng Wu glanced at Hua Wushuang.","Ever since she got back from Nest, she had been running into Hua Wushuang everywhere, trying to get her attention. Feng Wu wanted to ignore her, but she kept popping up.","Still, Hua Wushuang’s arrival did fit Feng Wu’s plan.","However,","Feng Wu had something else to do.","She went up to Feng Yi.","Feng Yi was trembling in Feng Sang’s arms","Feng Wu reached out and saw that Feng Yi was shaking violently.","“Are you injured?” Feng Wu frowned.","Feng Sang was infuriated. She pointed at Li Chaopan and said, “They’ve hit her with a whip! My sister is covered with whip marks! It’s so scary!”","After that, Feng Sang rolled up Feng Yi’s sleeve and exposed half of her arm to Feng wu.","The marks were clear and bloody...","“They’ve gone too far! Not only did they slander my sister, but they also humiliated her after they divorced her! That’s outrageous!”","Before she knew it, Feng Sang found Feng Wu to be the pillar of the family. She probably didn’t realize it herself.."]},{"number":3508,"title":"Chapter 3508: Stop Lying to Yourself","paragraphs":["Chapter 3508: Stop Lying to Yourself","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Sang couldn’t wait to tell Feng Wu what had happened. Feng Wu nodded.","“I see.”","She then turned to Feng Yi. “What do you want?”","Feng Yi stared at Feng Wu in bewilderment.","She wondered if she was hallucinating. Why was everything so different from what she knew?","Eight years ago, Feng Wu was a genius. Back then, all eyes were on her, and she was the center of attention.","When Feng Yi got married, everyone called Feng Wu a good -for-nothing. Therefore, when Feng Wu’s name was mentioned, no one in Feng Yi’s family would say a thing about her.","In the past year or two, she had occasionally heard the news about Feng Wu in the Duke’s Mansion, but most of the time, it was accompanied by bad news.","Even her mother and sisters had been saying bad things about Feng Wu when they visited her in the Duke’s Mansion...","And now...","It was only a moment ago when.","Feng Sang acted as if Feng Wu was in charge of the Feng clan, and Feng Yi didn’t know how to react when Feng Sang complained to Feng Wu.","“So, do you have any requests?” Feng Wu asked earnestly.","Feng Yi looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment. Seeing Feng Wu like this, Feng Yi almost felt that Feng Wu could grant all her wishes. However, the Feng clan was clearly being bullied by Duke Li’s family, and there was nothing she could do.","Feng Wu asked casually, “How long do you need to think about it?”","Feng Yi said, “I... I... need hours.”","“Alright.” Feng Wu nodded.","Alright???","Then?","So many people had been enjoying the show, but they were suddenly told to wait.","Li Chaopan frowned and stared at Feng Wu. “What’s that supposed to mean?” He saw that Feng Wu was setting un the formation as if no one else was around.","As she set up the formation, she took out a pen and began to draw something. She looked very serious as if she was really setting up a formation to trap all of them here...","Li Chaopan was speechless. So was Hua Wushuang and Zuo Qingxi.","Immediately, everyone gave Feng Wu strange looks. They couldn’t understand why Feng Wu could ignore so many people.","Feng Yi was shocked as well. Two hours? Just like that?","Feng Sang took Feng Yi’s hand. “Sister, think about it. What do you want?” What did she want?","Of course, Feng Yi wanted everything to go away, but was that even possible?","Feng Yi didn’t know what to do from now on.","She began to cry.","Feng Sang was exasperated. She took Feng Yi’s hand and said, “Sister! Do you have any idea what’s going on here? Xiao Wu has given you two extra hours! Do you think it’s that easy? Everything you’re saying now will affect your future and the reputation of the girls of the Feng clan? Think carefully!","“Don’t tell me that you’re still delusional and want to go back to Duke Li’s family! Sister, you of all people should know what you have or haven’t done! You didn’t do anything wrong, but they can slander you and beat you up whenever they want. They can leave your child behind, they can get rid of you, and they can humiliate the Feng clan... Sister, are you still hoping that he’ll be in love with you? Wake up!”","Feng Sang’s words were like needles stabbing into Feng Yi’s head.","Feng Yi was devastated.","She wanted to deny it, but a voice in her head told her to stop lying to herself.. That was it..."]},{"number":3509,"title":"Chapter 3509: Yu Mingye Is Here","paragraphs":["Chapter 3509: Yu Mingye Is Here","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Stop lying to yourself. That’s the way it is. Li Chaopan is going to abandon you, Duke Li’s family is going to humiliate the Feng clan, and they’re abusing their power. There’s no reasoning behind it.” Feng Yi recalled how she had been framed and how Li Chaopan had dragged her out of bed and tied her up with a strange man.","She hated him so much!","Daughters of the Feng clan might be confused at first, but they were tough girls deep down.","After her initial fear, Feng Yi soon rose to her feet.","She went up to Feng Wu and asked, “Can I ask for anything I want?”","Feng Wu nodded. “Of course.”","Feng Yi asked, “Will it get you in trouble?”","Feng Wu said, Tlat depends.”","Feng Yi said, “I want a divorce!","“I don’t want to be divorced! I want to divorce him on my own terms!” Clenching her fists, Feng Yi stressed each word. “And I didn’t have an affair with anyone. He","Feng Yi pointed at Li Chaopan a short distance away. “I took a nap around noon, and he dragged me out of bed. He then tied me up with a naked man and slandered me!”","Feng Yi didn’t think that Feng Wu could make things right for her.","Feng Wu was only a girl and even younger than her. What could she possibly","Feng Yi made up her mind.","As soon as Feng Yi said that, the looks the others gave Li Chaopan changed.","Li Chaopan smirked. “That’s some backstabbing. Are all girls of the Feng clan like that? They can make such shameless claims. I can’t afford to offend someone like that!”","Feng Wu glanced at Li Chaopan. “Bring me the man who’s said to be fornicating with my sister.”","Li Chaopan was about to turn her down when Feng Wu cut him off. “If you don’t send him here to clear the name of the Feng clan... Well, I’m sure the daughters of Duke Li’s family have their own reputation to protect!”","Li Chaopan’s face darkened.","Feng Wu went on. “Even if your family doesn’t have a daughter, you still have women in your family! I have all the time in the world to play this game.”","It was a threat!","It was obviously a threat.","“Do you think your threat will work?” Li Chaopan smirked. “You’re just a petty..","“What about me?” Feng Xun stood by Feng Wu’s side and supported her.","Li Chaopan gritted his teeth.","“What if I’m included?” A cold voice rang out.","Are more people coming?","Who could it be?!","Just then, a handsome teenager showed up in front of Feng Wu and greeted her with a smile. “Hello, it’s been a while. Are you bullying someone again?”","It was...","It was Yu Mingye, whom she hadn’t seen for a while!","Feng Wu said, “I didn’t know you were still alive.”","Had it not been for Yu Mingye’s sudden appearance, Feng Wu would have forgotten who he was.","Yu Mingye had been in seclusion ever since they parted. It had been a year or two since they last met.","“Bah!”","Hearing what Feng Wu said, Yu Mingye said, “What do you mean by ‘I’m still alive’? I’ve always been fine, okay? You heartless girl. I heard that someone was after you and came all the way here to save you. Is this how you treat me?”","Yu Mingye’s words were a mixture of truth and lies, making it impossible to tell them apart.","But one thing was for sure: Feng Xun had goosebumps all over when he saw","Yu Mingye.. He immediately hid Feng Wu behind him and stared at the latter!"]},{"number":3510,"title":"Chapter 3510: Clear My Name","paragraphs":["Chapter 3510: Clear My Name","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“What are you doing here?!” Feng Xun stared at Yu Mingye with cold eyes. Yu","Mingye rolled his eyes at him. “Why can’t I come when you’re here?”","Feng Xun said, “I’m her brother!” Yu Mingye asked, “Biological brother?”","Feng Xun said, “None of your business.”","Yu Mingye said, “If not, why are you so pretentious?”","Feng Xun said, “You...”","Feng Wu rubbed her forehead.","The two of them would start fighting as soon as they met.","“Are you three-year-olds?” Feng Wu stared at them in resignation. “This isn’t the time for bickering. Control yourself, will you?”","“Hmph!”","The two teenagers moved in unison. Crossing their arms and raising their chins, they turned left and right respectively.","The crowd was speechless.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say. “Don’t you want that so-called adulterer? I’ve brought him to you.”","After that, Yu Mingye waved his hand.","An elder, who had been hiding somewhere, threw a man, who was tied up like a bundle, onto the stage.","He was quite tall, had a fair, handsome face, and his amorous eyes were teary. One couldn’t help but feel sorry for him.","Feng Wu didn’t like the look of the man at all.","The man didn’t look straight at all. If he had to have an affair with someone, it should be Li Chaopan, not Feng Yi.","Feng Wu looked at Yu Mingye.","Yu Mingye gloated. “I was here a long time ago. I couldn’t wait to come to your rescue when I saw you getting attacked. However, the head of the elders said that if I could find this person, with your intelligence, you would be able to clear the name of the Feng clan and restore your reputation. That was why I went to Duke Li’s mansion and got him out.","“Do you know who he is? Gosh, let me tell you something. His identity is quite interesting. He’s actually... Hahaha, I’ll tell you later.” Yu Mingye decided to leave someone hanging at that critical moment.","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at him.","“Is this the so-called adulterer you’re talking about?” Feng Wu asked Li Chaopan.","Li Chaopan frowned, and his face darkened.","Feng Yi recognized him. She stepped forward and said to Feng Wu in excitement, “It’s him! Li Chaopan has tied me to him! Everyone in his family knows it! No one can lie about it!”","Feng Wu smiled at Li Chaopan. “That is to say, he really is the person I’m looking for. ”","Li Chaopan said, “Let him go!”","Feng wu asked, ‘Why?”","Li Chaopan said, “My family will take care of him. Give him to me!” After that, Li Chaopan ordered his men to grab the man.","However, Yu Mingye’s men weren’t there to be trifled with.","The crown prince of the Dark Court wouldn’t let anyone mess with him.","“Xiao Wu, do you know where I found him? I don’t want to offend your ears.”","Feng Wu asked, “Where did you find him?”","Yu Mingye grinned. “From someone’s bed, of course! In broad daylight!”","Feng Wu was confused. “Are you saying that Lady Li...’","“Shut up!”","Li Chaopan’s face turned livid before Feng Wu could finish.","“Those who slander a duke’s wife will die! ” Li Chaopan gritted his teeth.","However —","Yu Mingye darted a look at him. “Did you think I brought him here because of your mother’s misconduct? How can you be so disrespectful?! What will your mother think when she knows you’ve slandered her like this?!”","Li Chaopan was speechless.."]},{"number":3511,"title":"Chapter 3511: Young Master","paragraphs":["Chapter 3511: Young Master","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Glaring at Yu Mingye, Li Chaopan tried to hit him, but Yu Mingye knocked him away with a finger.","“You can’t offend a Spiritual Overlord.” He smirked.","Li Chaopan’s arrogance was immediately extinguished by Yu Mingye and turned into endless rage.","Yu Mingye said, “Why are you staring at me like that? Did I say anything about your mother? Is she the only one in the house?”","That was...","The more he said, the more he fed other people’s imagination.","Li Chaopan wasn’t Yu Mingye’s match, and his family didn’t have any Spiritual Overlords either. Therefore, he had to turn to Zuo Qingxi for help.","However, Zuo Qingxi was only a Level-7 Spiritual King and couldn’t be compared to Yu Mingye at all. He would only get beaten up. Therefore, he didn’t dare to make any reckless moves.","Feng Xun frowned a little. Yu Mingye was so annoying. Why did he have to steal the spotlight now?","At that thought, Feng Xun shielded Feng Wu from Yu Mingye.","It just so happened that Yu Mingye was slightly more capable than Feng Xun. He walked up to Feng Xun and bumped into him, knocking Feng Xun out of the way. Yu Mingye immediately stood next to Feng Wu.","Feng Xun wanted to smack them.","However, as soon as he started waving his fists, Yu Mingye raised his chin in satisfaction. “Bring it on. What are you waiting for?”","Feng Xun said, “I’ll forgive you for that!”","Feng Wu felt a headache coming on. “...Quiet!”","“Hmph!”","They looked away from each other again.","Feng Wu rubbed her temple and decided to ignore these two brats for now, or they would drive her crazy.","At that thought, Feng Wu turned to look at the person Yu Mingye had brought here.","He was a slender teenager with fair skin. The most eye-catching thing about him was his amorous eyes. Before he said anything, his limpid eyes were already mesmerizing.","Feng Wu asked indifferently, “What’s your name?”","The person on the ground ignored Feng Wu.","Because to him, the Feng clan was simply too weak. Their daughter was nothing!","But this time, he had messed with the wrong person.","Before Feng Xun could scold him, Yu Mingye marched up to him and kicked him in the chest with the toe of his boots!","“We’re talking to you! Are you deaf?!”","His bellow gave everyone the creeps, and the young man trembled in fear.","Yu Mingye was so terrifying... He really wouldn’t think twice before killing someone.","He shuddered at the thought of the people killed in Duke Li’s manor and looked at Yu Mingye with his limpid amorous eyes. “Lian Sheng, my name is Lian Sheng..","“What an ugly name!”","Yu Mingye hated it when a man pretended to be pitiful. Hence, he kicked Lian","Sheng again, sending him flying back until he landed right next to Li Chaopan. Li Chaopan grabbed him and asked anxiously, “Are you alright?”","Lian Sheng wrapped his arms around Li Chaopan’s waist and cried. “Young","Master, help me.”","Li Chaopan nodded solemnly and gently put him on the ground.","After putting Lian Sheng down, Li Chaopan realized what he had done when he saw the stunned looks on everyone’s faces.","He looked up at Feng Wu and saw the smirk on her face.","What was going on..","He seemed to have done that involuntarily when he should have kept it a secret...","Lian Sheng looked like he had been drugged. He stopped pretending and grabbed Li Chaopan’s hand.."]},{"number":3512,"title":"Chapter 3512: Don ‘t You Want Me Anymore","paragraphs":["Chapter 3512: Don ‘t You Want Me Anymore","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lian Sheng acted as if he had been drugged. He stopped pretending and grabbed Li Chaopan’s hand. Li Chaopan wanted to throw his hand off. After all, everyone was watching.","However, Lian Sheng had been standing timidly behind him. He was half a head shorter than Li Chaopan and looked so fragile that he could be blown away by a gust of wind. He was much weaker than a girl.","Li Chaopan threw off his hand.","He looked at Li Chaopan with teary eyes. “Young Master, don’t you want me anymore?”","Holy crap!","That was too much information!","No one here was an idiot. They all saw what was going on.","Especially the Feng family.","Feng Yi stared at Li Chaopan and Lian Sheng in disbelief. Suddenly, she covered her mouth with both hands and burst into tears.","She stared at Li Chaopan in disbelief, and her pale lips trembled with agitation.","“I remember now! Last time in the east wing, when I pushed the door open, you were rolling around in bed with someone. You hid that person behind your back and scolded me... I... I didn’t know you had a boy toy!","“Li Chaopan, you have a male lover, but you’re slandering me for having an affair with him! You even tied him and me together! Not only that, but you’re also divorcing me and slandering the reputation of the Feng clan! Li Chaopan, you deserve to die!”","A moment ago, Feng Yi still had feelings for Li Chaopan, so she was on his side.","But now that Li Chaopan was exposed, she could see how mean he was. She was furious!","Li Chaopan wanted to run up to her in anger, but Lian Sheng behaved as if he had taken the truth serum. He had revealed all the truth. “Young Master, do you really not want me anymore?”","Li Chaopan kicked him in a rage.","Lian Sheng fell to the ground and burst into tears. Scrambling to his feet, he ran toward the door, saying, “I’ll go talk to Duke Li!”","Li Chaopan wanted to kick him again.","However, Yu Mingye’s men stepped out and stopped Li Chaopan.","Yu Mingye grinned at him. “Why, he said he was going to ask your dad for help. Why are you so worried?”","Li Chaopan wanted to flee, but Yu Mingye stopped him. “Where do you think you’re going? You broke off your marriage with the daughter of the Feng family, and you’re running away now?”","Turning around, Yu Mingye looked at Feng Wu. “If I were you, I’d go tell the emperor now.”","Feng Wu nodded. “That’s what I was thinking.”","With a wave of his hand, Yu Mingye said, “Take Li Chaopan and this man with you. Let’s go to His Majesty now. Hey you. Are you from Duke Li’s mansion?","You should grab your master right now.”","Someone had already gone to look for Duke Li.","Meanwhile, Li Chaopan’s face was livid.","He didn’t want His Majesty to hear about it, because Duke Li’s family was indeed in the wrong.","Yu Mingye was completely unreasonable, so Li Chaopan didn’t want to talk to him. Hence, he turned to Feng Wu. “May I have a word with you?”","Feng Wu said, “Do tell.”","Li Chaopan whispered something to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked at him in bewilderment.","Li Chaopan bent down and whispered something else.","Feng Wu said, “What? You’re going to give me 10,000 taels of silver so that I can stay out of this?”","Ssss —","Everyone stared at Li Chaopan.","Li Chaopan said, “I didn’t say that!”","However, the others weren’t blind and could make their own judgments. They all found Feng Wu’s words much more credible.."]},{"number":3513,"title":"Chapter 3513: Your Request","paragraphs":["Chapter 3513: Your Request","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Li Chaopan had no idea what to do with Feng Wu, while Feng Yi looked at Feng Wu in disbelief.","Feng Wu’s reaction surprised her.","How could she be so confident? Moreover, things had really changed as she had said. In fact, the Feng Clan had gained the upper hand.","Feng Wu looked back at Feng Yi.","Feng Sang pulled Feng Yi over immediately.","Feng Wu looked at Feng Yi seriously. “What do you think?”","Feng Yi asked, “What do you mean?”","Feng Wu said, “You have a few options now. The first one is to go back with Li Chaopan and continue your path as the daughter-in-law of Duke Li. You’ll have to put up with your husband who doesn’t treat you as a human and will continue to sleep with his toy boy. It’ll be a mess.”","The faces of the people from Duke Li’s family darkened, but no one dared to refute Feng Wu because what she said was true.","Feng Wu said, “The second option is divorce. Li Chaopan wanted to divorce you by kicking you out, but we can turn this into a fair divorce. You’ll take the initiative to propose the divorce and take the dowry back. From then on, we’ll have nothing to do with Duke Li’s family.”","Feng Wu said, “You only have five minutes left. Make the choice now.”","Feng Yi said, “I, I... Can I still choose now? Do I still have the right to do that?”","“I don’t want to implicate my sisters... The Feng clan’s reputation must be restored. As for myself, it doesn’t matter.","“Back then, I was blind enough to choose Li Chaopan myself. In the end, he turned out to be such a despicable person. I don’t have any other thoughts in my life. I only want to take care of my parents and raise my children at home. From then on, I won’t have anything to do with the outside world.","“I’d rather die than go back to that family, but my son is still there. I can imagine what kind of a person they’ll raise him into. Xiao Wu..","Feng Yi looked at Feng Wu pleadingly.","She knew very well that her father, mother, and siblings couldn’t help her, except for Feng Wu.","At that thought, Feng Yi looked at Feng Wu pleadingly again. “Niuniu and Guangguang are both my children. I can’t bear to see a little boy stay in a place like that. I’m not asking to change his surname to mine, I just want to raise my son and daughter myself.”","Feng Wu summed it up for her. “So, your request is: 1. You’ll propose a divorce and take back your dowry. 2. The Feng clan’s reputation will be restored, and so will be yours. 3. Your son will return to you. 4. No one in Duke Li’s Mansion will be allowed to harass you.”","Feng Wu’s request was even more demanding than Feng Yi’s, so she looked at Feng Wu in a daze.","Feng Wu asked, “Is that all?”","Feng Yi said, “Yes, but...”","She didn’t even dare to hope that Duke Li’s family would stop harassing her. She was already prepared for a long-term confrontation.","Feng Wu turned to Li Chaopan. “Did you hear that?”","She was very busy and wanted to get this done as soon as possible.","However, Li Chaopan sneered. “That’s impossible.”","Feng Wu looked at Yu Mingye.","Yu Mingye understood right away. “Let’s go and report to the emperor.”","With that, he picked up Li Chaopan and headed for the imperial palace as if he was handling a chicken.","Feng Wu followed him, so did Feng Yi, still looking confused.","Lady Wang never came out.","Neither did Feng Yanfeng.","Feng Wu, Feng Sang, and even Feng Yiran knew Feng Wu was here, but the two people had never come out.","“Master, Madam, what should we do now?”","Feng Yanfeng and Lady Wang didn’t come out, but they watched from outside.."]},{"number":3514,"title":"Chapter 3514: Case Closed","paragraphs":["Chapter 3514: Case Closed","Feng Yanfeng was a little embarrassed when he heard what the steward said. What happened outside was such a big deal.","In fact, he wanted to go out at first, but the people from Duke Li’s family were too fierce and domineering. He was afraid that he would be beaten up if he went out... Who knew that things would turn out like this?","Seeing that Feng Wu had the upper hand, Feng Yanfeng wanted to come out, but Lady Wang told him that Feng Wu might still lose.","In the end, the couple hid behind the door and peeked out through the crack until Feng Wu and the others left.","Feng Yanfeng wanted to come out, but the people outside wouldn’t leave.","Not only that, but they also sat on the ground and chatted in groups of twos and threes.","Everyone was guessing who would win.","They were sitting here just to wait for an outcome.","Initially, they thought that they would wait for a long time. Some people even brought over stools, and street vendors were already selling drinks and snacks. However, they never expected that they would have the outcome so quickly.","An hour later, Feng Wu returned with Feng Yi.","The people from Duke Li’s family moved Feng Yi’s dowry into the Feng clan in large carriages.","The crowd was astonished.","Even Feng Yanfeng himself was shocked, let alone the onlookers.","When Feng Yi married back then, did she have so much dowry? He didn’t think so.","Hence, Feng Yanfeng walked out. Before he could ask, Feng Sang shouted angrily, “Father, you’re finally here!”","Feng Yanfeng was embarrassed.","He was the braver one. His wife still didn’t dare to come out!","“What’s going on?” Feng Yanfeng asked with a straight face, pretending that he had just come back.","The surrounding people started to talk among themselves.","“Did Master Feng just come back?”","“We’ve been sitting here. Wouldn’t we have seen him come back?” “Maybe he came in from the back door?”","“It’s not like we don’t have people sitting there. I didn’t hear them say anything.”","Feng Yanfeng blushed at the discussions around him.","But he pretended not to hear anything and just looked at Feng Sang.","Feng Sang didn’t know whether it was true or not. Fortunately, although Feng Yanfeng didn’t show up, the Feng clan still benefited greatly.","Hence, Feng Sang told Feng Yanfeng what had happened in court.","It would also give an explanation to the onlookers.","It turned out that Li Chaopan still wanted to argue after they got there, but Feng Wu and Yu Mingye threw evidence at him one after another. Duke Li and Li Chaopan were both dumbfounded.","If he continued to quibble, he was afraid that more information disadvantageous to Duke Li’s family would be revealed. In the end, Duke Li had to admit defeat.","He asked Li Chaopan to welcome Feng Yi back and pretend that none of this had happened.","However, Feng Yi wouldn’t have it and insisted on a divorce.","Feng Sang found it strange. His Majesty, who was supposed to be dignified, looked so kind when he saw Feng Wu. Even her father didn’t treat her so kindly. His Majesty’s verdict was exactly the same as Feng Wu had requested.","He granted Feng Wu’s all requests.","Therefore, in less than two hours, the lawsuit that had reached the emperor was closed. The Feng clan won, and Duke Li lost.","As Feng Sang spoke, her cadence rose and fell, and she reenacted everything that had happened in the throne room.","“I really didn’t expect Duke Li’s family to be so vicious!” “Their family is really in a mess. And that Lian Sheng, tsk tsk...’"]},{"number":3515,"title":"Chapter 3515: Yu Mingye (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3515: Yu Mingye (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Sang said proudly, her face glowing.","This time, she could really hold her head high.","Feng Sang couldn’t help but look at Feng Wu when she told the story.","She had discovered the truth.","She had been miserable when she was Feng Wu’s enemy, but it was great when she was Feng Wu’s teammate!","When Feng Sang finished, Feng Yanfeng gave her a strange look. “So, the Feng clan won the lawsuit?”","Feng Sang said matter-of-factly, “Of course. With Feng Wu around, we won’t lose.”","With that, the group entered the house.","At that moment, Lady Wang walked out and glared at Feng Sang. “What are you talking about?”","Feng Sang got excited. “Mother, you didn’t go to the palace. There were so many civil and military officials there, and they were all staring at us. I was so nervous, but Feng Wu kept talking and was so aggressive toward Duke Li. Duke Li was so angry that he stomped his feet, but he couldn’t do anything to her!”","Lady Wang wanted to say something, but no words came out.","She gave Feng Wu a silent look, then turned to Feng Yi.","Feng Yi’s matter was resolved just like that.","Of course, there would be future troubles, but they wouldn’t surface for the time being.","Fallen Star Yard.","Yu Mingye gloated. “What do you think? I’m good, aren’t I? If I hadn’t brought that Lian Sheng here at the critical moment, you wouldn’t have won so easily!”","Feng Wu said, “Right.”","Yu Mingye said, “Hey, what’s with that look on your face? Shouldn’t you be admiring me now?”","Feng Xun couldn’t take it anymore and glared at him. “Yu Mingye, that’s enough.”","Yu Mingye snorted. “I’m better than you right now. What, are you jealous? Then become a Spiritual Overlord like me.”","Feng Xun was so angry that smoke almost came out of his head.","He was already a Level-9 Spiritual King, and he would be able to reach the Spiritual Overlord Realm in the blink of an eye... But that still hadn’t happened. What could Feng Xun do?","He could only change the subject. “What are you doing here?”","Yu Mingye looked at Feng Xun in resignation. “Are you an idiot? Of course, I’m here to... well... save Xiao Wu!”","Feng Xun gave Yu Mingye a suspicious look.","Why did he have a strange feeling that Yu Mingye was here for something else?","“Tell me the truth!” Feng Xun stared at Yu Mingye.","It was a pity that Feng Xun wasn’t Jun Linyuan. If Jun Linyuan had said that with a straight face, Yu Mingye might have been terrified. But Feng Xun...","“What do you mean? Can’t I save Xiao Wu? Do you know how many people are watching Xiao Wu and how many Spiritual Overlords have gathered in the imperial capital to kill her?”","Yu Mingye snorted. “I’ve already said that anyone who wants to kill Xiao Wu will have to walk over my dead body!”","Feng Xun frowned. “How can your father let it go if you’re dead?” Yu Mingye said, “That’s why the Dark Dynasty is fighting for Xiao Wu this time!”","That involved a lot of things...","Feng Xun didn’t believe him. “You’re a wastrel. How could your father allow you to do that?”","Yu Mingye put his hands on his hips and said smugly, “That’s why I have to take my wife back and let my father know how wonderful the person I want to protect is!”","“Wait!” Feng Xun finally realized what he meant. “What did you just say? Your wife? Who’s your wife?”","Yu Mingye stared at Feng Xun as if he were an idiot.."]},{"number":3516,"title":"Chapter 3516: Yu Mingye (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3516: Yu Mingye (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xun said, “Are you referring to...”","Yu Mingye said, “Of course! I’ll marry no one but Xiao Wu!”","Feng Wu smacked Yu Mingye on the head. “Watch your language!”","Yu Mingye rubbed his head where Feng Wu had knocked him and looked at Feng Wu in frustration. “...I’m only telling the truth. Why wouldn’t you believe me?”","“I dare you to call her your wife again!” Feng Xun flared up. “She’s my buddy’s girl! Get lost!”","Yu Mingye wouldn’t have it. Turning around, he gave Feng Xun a hard time.","“Your buddy? Which one?”","Feng Xun was so angry that he laughed.","“Who else could it be? The one that specializes in defeating you, of course.”","Yu Mingye asked, “Are you talking about Jun Linyuan?”","Feng Xun asked, “What? Are you scared?”","Yu Mingye said, “I’m scared? Feng Xun, I’m warning you. Even if Jun Linyuan is here right now, I’ll still tell him I’m going to marry little Feng Wu.” Feng Xun smirked.","Yu Mingye said, “Stop smirking. It’s been over a year, hasn’t it?”","Feng Xun asked, “What?”","Yu Mingye said, “It’s been a year and a half since Xiao Wu came to the imperial capital from the northern border. If your crown prince really likes her, he would have married her already. I wouldn’t have had a chance.”","Feng Xun didn’t know what to say.","Yu Mingye said, “I’ve heard about Zuo Qingluan and Hua Wushuang on my way here. They’re both your Boss Jun’s soul mates, aren’t they?”","Feng Xun said, “Bullshit! It’s not like that at all!”","Yu Mingye said, “I don’t care. All I know is that when I came out of seclusion, Feng Wu was still available. She’s mine!”","Feng Xun said, “She’s my sister!”","Yu Mingye said, “Hello, brother-in-law!”","Feng Xun said, “Damn you!”","Feng Wu felt a headache coming on.","“Can the two of you stop bickering for a moment?” She looked at the two of them in resignation.","The beautiful lady was cultivating.","Luckily, she had set up layer upon layer of formation outside the beautiful lady’s room. Otherwise, the beautiful lady would have been driven insane by all the noise.","Taking Feng Wu’s left hand, Feng Xun said, “Xiao Wu, he started it! Get him out of here!”","Yu Mingye took Feng Wu’s free hand. “Honey, Feng Xun is picking on me...”","Feng Wu glared at Yu Mingye. “Shut up!” Yu Mingye said aggrievedly, “...Alright.” Feng Wu said, “Stop calling her Honey!”","Yu Mingye said, “Sure, honey...”","Feng Wu was genuinely angry now. Glaring at Yu Mingye, she said, “Yu","Mingye...”","“Alright, alright... I won’t call you that... for the time being...” Yu Mingye was a wise man, and he surrendered right away.","Feng Xun was frustrated.","Yu Mingye was so shameless... After all, he was the heir to the Dark Dynasty. How could he be so shameless? He was as enthusiastic as a hungry dog when he saw Xiao Wu.","What was more, no matter how Xiao Wu scolded him, he would always say yes with a smile and would do whatever he wanted later.","If Boss Jun was shameless enough to do that, he would have married Feng Wu already.","It just so happened that Feng Wu seemed to fall for it. Although she had scolded Yu Mingye, she still treated him differently.."]},{"number":3517,"title":"Chapter 3517: Yu Mingye (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3517: Yu Mingye (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xun looked up at the blue sky in resignation. The more he thought about it, the more reluctant he became.","He was lost in his thoughts for a while. When he turned around, he saw that Yu Mingye had been following Feng Wu around and doing everything for her.","Feng Wu wanted to water the plants, so he fetched some water.","Feng Wu wanted to wash her hands, so he fetched the basin right away.","Feng Xun was rendered speechless.","How shameless! Feng Xun thought to himself in frustration. But Yu Mingye was following Xiao Wu everywhere now. As the saying went, a man would change a stubborn woman in the end. What if Xiao Wu was taken away by him?","Feng Xun had been so confident in Boss Jun, but when he recalled that it had been over a year since Boss Jun tried to court Feng Wu, he panicked a little.","“Come out with me!”","Feng Xun walked up to Yu Mingye and threw a dirty look at him.","Of course, Yu Mingye wouldn’t leave. He wanted to stay with his sweet, adorable girl.","However, Feng Xun reached out and dragged him away.","Feng Wu rubbed her forehead.","Finally, she could have some peace.","Feng Wu sat down on a chair, rested her hands on the table, and racked her brain.","She had heard from Emperor Wu that the ancient pill recipe that could control the mind of a Spiritual Overlord was in the Hua clan.","The pill known as Intelligence Reduction Pill had been in Flower Valley for a long time.","Emperor Wu told Feng Wu that the Hua clan wanted to use this ancient pill recipe as Hua Wushuang’s dowry.","The Intelligence Reduction Pill...","If Feng Wu could get her hands on this pill recipe and make some pills, she would be able to solve a lot of problems.","That pill recipe had to be with the Hua clan now.","But how was she going to get it?","She wished that Hua Wushuang was here.","Wait. Feng Wu suddenly remembered that she had forgotten about Feng Yi. Hua Wushuang had indeed shown up before, but then, she seemed to have left with Zuo Qingxi.","She could work on Hua Wushuang.","At that thought, Feng Wu headed for the door. As soon as she walked out of the courtyard, she saw Feng Xun and Yu Mingye crouching under the grape trellis, their heads together and whispering to each other. If she didn’t know them well, she would have thought that they were best friends.","“Hon...”","Yu Mingye ran happily to Feng Wu’s side, but Feng Wu stopped him with a stern look before he could say anything.","Ouch...","Yu Mingye lowered his head right away. “Alright, alright. I won’t call you that now. We’ll have all the time in the world.”","Feng Wu couldn’t be bothered to argue with him anymore...","“I need your help with something,” Feng Wu told Yu Mingye.","Yu Mingye gloated right away. If he had a tail, it would be wagging now.","He gave Feng Xun a gloating look as if he had become the chosen one. Feng Xun ignored him.","Feng Wu whispered something in Yu Mingye’s ear.","Yu Mingye smacked his own head. “Don’t worry. I’ve done everything you asked of me, haven’t I.”","After that, Yu Mingye darted a look at Feng Xun and marched off.","Feng Xun was rendered speechless.","He turned to Feng Wu in bewilderment. “What did you ask him to do for you?”","Feng Wu smiled. “It’s a secret.”","Feng Xun was displeased. “You two have a secret!”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “Can’t we have secrets?”","Feng Xun said in a serious tone, “Boss Jun won’t like it!” Feng Wu almost lost her temper at Feng Xun’s words.."]},{"number":3518,"title":"Chapter 3518: Yu Mingye (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3518: Yu Mingye (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Your Boss Jun will be unhappy? Why should I care how unhappy he is? I can’t have friends because he’s unhappy?","Feng Xun said, “That’s not what I meant...”","Feng Wu said, “My friend came all the way here to protect me when he heard that I was in trouble. I know you don’t care, but I appreciate it.”","Feng Xun didn’t know what to say. Feng Wu asked, “Where’s your Boss Jun now?”","Feng Xun didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu said, “Apart from having an affair with Hua Wushuang, what else did he do?”","Feng Xun said, “But Hua...” Boss Jun wasn’t the one who had created that rumor.","Feng Wu smirked. “Isn’t Hua Wushuang your Boss Jun’s idea? Why is he attracting girls all the time? After Zuo Qingluan, there’s Hua Wushuang. What? Does he want to have as many women as his father does?”","Feng Xun felt a headache coming on...","He had no idea that his sister could be so jealous.","“I can’t argue with you, but from what I know about Boss Jun, he has to be absent for a reason!","“But you really shouldn’t get too close to Yu Mingye. It’s for Yu Mingye’s own good.","“You know, Boss Jun used to kill people without batting an eyelash. He only became a normal person because of you.","“Do you realize he can kill Yu Mingye in a fit of rage?”","Feng Wu threw a dirty look at Feng Xun. “Yu Mingye is my friend.”","Feng Xun said, “Alright, alright. Boss Jun is your friend as well, isn’t he?”","Feng Wu asked, “What do you think?”","Feng Xun ran off in frustration.","He was afraid that he wouldn’t be able to control himself if he stayed here any longer.","Crossing her hands behind her back, Feng Wu walked out of the courtyard and spotted someone. Feng Yanfeng?","Her uncle?","Feng Wu stared at Feng Yanfeng with an indifferent look on her face.","Feng Wu had always had conflicted feelings toward that family.","Feng Yanfeng had been very nice to her when she was the little genius, but after her True Phoenix Blood was destroyed... Come to think of it, Feng Yanfeng’s family had something to do with it.","Feng Yanfeng cleared his throat. “I haven’t thanked you for what happened to","Yiyi..","Feng Wu stared at Feng Yanfeng and said indifferently, “I’m doing this for myself. The reputation of the Feng clan’s daughters will be ruined, and I’ll be incriminated.”","Feng Yanfeng glanced at Feng Wu. What reputation? If she really cared about her reputation, she would have stood up for herself when they tried to slander her.","“Anyway... I owe you one,” said Feng Yanfeng earnestly.","Feng Wu said indifferently, “I destroyed Zuo Qingluan’s True Phoenix Blood.” Feng Yanfeng stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","Feng Wu said, “She destroyed my True Phoenix Blood back then, so it’s only fair that I destroy hers now.”","Feng Yanfeng said, “Aren’t you afraid that the Zuo family...”","Feng Wu smiled. “The Zuo family isn’t the only one.”","Feng Yanfeng asked, “Wh- what do you mean?”","Feng Wu said indifferently, “The Firmament Palace has put a price on my head. All Spiritual Overlords in the world can hunt me down.”","Feng Yanfeng almost fell to the ground.","He managed to remain standing, but he was scared out of his wits.","“Are you kidding me?”","Feng Wu said earnestly, “I’m not joking..”"]},{"number":3519,"title":"Chapter 3519: Love Rival (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3519: Love Rival (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Yanfeng said, “But...”","Feng Wu said, “Zuo Qingluan was the culprit who destroyed my True Phoenix Blood. So, who was the accomplice? For example, who lured me out of the Feng clan and told the Zuo family about me?”","Feng Yanfeng blanched. “It was... Feng Liu...”","Feng Wu said, “I know that Feng Liu is involved, but since she’s dead, we can forget about what happened back then. As for the people who are still alive...”","Feng Yanfeng’s face turned pale again.","Feng Wu glanced at him. “I’ll see how they react when all the Spiritual Overlords are after me.”","After that, Feng Wu walked out.","She was very fast and disappeared in the blink of an eye.","Frightened by Feng Wu, Feng Yanfeng ran back to his courtyard after Feng Wu left.","This world was too terrifying...","Feng Yanfeng announced that his family was in seclusion, and no one was allowed to leave the yard, let alone set foot in Fallen Star Yard any time soon.","Feng Wu knew Feng Yanfeng was terrified.","She smiled when she saw Feng Yanfeng lock his family up in their own courtyard.","Without the people from the main branch loitering around, the success rate of her next plan would be much higher.","It didn’t take long for Yu Mingye to return, followed by Hua Wushuang.","“Don’t run! Stop right there!”","Hua Wushuang pointed her sword at Yu Mingye.","Yu Mingye made a face at Hua Wushuang as he ran. “Ugly girl, how dare you compare yourself to Xiao Wu? How dare you!”","Feng Wu finally understood why Hua Wushuang was so mad at Yu Mingye.","Yu Mingye was still gloating as he ran. “I’m a Spiritual Overlord. Do you think you can catch up with me? Ha!”","Feng Wu rubbed her forehead. Yu Mingye was like a four-year-old.","Hua Wushuang was furious. She couldn’t catch up with Yu Mingye, but she saw Feng wu.","She was enraged when she saw her love rival.","Hua Wushuang didn’t chase after Yu Mingye anymore. She jumped off the wall and stood in front of Feng Wu.","At this moment, the two of them were standing at the entrance of the Feng clan. It was the place where everyone had gathered to watch Li Chaopan’s incident the day before.","The Feng clan used to be very prosperous, so the entire street was the family’s property. The road at the entrance was a hundred meters wide, which was why it could accommodate so many people.","Not far from the entrance of the street, there were all kinds of shops. It was a bustling scene.","Hence, when Hua Wushuang and Feng Wu stood opposite each other, they attracted a lot of attention. Everyone stopped and looked at them.","Hua Wushuang stared at Feng Wu. “Feng Wu, what are you doing?!”","Feng Wu gave her a half-smile. “Interesting. Yesterday, Duke Li’s family came to pick on us, and now it’s the Hua family’s turn. Do you all think we’ll just take it without fighting back?”","For a moment, everyone’s attention was on Hua Wushuang.","Hua Wushuang saw herself as a pure and innocent fairy. She couldn’t stand being stared at by so many people?","She stared at Feng Wu. “Hand over Yu Mingye or I’ll kill you!”","Feng Wu gave her a half-smile. “That’s interesting. Yu Mingye is a Spiritual Overlord. Do you think I can order him around? Miss Hua, do you really have no idea how powerful he is?”","Hua Wushuang was stumped by Feng Wu’s words.","How could she not know? She had only seen how obedient Yu Mingye was to Feng Wu, and that was why...","“Alright, since you won’t hand Yu Mingye over, you can take the consequence yourself! ”","Feng Wu asked, “Is that so?”"]},{"number":3520,"title":"Chapter 3520: Love Rival (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3520: Love Rival (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Hua Wushuang said, “Feng Wu, I want to challenge you! Now!”","Feng Wu gave her an indifferent look. “What if I don’t accept it?”","Hua Wushuang said, “Are you scared?”","Feng Wu said, “I won’t accept an unknown challenge. If I accept anyone’s challenge. I’ll be too busy to have any time to cultivate. So, you have to give me a reason.”","Hua Wushuang said, “Because of the crown prince!”","Feng Wu looked at her indifferently. “Jun Linyuan? What about him?”","How dare she call His Royal Highness by his name! Hua Wushuang had already regarded Jun Linyuan as her husband. Hence, she couldn’t stand Feng Wu’s way of addressing him","“Do you really not know, or are you faking it?” Hua Wushuang stared at Feng wu.","Feng Wu said calmly, “What are you talking about?”","Hua Wushuang didn’t say anything. Instead, she raised her right arm and showed the two dragon and phoenix jade bracelets on her wrist.","“The dragon and phoenix jade bracelet is the symbol of a daughter-in-law of the royal family and the future crown prince consort.” Hua Wushuang lowered her voice and whispered in Feng Wu’s ear.","It was a show-off and a provocation.","After that, Hua Wushuang pulled away from Feng Wu and smiled at her. “Do you know the difference between us now?” Feng Wu asked, “So, why are you here today?”","Hua Wushuang: “To teach you a lesson.”","Feng Wu was confused. “Teach me a lesson?”","Hua Wushuang said, “I know you knew the crown prince before I did, and that he treats you differently. I even know that you were once engaged... So, don’t worry. I won’t stop you from marrying His Royal Highness, even if it’s to suit","His Royal Highness’s wishes.”","Feng Wu looked at Hua Wushuang as if she was looking at a retard.","Hua Wushuang glanced at Feng Wu arrogantly. “It’s just that I’ll be the crown prince consort, and you’ll just be the concubine.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Nearby, Yu Mingye was speechless.","The onlookers further away were all dumbfounded.","So, today’s battle was between the crown prince’s future wife and his future concubine?!","“Wait. Didn’t they say that Feng Wu is the future crown prince’s consort?”","“Can’t you tell? That Miss Hua has replaced her.”","“I heard that the Hua family is from the Flower Valley, one of the nine major clans. They’re very well-connected and have a lot of capable cultivators.","“The Feng clan isn’t what it used to be, so it’s possible that Miss Feng is no longer a consort and is replaced by Miss Hua.”","Hua Wushuang stared at Feng Wu. “Do you understand what I’m saying?”","Hua Wushuang had a granny with her, and she was Aunt Xi, who was Hua Wushuang’s personal guard arranged by Mrs. Hua.","Aunt Xi stared at Feng Wu with a grim look on her face. “Do you understand what Miss Hua is saying?”","Feng Wu looked at Hua Wushuang and sighed. “So, what on earth do you want?”","Hua Wushuang stared at Feng Wu. “I’ll defeat you fair and square and let everyone Imow that I’m better than you. I deserve to be the crown prince’s wife!”","Feng Wu looked into her eyes. “You look so aloof yourself, but why are you so shameless when it comes to men? Even Zuo Qingluan isn’t your match in that aspect.”","“You’re dead!”","Hua Wushuang couldn’t stand it when Feng Wu taunted her.","She had lowered her voice so that only Feng Wu could hear her.."]},{"number":3521,"title":"Chapter 3521: Love Rival (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3521: Love Rival (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Since the others couldn’t hear her, they didn’t know what she really was like.","It seemed that her grandmother was right. She had to defeat Feng Wu!","Without another word, Hua Wushuang shot a streak of spiritual essence at Feng Wu.","She was already a peak Level-4 Spiritual King, and she believed Feng Wu was only a junior one.","Therefore, Hua Wushuang was confident that she could crush Feng Wu with one strike.","But...","Feng Wu, on the other hand, remained where she was.","When the spiritual essence reached Feng Wu, she pressed her palms together and pushed forward.","She struck back at Hua Wushuang.","Hua Wushuang blanched.","She could sense the fluctuation of spiritual essence!","Wasn’t Feng Wu a junior Level-4 Spiritual King? How...","Thump!","Feng Wu hit Hua Wushuang in the stomach, and the latter flew backvvard.","She flew toward Fallen Star Yard.","Feng Wu had set up a formation in Fallen Star Yard, and normal people shouldn’t have been able to get in. However, for some unknown reason, Hua Wushuang had fallen in.","Anut Xi frowned.","Without another word, she struck out at Feng Wu.","However, Yu Mingye had blocked her way.","“Hey, old hag, the two girls are fighting. Why are you getting involved? Elder","One, come here!”","Yu Mingye let his elder fight Aunt Xi.","As soon as they exchanged blows, Yu Mingye realized that Aunt Xi was far more capable than he was.","Feng Wu darted a look at Yu Mingye, who nodded.","Feng Wu didn’t make any unnecessary moves. Instead, she charged at Fallen Star Yard and shouted, “Hua Wushuang, where are you going? Get up and fight again!”","Immediately after that, the sound of fighting came from inside.","But in fact...","In Fallen Star Yard.","Hua Wushuang lay on the ground and couldn’t get up.","Because Feng Wu was stepping on her.","She stared at Feng Wu in disbelief and couldn’t understand why.","How did this happen?","Why?","She had been defeated with one strike.","Why was Feng Wu so much better than her?","“Your capability...” Hua Wushuang gritted her teeth and stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu glanced at her. “Didn’t anyone tell you that I was only temporarily reduced to a Level-4 Spiritual King?”","Hua Wushuang said, “Temporarily...”","Feng Wu said, “That’s right. I became a Level-6 Spiritual King last night. Do you have a problem with that?”","Hua Wushuang said, “You’re a Level-6 Spiritual King?!”","Feng Wu smiled. “Yes, that’s right. But it’s too late to tell you now. You need to do something for me.”","What did she need?","Before Hua Wushuang could ask anything, Feng Wu knocked her out.","When Hua Wushuang woke up again, she had no idea that someone had changed her clothes.","She had changed into Feng Wu’s clothes, Feng Wu’s dress, Feng Wu’s outfit, and... Feng Wu’s face.","As for Feng Wu herself, she had become Hua Wushuang.","“I’ve fed her the energy-dissipating potion. She won’t be able to activate her spiritual essence for a while. Keep an eye on her,” Feng Wu told Chaoge and Qiuling.","Both of them were shocked by Feng Wu’s decision.","Luckily, they were used to it and soon accepted it.","With the truth serum, Hua Wushuang spat out everything she didn’t want to say."]},{"number":3522,"title":"Chapter 3522: Love Rival (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3522: Love Rival (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“I’ll be back soon.”","Feng Wu reminded her friends before Aunt Xi tried to get in again.","The next second.","“Miss Hua!”","Aunt Xi picked up Feng Wu, who was Hua Wushuang in her eyes.","“Miss, are you alright?”","Feng Wu shook her head, indicating that she was alright.","However, Aunt Xi saw the big footprints on her mistress’s chest and the swelling on her face. How could she be alright?!","“Let’s go back first. After all, this is her family’s territory.” Feng Wu reminded Aunt Xi in a low voice.","Aunt Xi was thinking about the same thing, so she led Feng Wu away and soon disappeared out of sight.","“Did you injure Feng Wu?”","When Aunt Xi rushed in, she saw someone lying on the ground. It had to be Feng wu.","Feng Wu nodded. “I’ve injured her, but I’m badly injured as well. I’ll need some time to recover.”","Seeing that the bracelets on Feng Wu’s wrist weren’t broken, Aunt Xi let out a breath of relief. “Miss, you didn’t have to do it now. You’ll have plenty of opportunities in the future. You’ll be the crown prince’s wife, and she’ll be a concubine. Wouldn’t it be better to do whatever you want to her then?” Feng Wu feigned an irritated look. “I just don’t like her!”","Aunt Xi sighed. “Well, at least you’ve vented your anger. I’m afraid your grandmother will make you go into seclusion later.”","Feng Wu didn’t speak.","Soon, they were back at the Hua manor.","The manor was luxuriously decorated, and there were hundreds of pots of chrysanthemums in the courtyard. It looked refreshing and elegant.","Tomorrow was Mrs. Hua’s birthday, and it was going to be a chance for the Hua family to get back into the upper class of the imperial capital. Moreover, the empress dowager had made that promise for the family, so Mrs. Hua took it very seriously.","Feng Wu had been very focused since she entered the manor, fearing that she might make a mistake and arouse suspicion.","Aunt Xi stared at Feng Wu. “Miss, are you badly injured?”","Feng Wu said, “I’m alright.”","Aunt Xi said, “Miss, your heart is racing.” Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","As expected, all the members of these family clans were very sharp, even Aunt Xi.","Luckily, Feng Wu had imitated Hua Wushuang well, or Aunt Xi would have seen through her.","Aunt Xi shook her head when she saw how Feng Wu put a hand on her chest all the time. “Miss, please go cultivate. I’m going to see Mrs. Hua.”","She left before Feng Wu could say another word.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She didn’t know where to go.","She wasn’t the real Hua Wushuang, so she had no idea where she lived or cultivated.","Just then, she heard a voice.","“Sister Wushuang, what’s wrong? Why are your clothes dirty?”","It was Hua Wuyu, the girl from the second branch of the Hua family.","Feng Wu hadn’t met her before and didn’t know her name.","“Sister Wushuang?” Hua Wuyu looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment. “What’s wrong?”","Feng Wu put a hand on her chest. “Ahem... I just had a fight... I’m alright.”","She didn’t look alright.","Wuyu immediately put her arm around Feng WII. “Sister Wushuang, let me help you. Lotus Pavilion you’re cultivating in is a little far from here, but the spiritual essence there is very dense. It’ll be very helpful for your recovery.”","Feng Wu nodded. “Thank you. ”","Hua Wuyu was surprised. Her sister had always been aloof and never showed her ordinary sisters any respect.. Why.."]},{"number":3523,"title":"Chapter 3523: Blood Source Crystal (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3523: Blood Source Crystal (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Hua Wuyu was puzzled, and her expression changed a little.","As smart as Feng Wu was, she was able to detect even the tiniest change in Hua Wuyu’s expression. She soon came up with a plan.","Feng Wu remembered that there was another girl in the Hua family, and she was Hua Wuji, the daughter of the second branch of the family.","Hua Wuji was as talented as Hua Wushuang, but she had been severely injured in her early years and was half-disfigured. Hence, Mrs. Hua put all her effort into Hua Wushuang.","The Hua family spared no effort in cultivating Hua Wushuang with all the cultivation techniques and resources they had. As for Hua Wuji, she seemed to have been abandoned.","Feng Wu learned about it when she interrogated Hua Wushuang with the truth serum.","Time was of the essence, so Feng Wu only knew a little. She didn’t know the details.","Feng Wu asked involuntarily, “Where’s Wuji?”","Hua Wuji was the third daughter of her generation in the Hua clan.","She and Hua Wuyu were sisters.","Hua Wuyu blanched at the mention of her sister and forced a smile. “My sister is cultivating in seclusion.”","Feng Wu said, “Grandma’s birthday is coming, but she’s still in seclusion?”","Hua Wuyu said, “My sister said she would come out in advance.”","Feng Wu said, “Bring her to me when she’s out.”","Hua Wuyu looked nervously at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu asked, ‘What? Do you have a problem with that?”","She sounded so arrogant.","Feng Wu knew perfectly well that Hua Wushuang was as arrogant as a peacock to those she knew.","As expected, Hua Wuyu wasn’t surprised by Feng Wu’s attitude. That was how arrogant Hua Wushuang always had been.","“Sister Wushuang, here’s your cultivation room...”","Hua Wuyu helped Feng Wu inside and tried to run away.","However, Feng Wu frowned a little. “Go get me some spirit stones.”","nua vvuyu 100Keu at reng wu. Discer wusnuang, you?re cne only one wno has the key to the treasure room. Didn’t you say last time that Grandma gave you the key?”","Feng Wu was greatly surprised.","Hua Wushuang must be so important to these people. She even had the key to the treasure room.","Luckily, Feng Wu was a meticulous person.","When she caught Hua Wushuang earlier, she took everything off her body, including the dragon phoenix bracelets.","Of course, she had the key that Hua Wuyu was talking about.","Feng Wu took out her key and tossed it to Hua Wuyu. “Be quick about it.”","“Yes...” Hua Wuyu didn’t dare to delay. Holding the key with both hands, she turned around and headed for the door.","Feng Wu walked out of the training room after Hua Wuyu was a few hundred meters away.","Feng Wu had no idea where the room was, nor did she know how to open it. Hence, she decided to follow Hua Wuyu.","As expected, when Hua Wuyu opened the door to the treasure room, she sensed a shadow next to her. Turning around, she saw that it was her sister.","“Sister Wushuang, why are you here... Aren’t you badly injured?”","Feng Wu glanced at her in an arrogant manner. “Do you know what’s suitable for my recovery?”","Hua Wuyu said, “Well... Blood-Clotting Pills? Top-grade spiritual stones? Or blood source crystals?”","The name popped into Feng Wu’s head, and her stomach lurched.","Feng Wu had quite a few spirit stones, be they low-grade, medium-grade, or top-grade..."]},{"number":3524,"title":"Chapter 3524: Blood Source Crystal (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3524: Blood Source Crystal (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu had all kinds of spirit stones and all types of pills.","But she didn’t have any blood source crystals.","Feng Wu had heard about blood source crystals before and knew that they could greatly benefit one’s cultivation.","However, the blood source crystal mine was very rare, and only one or two would show up every now and then in the central and western region where Flower Valley was.","As soon as they appeared, they would be bought off.","Hence, blood source crystals weren’t available on the market.","Feng Wu didn’t have any either.","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up when she heard that.","Could there be blood source crystals in the valley?","If that was the case, she would be able to recover very quickly.","Not only that, but she had also made great progress.","Feng Wu had asked Feng Xun to gather a lot of ingredients from the royal vault and was going to refine the pill. If she could find some blood source crystals now...","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up at that thought.","But she only glanced at Hua Wuyu. “I see that you really don’t know.”","After that, Feng Wu entered the treasure room first.","Hua Wuyu didn’t know whether to go in or not.","Feng Wu wasn’t familiar with this place, and she needed Hua Wuyu’s cover. Hence, she said indifferently, “Come with me.”","Hua Wuyu couldn’t ask for more.","Feng Wu walked in to find an old steward waiting for her.","The old steward had a hunched back and a stern look on his face. The wrinkles on his face looked like they had been sculpted.","“Miss Wushuang.” He greeted Feng Wu but acted as if he didn’t see Hua Wuyu.","Instead, Hua Wuyu greeted him. “Steward Zhao, my sister is injured, and I’m here to fetch something.”","Seeing Feng Wu, Steward Zhao frowned a little. “Miss Wushuang, why are you injured? Is it serious? What do you need? Do you have a note from the accounting office? Does it have your grandmother’s seal?”","It turned out that to get an object from the room, the accounting office had to write a note first before the old lady stamped it. Only then could one have permission.","“Ahem...” “Hua Wushuang” seemed to be badly injured and glanced at Hua","Wuyu.","Hua Wuyu straightened her back. “Steward Zhao, Sister Wushuang has the key to the room, and Grandma has given her full authority over it. Please don’t make fun of us. My sister doesn’t need Grandma’s seal. Other people go to my sister for her seal when they need something from the treasure room.” Steward Zhao smiled. “I almost forgot. Miss Wuyu, please forgive me.”","Feng Wu let out a breath of relief.","Luckily, Hua Wuyu had come with Feng Wu today. Feng Wu didn’t know about all the petty rules of the Hua family. Steward Zhao would have seen through her plan if she didn’t give the right answer.","As a matter of fact...","She wondered if Steward Zhao had seen through his plan. Why did he try to mislead her?","Feng Wu was suspicious, but she didn’t let it show. Steward Zhao asked Feng Wu, “Miss Wushuang, what do you need?”","Feng Wu asked, “What do you think I should get?”","Steward Zhao said, “I have something nice to recommend to you. Please follow me.”","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched, and she said indifferently, “Alright.”","Steward Zhao turned to Hua Wuyu. “Miss Wuyu, please leave.”","Hua Wuyu thought that Steward Zhao was biased toward Hua Wushuang, so she left in the end despite her reluctance.."]},{"number":3525,"title":"Chapter 3525: Blood Source Crystal (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3525: Blood Source Crystal (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Steward Zhao welcomed Feng Wu in.","In the treasure room.","The room was 200m to 300m in diameter, and there were rows of log-colored shelves in the middle. They were filled with boxes of all shapes and sizes.","Around the shelves were wooden chests.","The wooden chests were of the same size and were neatly arranged.","Steward Zhao stayed by Feng Wu’s side the whole time and said, “Miss Wushuang, since you’re injured, of course, you should have the coagulation pills and elixirs. This way, please...”","However, he didn’t get to finish his sentence.","Thump!","Thud !","Feng Wu struck out.","It had never occurred to Steward Zhao that the other party would make the first move.","He had planned to ensnare before activating a mechanism to trap her. He didn’t expect her to be so alarmed and strike first!","“Aren’t you a Level-4 Spiritual King?” Steward Zhao turned around and glared at Feng Wu.","He was stabbed in the chest.","The blade penetrated her chest, and blood dripped down from the tip of the sword.","“Who on earth are you...","“Where’s the real Miss Wushuang...”","Steward Zhao glared at Feng Wu.","He slowly walked back and leaned against the wall.","However, Feng Wu dragged him away first.","“Do you want to sound the alarm? Steward Zhao, this was bound to happen when you became so confident in yourself. You didn’t lose to me. You lost your arrogance.","“As a matter of fact, you’ve been convinced since the first time you saw me that I’m not the real Hua Wushuang, haven’t you?” Feng Wu smiled at Steward Zhao.","Steward Zhao’s eyes flickered.","That was right.","As soon as he saw Feng Wu, Steward Zhao knew that she wasn’t Hua Wushuang. Hence, he sent Hua Wuyu away on purpose and led Feng Wu into the vault.","There were alarms and secret traps in the vault, so Steward Zhao decided to lock Feng Wu up and interrogate her. However, he was too late.","Despite his capability, he was severely injured by Feng Wu’s concentrated attack.","Feng Wu was an expert in using poison, and once she got her hands on Steward Zhao, he would have no chance to fight back.","When Steward Zhao tried to set off the alarm on the wall, Feng Wu saw that it was a book.","Feng Wu didn’t have time to waste on Steward Zhao, so she sprinkled the truth powder on him.","Soon, Steward Zhao’s eyes became hazy.","“The first thing Miss Wushuang says when she comes here is always if we have anything new.","“She always asks for a booklet instead of coming in.","“That was why I knew something wasn’t right when I saw you, but I wasn’t very sure.","“So, I was going to catch you before informing Mrs. Hua. That way, I would have made a great contribution. If I told the others, the others would get a share of the credit.","“But I didn’t expect you to be so perceptive. You saw that I was suspicious of you.”","“How did you know I was suspecting you?” Steward Zhao stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu smiled. “You avoided my eyes on purpose, fearing that I might notice something wrong. Wasn’t that obvious?”","Steward Zhao heaved a long sigh. “Miss Wushuang isn’t as acute as you are... Where is she now?”","Feng Wu said indifferently, “Don’t worry. Her life isn’t in danger for the time being, but yours is.”","Steward Zhao stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu gave him a half-smile.. “Steward Zhao, are you still trying to set me up?’"]},{"number":3526,"title":"Chapter 3526: Blood Source Crystal (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3526: Blood Source Crystal (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu said, “Steward Zhao, instead of setting me up, why don’t you think about where the rest of the blood source crystals are?”","Feng Wu had already walked around the room.","To Feng Wu, who had visited the royal vault before, the things in the Hua family’s vault weren’t good enough to impress her.","There were some on the shelf as well, but Feng Wu only picked out one.","The blood crystal was the size of a pigeon egg, and it was giving off a dense spiritual essence.","Feng Wu thought to herself, “Such a small stone has the amount of spiritual essence of 10,000 top-grade spiritual stones, which shows how dense the spiritual essence is in blood source crystals.”","Feng Wu waved the blood crystal in front of Steward Zhao.","Steward Zhao shook his head. “There’s only one blood source crystal.”","Feng Wu smiled. “I think I used too little truth serum just then. Steward Zhao, you’re awake again. Please take some more.”","Feng Wu had given Steward Zhao the truth powder, which wasn’t potent enough, so she used the truth serum the second time around.","Feng Wu had sealed off Steward Zhao’s acupoints, rendering him immobile. Moreover, he had been severely injured, so he had no choice but to let Feng Wu do whatever she wanted.","Steward Zhao’s face went ghastly pale after he took the potion.","It was a potion specifically attacking one’s mind.","After being drugged twice in a row, Steward Zhao was in a trance-like state, and he was drooling again. He couldn’t control himself anymore.","Feng Wu crouched down in front of him and smiled. “Go ahead. Do you have any more blood source crystals in this vault?”","Steward Zhao didn’t say anything, but he pointed at the ground a short distance away.","The floor was smooth and spotless without any markings.","It looked so ordinary that no one would notice anything unusual about it.","Feng Wu went up to that spot and tapped the ground with her fingers.","It was indeed hollow.","That was to say, there really was something beneath!","Now that she knew what was down there, the trap wouldn’t be able to stop her anymore. She was an expert in this field.","Feng Wu deactivated the mechanism in less than a minute.","A platform of about one square meter slowly rose.","There was a black brocade box on the platform.","The brocade box was locked with inscriptions.","Feng Wu looked over her shoulder at Steward Zhao, who had regained some of his senses. Seeing the black brocade box Feng Wu took out, he looked enraged.","However, he smirked when he saw that Feng Wu hadn’t touched the inscription lock.","“That’s an inscription lock. Any inscription master below Level 8 can’t open it.","“If you destroy it by force, the brocade box will explode, and the explosion will alarm the people outside.","“There’s more.","“The brocade box is stuck to the platform, which is made from obsidian. No metal can break it, so...","“I’ll be honest with you. Inside the brocade box are the blood source crystals, and a lot of them. It’s specially prepared for Miss Wushuang so that she can break through to the Spiritual Overlord Stage.","“And you’ll never get it!”","Steward Zhao stared at Feng Wu with a malicious look in his eyes. “You only have two options now. One is to leave now, and the other is to blow up the box!”","Just then, something strange happened.","He saw Feng Wu take a strange pen out of her chest pocket and began to draw on the inscription lock.."]},{"number":3527,"title":"Chapter 3527: Successful Breakthrough (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3527: Successful Breakthrough (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The steward gave Feng Wu a strange look, wondering what she was up to.","In any case, the inscription lock on the black wooden box couldn’t be opened unless one was a Level-8 inscription master or above, and Steward Zhao would never believe that Feng Wu was such a master.","However...","There was a soft click.","This sound seemed to be specially made to mock Steward Zhao.","Feng Wu had unlocked the inscription lock, which he had thought she would never open.","“You!”","The steward watched as Feng Wu took out five blood source crystals from the box.","Feng Wu frowned. “Why are there only five?”","Steward Zhao was speechless. “Isn’t five enough? Don’t you know how valuable blood source crystals are?! Do you know how many there are in the entire Hua clan? Only five?!”","Feng Wu said, “That’s indeed not much. Where can I find more?”","Steward Zhao was so infuriated by Feng Wu that he was almost out of breath.","Feng Wu said, “This is only one of your treasure rooms, right? Where are the others?”","Steward Zhao said, ‘You...","The steward stopped breathing from his anger.","Although he was already seriously injured, he died from anger in the end. Feng Wu looked at him in resignation, trying to figure out what to do with the dead body.","Seeing the rows of wooden boxes, Feng Wu grabbed the innermost one.","It still had an inscription lock.","However, this lock didn’t need a Level-8 inscription master. A Level-7 one could open it.","Feng Wu unlocked the box, only to find that it was filled with powdered explosives.","There were barrels of them.","Each barrel weighed five kilos, and there were ten barrels in a box.","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up.","She opened a sealed barrel and felt the powder with her fingers. She realized that it was of superior quality.","If explosive powder of this level was powerful enough, it could injure a junior Spiritual Overlord.","How could Feng Wu let go of such good stuff?","Hence, she emptied the barrels of explosives and stuffed them all into her storage bag before throwing Steward Zhao into the box.","After sealing the wooden box with an inscription lock...","Feng Wu looked around.","There was an entire row of boxes by the side.","Could these boxes be...","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up.","The Hua family was already very cautious. Every box was carefully sealed with an inscription lock, but Feng Wu was a great inscription master.","Soon, she opened all the boxes, which were all filled with powdered explosives.","Needless to say, she would take them all.","She emptied all the boxes.","It was impossible to tell how long the Hua family had been accumulating the powder in the box, or what they had prepared for it... However, Feng Wu had taken all of it.","As for the wooden boxes on the shelf... Feng Wu would be staying with the Hua family for a few days, so she wouldn’t touch them for the time being.","After that, Feng Wu walked out of the room.","As for Steward Zhao...","Feng Wu had made up a good excuse for his disappearance.","That night, someone barged into the Hua family’s house at night. When they passed by the treasure room, they were discovered by “Steward Zhao”, who then rushed out... From then on, no one saw Steward Zhao again. That was a story for another day.","As for Feng Wu, she went back to her room and started refining the blood source crystals.","The blood source crystals would only be effective when she absorbed the energy in them.."]},{"number":3528,"title":"Chapter 3528: Successful Breakthrough (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3528: Successful Breakthrough (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu cultivated in the cultivation room.","Soon, she succeeded in her breakthrough.","Feng Wu had fallen from a peak Level 6 Spiritual King to a Level-4 one after saving Bao Er. Now that she had the blood source crystals, she continued to improve.","With the help of the blood source crystals, Feng Wu became a Level-7 Spiritual King.","Seeing that it was already late at night, Feng Wu went out and pretended to be Steward Zhao, then ran back to the cultivation room.","She had to find a reason for Steward Zhao to go missing and shift the blame to another family.","This was Feng Wu’s plan, and she wouldn’t use it until her plan was fully implemented.","If Steward Zhao knew that Feng Wu was going to use him as a pawn after he died, he probably would jump out of the box in anger.","Feng Wu hadn’t sat down for long when someone kicked the door open.","She looked up and saw two girls outside.","The girl walking in front was dressed in a purple dress. She looked very arrogant, and there was a trace of resentment in her eyes.","Behind her was Hua Wuyu, whom Feng Wu had met earlier.","“Sister Wushuang, I’ve brought Sister Wuji. Please be nice to each other. Don’t quarrel...”","With that, Hua Wuyu ran off like a little rabbit, leaving Feng Wu and Hua Wuji alone in the room.","Hua Wuji was just as pretty as Hua Wushuang, but there was an obvious scar on her cheek. It was very obvious and made her look ferocious and terrifying. Hua Wuji stared at “Hua Wushuang”. “Did you want to talk to me?”","Feng wu smiled. “Yes.”","One could tell that Hua Wuji was very unfriendly toward Hua Wushuang to the point of being hostile. She sat down on the chair and glanced at “Hua Wushuang” arrogantly. “I want to hear what our most promising Miss","Wushuang has to say.”","Feng Wu chose Hua Wuji because she wanted to start internal strife in the Hua family.","She played Hua Wushuangs part so that everyone would hate her.","Hence, Feng Wu glanced at Hua Wuji and spoke in an even more arrogant tone than Hua Wuji.","“Wuji, how dare you talk to me like that?” Feng Wu raised her eyebrows and looked down at Hua Wuji.","Hua Wuji was furious.","“Hua Wushuang, is this how you talk to me?!” Hua Wuji stood up instantly and glared at Feng Wu!","Feng Wu liked how things were going.","She was secretly delighted, but she didn’t show it on her face. Instead, she smirked. “What? I’m going to marry the crown prince and become the crown prince’s wife. Tell me, how should I speak to you?”","Hua Wuji’s expression became even uglier, and she threatened Feng Wu. “Wushuang, you’re really smug.”","Feng Wu smiled. “Aren’t you going to give me your blessing?”","Hua Wuji said, “Of course, I’ll give you my blessings, my dear sister!”","With that, Hua Wuji slammed the door and left.","“You’re so mean. You deliberately tried to piss her off.”","After Hua Wuji stormed out, Little Phoenix stuck its head out of Feng Wu’s space and said curiously.","Feng Wu said, “She won’t take action unless I piss her off.”","Little Phoenix urged Feng Wu, “What are you trying to do now? Tell me now. I can tell that someone is going to be in trouble..”"]},{"number":3529,"title":"Chapter 3529: Successful Breakthrough (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3529: Successful Breakthrough (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu said, “I have a plan. If the Hua family doesn’t fall into chaos, I’ll become your pupil.”","Little Phoenix said, “There are so many people after you. Why are you attacking the Hua family first?”","Feng Wu only smiled. “The Hua family isn’t the only one I’m going to attack this time.”","Not just the Hua family?","Who else?","Little Phoenix scratched its head, confused.","Also, it didn’t understand why Feng Wu had provoked Hua Wuji on purpose...","Feng Wu said, “Send Chaoge a message for me, and tell her...”","Curious, Little Phoenix did whatever Feng Wu told it to do.","After it returned, Little Phoenix couldn’t help but ask Feng Wu, “When will the answer be revealed?”","Feng Wu said, “Tomorrow.”","Little Phoenix said, “It’s that old witch’s birthday tomorrow. Many people will come. ”","Feng Wu said, “I’m counting on it. The more onlookers, the better. After all, it’s Hua Wushuang’s big day.”","Little Phoenix said, “Why don’t you look happy?","Feng Wu mumbled to herself, “Do you think Jun Linyuan will blame me for making this decision for him?”","Feng Wu mumbled to herself, “Do you think Jun Linyuan will blame me for making this decision for him?”","Little Phoenix asked, “What?”","Feng Wu said, “If Hua Wushuang doesn’t become his fiancée, do you think he’ll blame me?”","Little Phoenix poked Feng Wu in the forehead. “Are you stupid? It’s so obvious that he likes you. Can’t you tell?”","Feng Wu’s depressed face lit up. “Really?”","Little Phoenix glanced at Feng Wu and suddenly said, “Before your master wakes up, you’d better not...”","Seeing that Little Phoenix had stopped mid-sentence, Feng Wu frowned. “I’d better not... what?”","Little Phoenix said, “You’d better not fall in love with anyone else!”","Feng Wu said, “What do you mean? Who would I fall in love with? Jun Linyuan?","That’s impossible.”","Little Phoenix looked at Feng Wu as if she was a retard.","“It’s over... Although she says that she doesn’t like him, she’s probably already...’","Little Phoenix said, “If you get too close to Jun Linyuan, he’ll definitely notice your master. When that happens... You have to know that Master was once the master of the continent. Who wouldn’t want his legacy? Jun Linyuan will be a threat to Master!”","It was obvious that Little Phoenix didn’t want Feng Wu to be with Jun Linyuan.","Feng Wu said stubbornly, “Of course, I know that. That’s why I won’t be with Jun Linyuan. Don’t worry. Don’t you believe me?”","Little Phoenix murmured something.","Feng Wu asked, “What did you say?”","Little Phoenix said, “Nothing... Just remember what you said today. As for the Twelve Trials of Love, you should complete them, but don’t fall in love for real.’","Feng Wu poked it in the head impatiently. “I know. You’re so nosy.”","Why did Little Phoenix’s serious warning make her feel so uncomfortable? Feng Wu ignored the discomfort and focused on the matter at hand.","Little Phoenix knew it wasn’t a good idea to push Feng Wu too hard, so it dashed off. “I’ll see if your plan is working.”","Little Phoenix was as fast as lightning. It had recently learned how to be invisible, so no one could find it or do anything to it in the Hua clan.","Little Phoenix saw that Hua Wuji was fuming in her room. At that moment, her best friend, Dugu Yamo of the Dugu family, came to see her.."]},{"number":3530,"title":"Chapter 3530: Successful Breakthrough (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3530: Successful Breakthrough (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“What? Can my face really be treated?” Hua Wuji grabbed Dugu Yamo. “Are you serious? You’re not lying to me, are you?","“Yamo, do you know how many times I’ve had hope over the years, but in the end, I’ve always been disappointed.”","Hua Wuji burst into tears. “Do you know who hurt my face? It was Hua Wushuang! I’ve asked around. It was her!","“Back then, I was prettier and more talented than her. She secretly attacked me and injured my face! From then on, my importance in the family plummeted.","Hua Wushuang, who was originally inferior to me, had my grandma’s favor!”","Dugu Yamo was confused. “Wait. Why is your appearance related to your cultivation?”","Hua Wuji said, “My family is an exception. We’re raised to be the crown prince’s future wife, so appearance is the most important thing.”","Dugu Yamo said, “What? Your family...”","Hua Wuji said, “That’s right. That’s how we raised our daughters in the first place. Even if Feng Wu hadn’t been framed by the Zuo family, our grandma would have killed her in the end. In fact, she’s already a dead woman now.”","Dugu Yamo said, “... But... how can your grandmother be so sure that one of you will marry the crown prince?”","Dugu Yamo was a little scared at the thought of how she used to have a crush on the crown prince.","Hua Wuji said, “Our grandma has her own ways of bewitching the empress dowager. Don’t worry. The empress dowager is a fool. She’s been played by our grandma. Grandma can lie to her however she wants, but the empress dowager still trusts her.”","Dugu Yamo said, “That was a bold thing to say.”","Hua Wuji said, “I only dare to say this in front of you. Do you think I dare to mention it in front of others? By the way, you mentioned cream just now... Do you really have it?”","Dugu Yamo said, “I do have it. I bought it from someone. It’ll regain your looks after you use it.”","Dugu Yamo then took out a small white jade box.","Inside was a cream that was as clear as snow and had a faint fragrance.","“It’ll be effective shortly after you put it on.” Dugu Yamo looked at Hua Wuji. “I spent a lot of money to buy it. I’ve kept it for myself. If it doesn’t work on you, I can’t do anything about it.”","Hua Wuji, “This is a Supreme Level cream, isn’t it?”","Dugu Yamo nodded. “Of course.”","Hua Wuji said, “You know a Supreme Level medicine refiner?!”","Dugu Yamo thought to herself, “What about it? That person is actually a","Semi-divine medicine refiner, but a Supreme Level cream is less obvious.”","However, she didn’t say anything in the end. She only said to Hua Wuji, “The person I know works for that medicine refiner. I didn’t just buy the cream.","Look, there are other medicinal powders and potions.”","Dugu Yamo took out a small box from her pocket and showed it to Hua Wuji.","“This is a sleeping potion. This is a fragrance elixir. Here’s a breakthrough pill, and this is Illusory Fragrance Pill. After using it, it’s as if you’re ascending. You’ll feel like you’re floating.”","At this moment, Hua Wuji had already applied the cream to her face and was waiting for the medicine to take effect.","She said, “Actually, Hua Wushuang is already a Semi-supreme Level medicine refiner.. She... she only knows how to deal with me with her medicine! When my face recovers, I’ll definitely teach her a lesson!”"]},{"number":3531,"title":"Chapter 3531: What Does She Want","paragraphs":["Chapter 3531: What Does She Want","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","After applying the cream, Hua Wuji washed it away in less than four hours.","When she saw her face in the bronze mirror, her eyes immediately lit up!","The dark red scar had become much lighter!","She grabbed Dugu Yamo excitedly. “Oh my god, it worked! It’s real!”","Dugu Yamo was happy for her as well. She smiled and said, “It would be great if it could cure you, but...”","Hua Wuji said, “But what?”","Dugu Yamo smiled bitterly. “But your family is in a complicated situation. What if your sister hates me...”","Hua Wuji frowned. “If she knows that you helped me, she’ll definitely hate you. You don’t have to doubt that. She was the one who injured me back then and eliminated me from the competition. Only then could she be trained as the only successor of the Hua family.”","Dugu Yamo was taken aback. “Then, I...”","Hua Wuji patted her shoulder. “Don’t worry, why would I sell you out? I’m still counting on you to continue supplying me with medicine in the future. Oh right, which medicine refiner is it...”","Dugu Yamo said, “I’ll tell you later, okay?”","Hua Wuji also knew that her feud with Hua Wushuang had frightened Dugu","Yamo. She had no choice but to nod. “Alright, let’s do it in the future.”","After saying that, she smiled mysteriously. “Perhaps the next time you see me, you won’t have to be so respectful to Hua Wushuang.”","Dugu Yamo said, “She’s the future crown prince’s consort. How can we not respect her?”","Hua Wuji sneered in disdain. “Future crown prince’s consort? Just because she said so? Who gave her the right?”","Dugu Yamo knew that if she continued to listen, she would find out too much. If she knew too much, she would die.","Therefore, Dugu Yamo said goodbye.","Hua Wuji had something important to do, so she bid Dugu Yamo farewell.","What Hua Wuji didn’t know was that a small bird had watched the entire process.","It had recently learned the invisibility skill, so unless someone was much stronger than it, no one would discover its existence.","Little Phoenix went out with Dugu Yamo, then ran back to talk to Feng Wu. “You’re right. Hua Wuji is really a piece of work. She...”","Little Phoenix told Feng Wu everything it had seen and heard. In the end, it glanced at Feng Wu. “It seems that the wound on her face is Hua Wuji’s biggest weakness. Now that it’s about to be erased, what do you think Hua Wuji will do?","I’m so looking forward to it!”","Little Phoenix was born with the blood of a divine beast and didn’t need to cultivate hard at all. It only needed to fill its mouth with something with spiritual essence, then lie down and sleep. When it woke up, its cultivation level had increased... What an easy life.","That was why Little Phoenix loved gossip when it was bored. It chattered and was very curious.","Feng Wu was busy cultivating, so she sent Little Phoenix away. “If you follow","Hua Wuji, you’ll know what she’s up to.”","Little Phoenix asked, “What do you think she’ll do?”","Feng Wu smiled mysteriously. “She’s going to take Hua Wushuang’s place, of course. Apart from that, what else can she do?”","Little Phoenix rubbed its chin. “She’s a bit far away from Hua Wushuang in her cultivation, isn’t she? I don’t think she has the guts to do that yet. If I were her, I would’ve laid low for a while.. But... I’ll see for myself!”"]},{"number":3532,"title":"Chapter 3532: Father, Mother","paragraphs":["Chapter 3532: Father, Mother","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Filled with curiosity, Little Phoenix went out again. It flew around Hua Manor and listened to the gossip because it was invisible.","Little Phoenix soon saw Hua Wuji. Hua Wuji was heading to a side courtyard.","“Father,","“Mother.”","Hua Wuji threw herself excitedly into her father and mother’s arms.","Her father was Hua Wuyin, the second son of Mrs. Hua.","He looked at Hua Wuji in confusion.","Ever since that incident, this girl had always been cynical and distant from her parents. Why was she...","“Honey, why are you...” her mother asked.","“Mother, look!”","Hua Wuji had deliberately covered her face along the way. Now that she had taken off the veil, her mother saw that the red scar on her face had mostly healed, leaving only a faint line.","Her mother was shocked. “Ji Er, what’s going on...”","Hua Wuji repeated what she had said to Dugu Yamo and said, “Father, Mother, it was Hua Wushuang who set me up back then. That’s why I was disfigured! After that, Grandmother removed me from the candidate list. It was all Hua Wushuang’s fault!","“I was disfigured, but what about Hua Wushuang? She has the best cultivation resources. The old lady personally guided her, and she might even become the crown princess consort in the future. I can’t stand it!”","“So what do you want to do?” Hua Wuyin stared at his daughter.","Hua Wuji’s face was cold and solemn. “I’m just taking back what originally belonged to me!”","Her mother had been stroking her wound with a trembling hand. When she heard this, she stared at Hua Wuji. “What... do you mean?”","Hua Wuji gritted her teeth and said, “Father, Mother, didn’t you notice? Ever since Hua Wushuang was chosen as the successor, the first branch has been designated to inherit the family. All the power, resources, and connections are flowing in that direction. Father, Mother, don’t you feel that you’ve been neglected by your clansmen all these years?!”","Hua Wuyin and his wife naturally felt it, but they had already accepted this matter over the years. Now, their daughter suddenly told them that there was actually another path..","Hua Wuji sneered, “Father, Mother, now that I have the medicine to treat my face, if Hua Wushuang finds out about this, what do you think she’ll do? She’ll definitely kill me!","“So now it’s either her or me!","“If we win, our branch will soar into the sky and take over everything the first branch has.”","“What if T lose?” Hna WIIvin Stared at his daughter","Hua Wuji sneered. “If we lose, Father, you’re the old lady’s son, and my mother is her niece. I’m her granddaughter. Can she kill us?","“Moreover, Hua Wushuang did let me down back then. I still have evidence here! Previously, because I couldn’t treat the wound on my face, I’ve been enduring it. Now that I can take her down, why should I take it anymore?” “But the crown prince...” Her mother was in awe of Jun Linyuan after all.","Hua Wuji sneered. “What does the crown prince consort’s position have to do with Hua Wushuang? All of this was done by my grandmother.. Without Hua Wushuang, can’t we have a marriage alliance with the royal family?”"]},{"number":3533,"title":"Chapter 3533: Level-8 Spiritual King","paragraphs":["Chapter 3533: Level-8 Spiritual King","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Father, Mother! This path ahead of you is very likely to make you become the crown prince’s parents-in-law!” Hua Wuji was trembling with excitement.","It had been her dream since she was little to become the crown prince’s wife!","“We’ll have to think about it carefully before making a decision,” said Hua Wuyin.","His wife nodded and said to Hua Wuji, “It’ll take a while to make a decision like this. Be patient.”","But Hua Wuji didn’t think so.","“After tomorrow, Her Majesty the empress dowager will announce that Hua Wushuang is going to be the crown prince’s wife. I have to get rid of her before that happens. ”","Hua Wuji told them her plan.","One had to admit that it was vicious but effective.","It was very likely that she had been trying to set Hua Wushuang up for so many years that even Hua Wuyin couldn’t find any loopholes in her plan.","“You...”","Hua Wuyin was shocked. “That’s too bold! ”","Hua Wuji said, “I don’t care if you’re going to do it or not. I’ll kill myself if you try to stop me!”","She ran off after that.","The door closed with a bang.","This time, Little Phoenix didn’t go after them. Instead, it looked curiously at her parents and wondered what they would do.","“Master, what should we do now?” Madam Hua asked nervously. “Apart from following the girl’s plan, do you think there’s another way?”","He had already made up his mind.","He agreed almost as soon as Hua Wuji told him her plan.","Or rather, even if Hua Wuji wouldn’t do it, he would.","Because Hua Wuji was right. Back then, he and his brother were evenly matched. However, ever since Hua Wushuang was chosen, the old lady had been biased toward his brother, and all her connections had gone to the first branch of the family.","Hua Wuyin was even more awarded for the different treatment than Hua Wuji. Of course, he wouldn’t live with it.","Madam Hua smiled bitterly. “Whatever you say, my lord.”","The second branch of the Hua family reached an agreement.","Little Phoenix was amazed.","Feng Wu was such a great strategist.","All she needed was some information from Hua Wushuang, and she was able to make such an elaborate plan out of it that the second branch of the Hua family willingly jumped into that trap.","Becoming Feng Wu’s enemy was the worst choice one could ever make.","“Master, do you know how smart and cunning your little pupil is now? She was like a fairy back then... She’s different now.”","Little Phoenix went back to the room to find Feng Wu cultivating. It then lay down by Feng Wu’s feet and studied her closely.","When Feng Wu opened her eyes...","“You’re a Level-8 Spiritual King!”","Little Phoenix stared at Feng Wu in disbelief. “Is this a blessed place for you?","You were a Level-6 Spiritual King when you came in yesterday, but you’re a","Level-8 one now!”","Little Phoenix was almost in tears.","It had already cultivated once back then, which was why it could make a breakthrough every time it took a nap. However, Feng Wu had started from scratch. Was she even human?","“Hua Wushuang actually wanted to compete with you. She’s still a Level-4","Spiritual King, but you’re a Level-8 one.. What can she possibly do?”"]},{"number":3534,"title":"Chapter 3534: Mica Energy(4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3534: Mica Energy(4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Forget about Hua Wushuang. What about Zuo Qingxi...” Little Phoenix was speechless. “Wasn’t Zuo Qingxi so arrogant before? He looked like he was going to avenge that brat from Duke Li’s family, but he was only a Level-7 Spiritual","King. Can you please give these teenagers a way out?” said Little Phoenix. Feng","Wu asked in resignation, “Can I take that as a compliment?”","Little Phoenix said, “Do you think I want to compliment you? But you’re so...”","Little Phoenix took a jade stone out. Glancing at it, the bird said to Feng Wu,","“Your master’s plan for you was to become a Spiritual Overlord at the age of 15.","I told him that he was dreaming. Are you really going to prove me wrong?” Feng Wu was surprised. “My beautiful master has such a plan? Show me.”","“No.” Little Phoenix swallowed the jade stone. “It’s a secret! I can’t let you see","Feng Wu looked at it in grievance.","Little Phoenix relented right away. It gave Feng Wu an apologetic look but still insisted. “I can’t let you see it. How am I going to train you if I do?”","Feng Wu asked, “Have I met all the criteria for my cultivation?”","Tilting its head, Little Phoenix gave it some thought before giving Feng Wu a regretful look.","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched. “I haven’t.”","Little Phoenix said, “You’ve exceeded the requirement for everything else except for one.”","Feng Wu asked, “Which one?”","She would never let her beautiful master down. She had to perfect everything.","She was her beautiful master’s pride!","Little Phoenix said, “Your weapon won’t do.”","Feng Wu said, “The Fallen Star Sword is great.”","Little Phoenix said, “No, it’s not. You’ve been making progress in your cultivation, but your Fallen Star Sword has stayed where it is. How can that be good? Do you know that the Fallen Star Sword is a legendary sword at its highest level?","“With your current capability, the Fallen Star Sword can level up a few more times. A Level-5 sacred weapon is the right level.","“It’s not just that. More importantly, the Fallen Star Sword has no spiritual power”","Feng Wu asked, “Do you mean a sword spirit?”","Little Phoenix said, “The so-called sword spirit only exists when it becomes a legendary sword. By ‘no spiritual power’, I mean that the Fallen Star Sword hasn’t been tempered by chaotic energy. Have you heard of chaotic energy?”","Recalling a random book she had read before, Feng Wu asked in bewilderment,","“Is that the mica energy when the world was created?”","Little Phoenix nodded.","Feng Wu frowned. “But that energy is nowhere to be found. I haven’t seen it anywhere in years.”","“It does exist,” Little Phoenix said earnestly. “I sensed it in the manor.”","Feng Wu asked, “Here? Where?!”","Feng Wu realized the problem with the Fallen Star Sword as well.","She had been making rapid breakthroughs, but her Fallen Star Sword had never made any progress. The original swordplay couldn’t keep up with her progress, which was the biggest problem.","She was worried that if this went on, she would have to find a new sword, and the Fallen Star Sword would have to be abandoned.","“I sensed something when I ran around the manor earlier. Let’s go have a look.” Little Phoenix became serious as well.","After all, if other people knew about the mica energy, they would go berserk!","Because a weapon refined from the energy would.."]},{"number":3535,"title":"Chapter 3535: Secret Path","paragraphs":["Chapter 3535: Secret Path","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","This was because a weapon refined with mica energy would have its power amplified.","Feng Wu rushed out with Little Phoenix without another word.","Because Feng Wu was disguised as Hua Wushuang, and Little Phoenix was invisible, they had no problem running around in the manor.","It was deep into the night.","The moon was covered by thick clouds, and visibility was very low. Led by Little Phoenix, Feng Wu walked further and further away until she reached a flowerbed.","Just like their surname suggested, the Hua clan was full of flowers.","Flowers of all seasons were blooming at the same time.","Little Phoenix led Feng Wu to a low slope where red crabapples were swaying in the wind.","Little Phoenix stopped right there.","Feng Wu looked at it in bewilderment.","Little Phoenix sniffed around and told Feng Wu in the end, “It’s around here. My nose can’t be wrong.”","Looking around, Feng Wu saw that there was no one there, and the crabapples were completely different from the ones outside. They were so red that they looked like blood.","Feng Wu took out a bamboo stick.","She tapped the ground, and soon, Feng Wu sensed something different.","“The soil here is softer than in other places. It must have moved around a lot before returning to its original state. However, the inside is completely different.","Feng Wu pointed at a slope and told Little Phoenix. She searched for the mechanism as she spoke.","“I knew it!”","Feng Wu looked closely at the place where the crabapple was planted and smiled a little. “There’s something special about the location of these flowers. I wouldn’t have been able to detect the mechanism six months ago. It’s so well hidden. I think the Hua clan has a very capable formation master.”","Naturally, these major clans had accumulated a lot of talent over the years.","After some careful calculation, Feng Wu finally stomped on the ground about locm away.","Thud!","There was a crisp sound.","Crack...","As expected, the crabapple bushes parted, and a narrow door wide enough for one person to walk through slowly opened.","Feng Wu looked at the door and said to Little Phoenix, “Why do I feel that this is the exit?”","Little Phoenix nodded. “I think you’re right.”","Feng Wu said, “I don’t know how long it’ll take to get to the entrance. Let’s just go this way.”","Feng Wu and Little Phoenix entered the narrow tunnel together.","Maybe it was because of the ventilation system, Feng Wu didn’t find the place smelly.","But it was pitch dark.","To be on the safe side, Feng Wu didn’t light up the candlesticks.","She had a luminous pearl in her hand, which shone mildly in the dark.","Feng Wu walked for about 15 minutes before she noticed the light ahead of her.","“I feel it! It’s the energy of mica!”","Little Phoenix was thrilled.","Not only would it be very beneficial to the refinery, but it would also help Little Phoenix greatly, for its body could be considered a weapon as well.","“Shhh","Feng Wu stopped and gestured at the bird to keep its voice down. “Quiet.","There’s a high chance that a capable cultivator will preside over this place.”","Little Phoenix nodded.. “I can already sense the presence of a master...”"]},{"number":3536,"title":"Chapter 3536: Master","paragraphs":["Chapter 3536: Master","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","When Little Phoenix said that it could sense powerful cultivators, Feng Wu sensed it as well.","It was the intimidating energy of a capable cultivator. The aura seemed to be everywhere.","“Very powerful.’","Feng Wu took a deep breath. “If I’m guessing right, he’s at least a Spiritual Overlord. ”","Little Phoenix nodded.","Should they back out?","Little Phoenix looked at Feng Wu in silence. It would be dangerous to go in there again.","However, before they could make a decision, they heard a faint noise behind them.","The lights on the walls lit up one by one.","Feng Wu and Little Phoenix exchanged looks and both saw astonishment in each other’s eyes.","In front of them were the capable cultivators above the Spiritual Overlord Stage, and someone was coming their way. Right now, they were in grave danger!","“Let’s go!”","Feng Wu made a prompt decision and dashed off, dragging Little Phoenix with her.","They kept their footsteps as low as possible as they ran.","Feng Wu was practically floating on the ground, and Little Phoenix didn’t even dare to flap its wings.","“I can include you in my Invisibility Spell, but...”","After some hesitation, Little Phoenix told Feng Wu, “But to cover you, we’ll need a lot of shadows.’","Little Phoenix was a tiny bird, and it could cover its entire body with its mental power. However, Feng Wu was so much bigger than the bird, and if she was included...","Feng Wu lowered her voice. “Use it when it’s critical!”","However, the critical moment had arrived!","A secluded courtyard had appeared in front of the cave, and two people sat opposite each other.","Feng Wu couldn’t see clearly in the moonlight, but she could tell right away that they were two formidable cultivators that made her hold her breath!","One of them was Mrs. Hua.","Feng Wu had met Mrs. Hua before.","When she treated Bao Er, Mrs. Hua sat next to the empress dowager.","Back then, Mrs. Hua was supposed to be a wise old lady, but now, she was indeed a capable cultivator!","An old man sat across the table.","The old man was as old as a skeleton and had a scar on his face. It was a ghastly sight in the moonlight!","Feng Wu was almost out of the cave when she saw the two people look in her direction.","At that critical moment!","Little Phoenix had covered Feng Wu with its invisibility spell.","Feng Wu stuck her back to the wall and didn’t dare to move.","“Who’s there?!”","Mrs. Hua bellowed.","Just then, a figure flitted past Feng Wu, bringing with it a gust of wind. The lower hem of Feng Wu’s dress flapped in the wind, almost touching the person.","Luckily, it didn’t touch.","Feng Wu minimized her vitality and heartbeat... She looked like a vegetable.","As expected, Mrs. Hua paid no attention to Feng Wu after the person ran past them.","Feng Wu rejoiced.","Luckily, Little Phoenix had turned invisible. Otherwise, they would have disappeared from this world.","“Let’s go,” Feng Wu told Little Phoenix in her head.","Feng Wu was going to take Little Phoenix away when Mrs. Hua wasn’t looking.","However, she heard a voice at that moment.","“We must kill that girl from the Feng family this time...”","What?","Feng Wu felt a chill run down her spine.","She recognized the voice. It was Mrs. Hua.","Mrs. Hua wanted to kill her?","Hearing that someone was trying to kill her..."]},{"number":3537,"title":"Chapter 3537: Someone Wanted to Kill Her","paragraphs":["Chapter 3537: Someone Wanted to Kill Her","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Hearing that someone wanted to kill her, no one would leave now, and Feng","Wu was no exception.","Feng Wu didn’t dare to watch, for she would be spotted very easily.","She only pricked up her ears.","Mrs. Hua was giving instructions to the person that had run past her.","Feng Wu finally saw the person out of the corner of her eye. It was a middle-aged woman... She was Hua Wushuang’s maid, and Feng Wu remembered that she was called Aunt Xi.","Mrs. Hua asked her about Hua Wushuang first.","Aunt Xi told her that Hua Wushuang had lost to Feng Wu and was cultivating.","Mrs. Hua frowned and said to Aunt Xi, “Everyone wants to kill Feng Wu now, including the Zuo family.”","Mrs. Hua glanced at the old man as she spoke.","Feng Wu had been observing the old man from the corner of her eye the whole time. She noticed that the old man had listened to Mrs. Hua and was sipping his wine. He smiled when he heard that the Zuo family was going to kill Feng Wu as well.","The Zuo family!","Feng Wu was convinced right away that the old man was a member of the Zuo family and a very prominent one.","He could sit opposite Mrs. Hua. If Mrs. Hua was the head of the Hua clan, could the old man be Zuo Qingluan’s grandfather?","The Old Master of the Zuo family that Jun Linyuan had injured earlier?!","“You’re too excited, ” Little Phoenix reminded Feng Wu.","“Yes.” Feng Wu replied to Little Phoenix in her head, but she shifted a little.","“What are you doing?!” Little Phoenix was shocked.","“Why are you still moving? Aren’t you afraid of being discovered?!”","Feng Wu said, “We have to. We’ll be spotted if we stay here for too long. We need to find a place to hide.”","Feng Wu spotted a cluster of crabapples a short distance away. Hence, she snuck into the thick growth of flowers and covered herself with them.","Little Phoenix was so frightened that it didn’t dare to move or breathe.","Luckily, the powerful cultivators weren’t paying attention to them.","Feng Wu pricked up her ears and listened to Mrs. Hua.","She was furious when she heard that the Zuo and Hua families would each send out 15 Spiritual Overlords to kill her.","Both Mrs. Hua and the old master of the Zuo family thought too highly of her.","She was only a Spiritual King.","She was openly known as a Level-4 Spiritual King, although she had just become a Level-8 Spiritual King. But that was it!","Why were they sending 30 Spiritual Overlords after her?","Did they want to destroy her entire clan?","Just then, Old Master Zuo said grimly, “The Feng clan is no longer needed in this world.”","Mrs. Hua frowned and turned to look at him. “Do you want to destroy the Feng clan?”","Old Master Zuo said coldly, “If we don’t get rid of the roots, the grass will grow again.”","“Back then, the Zuo family thought too highly of ourselves and only listened to Zuo Qingluan’s suggestions. We only destroyed Feng Wu’s True Phoenix Blood, which was worth more than being killed.","“But it turns out that the Chosen One is indeed unique. She has risen in the way of the Divine Phoenix Blood. I can’t believe it.”","Zuo Chengfeng put down his teacup.","Old Master Zuo was half-hidden in his cape, and he was all skin and bones. He looked like a ghost when he removed his cape.","He smirked all of a sudden.."]},{"number":3538,"title":"Chapter 3538: Destroy the Feng Clan","paragraphs":["Chapter 3538: Destroy the Feng Clan","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“I can live with it if she rises because of the Divine Phoenix Blood, but she found another way and became close to Jun Linyuan.","Old Master Zuo stared at Mrs. Hua with a grim look on his face.","Feng Wu didn’t dare to look into Old Master Zuo’s eyes, but she heard everything he said.","Not only was Old Master Zuo going to kill her, but he was also going to destroy the entire Feng clan!","The other members of the Feng clan hadn’t done anything, and they were all innocent. How could these people destroy the entire clan just to kill her?","Feng Wu recalled all the members of the Feng clan.","The beautiful lady, Feng Xiaoqi, Qiuling, Granny Zhao, the three elders of the forbidden area, and the members of the first and third branches... There were so many lives.","However, if all 30 Spiritual Overlords rushed in together, even with the formation, the white fairy, and the help sent by Emperor Wu, Northern Feng Mansion, and Yu Mingye...","There was nothing the Feng clan could do.","‘l’ne entire Feng clan would De wlpecl out.","Feng Wu’s family had always been her taboo, and she wouldn’t let anything happen to them!","The Zuo family!","The Hua family!","Feng Wu gritted her teeth and clenched her fists so hard that her nails dug into her palms!","This was the second time in her life that she had been cornered.","“Calm down. We’ll figure something out.” Little Phoenix comforted Feng Wu. “You’re our only hope. If they beat you, no one will be able to save the Feng clan. ”","Little Phoenix was anxious as well.","Its master hadn’t woken up yet, and the master’s pupils were all over the continent. They were too far away to offer any help. If the bird had known, it would have told little Feng Wu that she had those helpers.","But its master said that little Feng Wu had to grow on her own and couldn’t help her too much.","Meanwhile, Mrs. Hua was still talking to Zuo Chengfeng.","“What’s her relationship with Jun Linyuan?” Mrs. Hua asked.","Zuo Chengfeng smirked. “Why would a genius like Jun Linyuan be trapped by love?”","Mrs. Hua nodded. “I’m only worried that Jun Linyuan will be displeased afterward.’","Zuo Chengfeng was sure that Jun Linyuan would be displeased and would take his revenge, but when that happened, he would be aiming at the Hua family, not the Zuo family.","That was why Zuo Chengfeng wanted to work with Mrs. Hua to get rid of Feng wu.","Because he had been beaten up by Jun Linyuan, he knew that he couldn’t kill Feng Wu himself. He had to have a scapegoat.","Now that the empress dowager had betrothed Hua Wushuang to Jun Linyuan, Jun Linyuan would only come to the Hua family afterward, thinking that they were the culprits. That was what Zuo Chengfeng had in mind.","Although Mrs. Hua didn’t know that Jun Linyuan had beaten up Zuo","Chengfeng, she was smart and vigilant. She stared at Zuo Chengfeng and asked, “Have you fought Jun Linyuan before? Who won?”","That smart old hag! She had been smart back then, but she was even smarter now!","Zuo Chengfeng snorted inwardly, but he said matter-of-factly, “Yes, we did fight, but no one won.”","Mrs. Hua said, “That is to say, you’re not as good as him.”","Zuo Chengfeng said, “You!”","Mrs. Hua said, “I know you well. If you say no one won, then he’s definitely better than you.”","Zuo Chengfeng was furious. That old hag!","Mrs. Hua chuckled. “He’s indeed good enough to be my grandson-in-law..”"]},{"number":3539,"title":"Chapter 3539: Treasure Hall","paragraphs":["Chapter 3539: Treasure Hall","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Mrs. Hua chuckled. “He’s indeed good enough to be my grandson-in-law.” Zuo Chengfeng glanced at her but didn’t say anything.","Mrs. Hua asked, “When do we do it?”","Zuo Chengfeng asked, “How about right after the birthday?”","Mrs. Hua nodded. “Deal.”","“Hua Yuerong, I didn’t know you could find the mica energy.” Zuo Chengfeng stared at Mrs. Hua.","Once they reached an agreement, they became much closer.","Mrs. Hua smiled. “Mica energy is indeed hard to find, but it’s not impossible. What? After all these years, you still haven’t accumulated any?” Mrs. Hua took a wooden box out of her sleeve as she spoke.","The wooden box was opened, and a wisp of smoke rose out.","Zuo Chengfeng was infatuated.","However, Mrs. Hua seemed to be baiting him. When the air rose, she waved her hand, and all the air went back into the ordinary-looking box.","While Zuo Chengfeng watched enviously, Mrs. Hua said to Aunt Xi, “Put away this box.”","Aunt Xi said respectfully, “Yes.”","She walked up to the box, took out a thick white felt, and carefully put it away.","“Put it in the treasure hall,” said Mrs. Hua indifferently.","Aunt Xi nodded and left the room.","When she walked past a cave, she suddenly felt something and reached out to grab something in the air.","It was right where Feng Wu had been.","Feng Wu would have been exposed if she hadn’t left that spot.","Luckily, Aunt Xi didn’t catch anything.","She left without hesitation.","Feng Wu was greatly relieved.","“I can’t hold on much longer...” Little Phoenix struggled to speak.","Feng Wu looked into her mind and saw that the usually carefree bird was covered in sweat and was obviously exhausted.","She couldn’t stay here any longer.","Hence, Feng Wu carefully made her way out.","Feng Wu was very cautious as she followed Aunt Xi.","She only dared to land her feet when Aunt Xi did and catch her breath when","Aunt Xi breathed.","As expected...","When Feng Wu did that, the two Spiritual Overlords didn’t notice her.","Feng Wu didn’t let her guard down after she entered the tunnel.","There were so many capable cultivators here that she felt as if she was walking on thin ice. One wrong move and she could lose her life.","Once that strange feeling was eliminated, Aunt Xi didn’t think about it anymore.","After all, there was no way that anyone could have been lurking around the two powerful cultivators, not to mention that Aunt Xi couldn’t find them anywhere.","There were two forks in the tunnel.","One led to Mrs. Hua’s courtyard, and the other led to the treasure hall.","The two of them were only a few kilometers apart, and it only took them a few seconds to cover the distance.","Aunt Xi took a key out of her chest pocket and opened the door to the treasure hall.","“I can’t hold on much longer...” Little Phoenix swayed and almost fainted.","“Hold on! Just hang in there a little longer! We’ll be in the treasure room in no time.” Feng Wu comforted the cub in a low voice.","Aunt Xi probably realized how popular the object was.","Without hesitation, she took out a strange key, put it in the keyhole, and unlocked it with a password and three inscriptions..."]},{"number":3540,"title":"Chapter 3540: Clear Out","paragraphs":["Chapter 3540: Clear Out","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Aunt Xi opened the door to the vault in one go. What she didn’t know was that Feng Wu arrived as soon as she did.","Once inside, Feng Wu hid in a secluded corner.","Little Phoenix couldn’t hold on much longer. The Invisibility Spell disappeared as soon as Feng Wu hid herself.","If Aunt Xi turned her head now, she would immediately spot Feng Wu.","Unfortunately,","Aunt Xi was too absorbed in the box to notice that someone had followed her in.","Right now, Aunt Xi was carefully holding the small box as if she was holding a baby.","She didn’t know what button Aunt Xi pressed, but there was a click.","There was a faint sound.","Feng Wu looked out of the gap and saw that Aunt Xi had opened a row of bookshelves.","She then took a book out of the shelf.","After she opened the book, Feng Wu read it under the moonlight, only to find that it was hollow.","Aunt Xi put the small box into the book, then put the thick book back on the shelf.","She stepped on one of the pillars on the shelf, and there was a cracking sound.","The bookshelf turned over and fit perfectly in.","It looked like an ordinary white wall.","Feng Wu wouldn’t have noticed it if she hadn’t seen Aunt Xi flipping the wall around.","Aunt Xi didn’t leave right away after that. Instead, she took out a thin piece of cloth and began to clean the room inch by inch.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She wanted to get Aunt Xi to leave as soon as possible, but it felt like Aunt Xi was staying here forever. It took her an hour to clean all the secret compartments...","That was right. Aunt Xi had opened all the secret compartments when she wiped the shelves.","If Feng Wu hadn’t known that Aunt Xi was her enemy, she would have thought that Aunt Xi had opened everything on purpose so that Feng Wu would know where the good stuff was and how to open the doors.","An hour later, Aunt Xi was finally done. She straightened her clothes and pushed the door open.","Finally...","Feng Wu let out a long breath.","Aunt Xi was really something.","Although she had opened all the secret compartments, she had also set up all the traps after she wiped them clean.","Traps came one after another. If an unsuspecting person entered the hall, they would trigger all the alarms. Even someone as capable as Zuo Chengfeng might not be able to avoid all of them.","Aunt Xi had done Feng Wu a great favor.","Feng Wu opened the bookshelf on the wall first, for it contained the energy of mica.","As expected, Feng Wu copied what Aunt Xi did and easily obtained the energy.","As for the other treasures...","Recalling Mrs. Hua’s plan with the old master of the Zuo family today, Feng Wu was furious.","They wanted to destroy the Feng clan!","For that, she would take everything!","No matter how well-hidden the mechanism was, Feng Wu had found everything.","Feng Wu didn’t know exactly what was in the room, and she just went on taking them.","She didn’t leave anything for Mrs. Hua.","Feng Wu went to the first treasure room she visited right after she left the treasure hall and emptied it as well.","The treasure room wasn’t always visited, so no one in the Hua clan knew that it had been cleared out.."]},{"number":3541,"title":"Chapter 3541: Bodyforge","paragraphs":["Chapter 3541: Bodyforge","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The treasure room wasn’t always visited, so no one in the Hua clan knew that it had been cleared out.","Feng Wu went back to her cultivation room after collecting the mica energy and clearing out the two vaults.","“These are all great stuff!” Little Phoenix said to Feng Wu in excitement. “You can use a lot of the resources inside. They’ll help you make another breakthrough!”","Feng Wu was a little concerned. “Am I making breakthroughs too fast for my body to keep up?","Little Phoenix said proudly, “Do you have any idea what you found this time?”","Feng Wu asked, “What?”","Little Phoenix said, “It’s the bodyforge ointment, a sacred-level one. Only major clans like the Hua clan have it, and it’s not circulated on the market.” Feng Wu asked, “The body forge ointment?”","Little Phoenix said, “The bodyforge ointment can greatly improve your physical fitness in a short period of time. It can refine your muscles, tendons, and membranes. Other people may spend a lot of time on these three steps, but with the sacred-level bodyforge ointment, you can improve much faster!”","Little Phoenix clicked its tongue. “This bodyforge ointment alone is worth your effort tonight. Stop waiting and start cultivating! There’s going to be a big battle.”","Feng Wu nodded. “But the plot of the Hua family and the Zuo family can’t be","underestimated. Go back to the Feng clan and send the message to Feng Xun and the others.”","After Feng Wu left, Feng Xun and Yu Mingye were in charge of the Feng clan.","“Also, tell the white fairy that I have a plan. Starting tomorrow, the Hua family and the Zuo family won’t have the energy to go after the Feng clan. If anything happens, ask her to guard the Feng clan for me. “If she does that, I’ll tell her about my third senior brother.”","Little Phoenix nodded. “I’ll be right back.”","Little Phoenix was already very fast, and with its stealth ability, the entire Hua clan was at its mercy.","After Little Phoenix left, Feng Wu took out the bodyforge ointment to refine her body.","All the treasures in the vault were stored in brocade boxes, which Feng Wu put away in her storage bag.","It took Feng Wu a while to find the bodyforge ointment Little Phoenix was talking about.","It was a green jade jar that was half a foot tall.","She opened the lid, and a pleasant smell filled her nostrils.","After locking the door and windows, Feng Wu walked into the bath at the back.","Hua Wushuang’s cultivation room was equipped with everything. Pink petals filled the bathtub, and tiny bubbles rose from the hot spring.","However, Feng Wu didn’t go into the bath. Instead, she applied the sticky body forge ointment all over her body according to the instructions Little Phoenix gave her.","The process would make one’s muscles stronger and fuller.","After applying the bodyforge ointment, Feng Wu recited Divine Body Technique in her head.","It wasn’t from the Hua family. Feng Wu had learned it from her beautiful master when she was little.","Feng Wu had been so busy cultivating her techniques that she had neglected her physical training.","What Little Phoenix didn’t say was that not only wasn’t she adequate in her Fallen Star Sword, but she wasn’t as fit as she should be either.","Feng Wu cleared her head and focused on refining her body.","About two hours later, the bodyforge ointment covering Feng Wu began to fall off.","Feng Wu’s muscles, on the other hand, were firm and full.","She did it!"]},{"number":3542,"title":"Chapter 3542: The Genius Girl","paragraphs":["Chapter 3542: The Genius Girl","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up.","During her cultivation just then, she had finished the process of refining her body.","But it wasn’t over yet. This was only the beginning.","Feng Wu then entered the second stage of her body forging, which was tendon training.","The bodyforge ointment had fallen off, and Feng Wu put another layer on herself.","By then, more than half of the big jar of bodyforge ointment was gone. When Feng Wu opened her eyes two hours later, she realized that she had succeeded.","Then, it was time to refine the membrane.","Feng Wu opened her eyes again when the sky began to light up.","Her eyes lit up.","The third stage of the body-forging process was completed.","Feng Wu finally let out a breath of relief. Rising to her feet, she carefully washed off the residue of the bodyforge ointment with the hot spring water and changed into clean clothes.","“You did it!”","Little Phoenix stared at Feng Wu in disbelief. “You really did it!”","“Feng Wu asked, “What?”","Little Phoenix said, “It’s only been a night, and you’ve risen from Level 1 to Level 3 and have completed all three stages!”","Feng Wu asked, “Am I doing alright?”","Little Phoenix stared at Feng Wu in resignation. “What do you mean by ‘alright’? That’s more than just ‘alright’!","“Do you know how many stages there are in total? Do you know how long it took other people to complete all three of them? Do you know how fast you’re making progress now?!”","Feng Wu shook her head in bewilderment.","Little Phoenix waved at her in resignation. “Normal people would take at least three to five years to make a breakthrough from Level 1 to Level 3. The less talented ones may not make a breakthrough even after ten years, but you... One night? Are you kidding me?”","Feng Wu said, “Isn’t it because of the bodyforge ointment?”","Little Phoenix said, “The bodyforge ointment has indeed helped you greatly, but you don’t depend on external forces to make a breakthrough. You have to depend on yourself!","“You’ve made three breakthroughs in a row in less than a night... If I had known, I would have let you train your body earlier.”","Feng Wu said, “You’ve only reminded me until now?”","Little Phoenix smiled bitterly. “You’ve been suppressed by Zuo Qingluan the whole time and are trying to make a breakthrough in your cultivation as soon as possible. If you have to spend half of your time on body-forging, who knows when you’ll catch up with Zuo Qingluan?","“But how was I supposed to know that you’re more talented in body-forging than cultivating? You’re such a strange girl!”","Feng Wu said confidently, “I think I can do it again!”","“Please don’t.” Little Phoenix stopped Feng Wu. “Finishing three stages of the body-forging process in one go is already unheard of. The entire body-forging stage only has ten levels. Beyond that, one will become immortal.”","Feng Wu checked the time.","Today was Mrs. Hua’s birthday, and many things were going to happen.","Feng Wu’s plan would be carried out today as well.","Feng Wu knew that her plan couldn’t fail. If it failed, not only would she be caught and killed, but the entire Feng clan would be destroyed as well.","“Since I still have time, I’ll go forge the Fallen Star Sword,” said Feng Wu earnestly.","Little Phoenix frowned. “Are you in such a hurry?”","Feng Wu said, “Only when the mica energy is refined into the Fallen Star Sword will it be mine. Otherwise, it’ll be taken back sooner or later. You can sense it, so of course someone like Mrs. Hua can sense it as well.","Little Phoenix agreed, so it nodded at Feng Wu. “You have a point. Do it..”"]},{"number":3543,"title":"Chapter 3543: Birthday (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3543: Birthday (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu said in a serious tone, “Keep an eye on the time and Zuo Qingxi for me. He’s the main character today.","“And have you told Feng Xun about my plan?”","Little Phoenix patted its chest. “Don’t worry. I’ll take care of everything.” Seeing that Little Phoenix had agreed without hesitation, Feng Wu immediately went to refine the mica energy.","After an indeterminate amount of time...","When the Fallen Star Sword shone coldly and almost shot up into the sky, Little Phoenix, who had been guarding Feng Wu, opened its eyes wide.","It watched this in astonishment.","The girl had to be joking.","She had succeeded again!","Little Phoenix had thought that Feng Wu was only joking. After all...","Who could make three breakthroughs in a row after stealing two treasure rooms in one night and forge a weapon with the mica energy?","Normal people would never be able to do that.","But Feng Wu...","Feng Wu didn’t open her eyes yet, but she opened her mouth.","Whoosh!","The Fallen Star Sword turned into a streak of light and disappeared into her mouth.","“You’ve refined all the energy in that box! You didn’t waste any of it!” Little","Phoenix said to Feng Wu, who had just opened her eyes. “You made the Fallen Star Sword into a Semi-divine weapon with that energy! You’re so...”","That was unbelievable!","No, she was better than that!","Little Phoenix was raised by Mu Jiuzhou in his later years and had seen all kinds of things, but it was still shocked by Feng Wu.","The girl was so good at dealing with pressure. The more critical a moment was, the bigger her breakthrough.","“If she has time, she can even become a Spiritual Overlord...” Little Phoenix thought to itself.","“Finally.” Feng Wu smiled.","Little Phoenix asked, “How do you feel now?”","Tilting her head, Feng Wu gave it some thought. “I just feel that the Fallen Star","Sword is filled with spiritual energy and is going to destroy the world!”","Little Phoenix nodded. “That’s right. It really is a Semi-divine weapon. You... I thought you would reach perfection in the current stage at most... Forget it. You’ve always been like this. Why can’t I get used to it?” Feng Wu cleared her throat. “What time is it now?”","Little Phoenix said, “It’s almost noon. Get ready. It’s time to celebrate your grandmother’s birthday.”","Recalling how perceptive Mrs. Hua was, Feng Wu nodded and went back to get dressed.","It was an hour later when everything was ready.","There was a noise outside.","“Miss Wushuang, are you there?”","Feng Wu opened the door to find a maid outside.","As soon as she said that, Feng Wu knew that she was there to serve Hua Wushuang.","Because “Hua Wushuang” was in seclusion, the maid didn’t dare to disturb her. She only knocked on the door when she couldn’t wait anymore.","Her name was Songxiang, and she was a senior maid. She was in charge of everything in Hua Wushuang’s room.","Behind her were several younger maids.","They filed in, trying to dress “Hua Wushuang” up.","Of course, Feng Wu wouldn’t let them do that.","If they put any makeup on her face, they would immediately see that she was an impersonator.","Feng Wu frowned. “We don’t have time for this. Let’s go.”","Songxiang said, “But Miss Wushuang, Mrs. Hua says that today is an important day for you, so you have to dress up... We were worried that you might be cultivating, so we didn’t dare to come in.. We were delayed...”"]},{"number":3544,"title":"Chapter 3544: Birthday (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3544: Birthday (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Staring at Songxiang, Feng Wu asked in an authoritative tone, “Are you saying that I’m not pretty if I don’t dress up?","“Miss Wushuang” was genuinely angry...","Songxiang’s stomach lurched. “Of course not.”","Just then, they heard anxious voices outside.","“Mrs. Hua wants to see Miss Wushuang in the main hall now. Her Majesty the empress dowager will be here soon!”","It was Moshu, the maid of Mrs. Hua.","Hence, they quickly headed for the main hall.","When Feng Wu arrived, she saw that all the members of the Hua clan were there, many of whom she didn’t know.","To be more precise, Mrs. Hua was the only one she had met before.","Feng Wu reacted quickly and cleared her throat.","Mrs. Hua asked, “Are you still injured?”","Feng Wu nodded. “I was in a hurry to get out, so my spiritual essence went into the wrong channel. I’ll be fine after some rest.. ‘","Mrs. Hua nodded. “Good.”","Sensing someone glaring at her, Feng Wu turned around involuntarily.","She saw a girl smirking at her.","Feng Wu recognized her.","It was Hua Wuji.","Next to Hua Wuji was Hua Wuyu, and behind them were their parents, the couple from the second branch of the Hua family.","Naturally, Hua Wushuang’s parents were next to Feng Wu.","Hua Wushuang’s younger brother was a teenager named Hua Zichen. They hadn’t interacted with each other before, but he looked like a malicious teenager.","By then, a lot of guests had arrived.","Feng Wu looked around and saw many familiar faces.","Mrs. Zuo of the Zuo family was here as well.","She also saw Mrs. Dugu,","Lady Tao,","Lady Li,","and Lady Ye.","Feng Wu counted in her head. Of all the important families in the imperial capital, all the ladies were here, but neither Lady Northern Feng nor the Feng clan was here.","The noble ladies sat around and chatted among themselves.","Seeing Feng Wu, a lady took her hand and smiled at Mrs. Hua. “Miss Wushuang is getting prettier. I wonder which young man will be lucky enough in the future.”","The empress dowager wanted Hua Wushuang to be the crown prince’s wife, which was supposed to be a top-secret, but Hua Wushuang was so excited that she bragged about it to a few people. As a result... The news had already gotten around.","The speaker was Lady Ye.","Lady Tao hadn’t heard the news. She looked at Mrs. Zuo in bewilderment. Wasn’t Zuo Qingluan supposed to be...","Mrs. Zuo no longer had any hope for Zuo Qingluan to marry Jun Linyuan. All she wanted was to kill Feng Wu.","Her father-in-law had asked her to come, and Zuo Ming had told her that Hua Wushuang was at least a better choice than Feng Wu when it came to Jun Linyuan’s future wife. Hence, Mrs. Zuo slowly changed her mind.","She smiled at Lady Tao. “I think only His Royal Highness is good enough for Miss Wushuang.”","Many people gave Mrs. Zuo strange looks.","Mrs. Zuo knew that she had to explain, or the others would still remember Zuo Qingluan’s previous birthday.","That day, Zuo Qingluan invited His Royal Highness over, but His Royal Highness set off fireworks for Feng Wu instead.","Many ladies believed that...","At that thought, Mrs. Zuo smiled. “Qingluan is so focused on her cultivation that she doesn’t care about things like marriage.. I don’t know when she’ll come out of her seclusion...”"]},{"number":3545,"title":"Chapter 3545: Birthday (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3545: Birthday (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone realized that the Zuo family had given up on Jun Linyuan. No wonder Mrs. Zuo was here for Mrs. Hua’s birthday party.","However, the look in Lady Tao’s eyes was rather strange, and the outspoken Miss Tao asked the question directly.","“Mrs. Zuo, is Zuo Qingluan really not going to court His Royal Highness anymore?” Miss Tao asked.","Mrs. Zuo’s face turned livid.","She threw a dirty look at Miss Tao.","Lady Tao nudged her daughter.","Miss Tao said, “I’m only telling the truth. Last time on Zuo Qingluan’s birthday, she said that the crown prince would definitely come, but...”","Lady Tao glared at Miss Tao, who stopped talking in frustration.","However, Mrs. Zuo’s face was livid by then, and she forced a smile. ‘Qingluan and the crown prince are childhood sweethearts, that’s all. Nothing is certain. Plus, Qingluan is the future head of the Firmament Palace, and she doesn’t have time for love.”","Everyone chimed in, praising Zuo Qingluan and giving Mrs. Zuo an out.","only tnen IVIrs. LUO Decome less angry.","Aunt Xi went up to Mrs. Hua and whispered, “Her Majesty the empress dowager is still 5km away.”","Mrs. Hua nodded and said, “Her Majesty is coming. Please come with me.”","Those who were close to the Hua family knew the empress dowager would be here tonight, but many didn’t.","They were shocked when they heard the news.","The empress dowager was here.","The most prestigious woman of the Junwu Empire had come to the Hua manor to celebrate Mrs. Hua’s birthday. Did she think so highly of Mrs. Hua?","The empress dowager was a very difficult person to get along with, so only a handful of noble ladies here could talk to her.","But because His Majesty was a filial son, everyone wanted to get closer to the empress dowager.","The noble ladies’ eyes lit up when they heard the news, and they all had their own plans.","Feng Wu helped Mrs. Hua to her feet.","The empress dowager was very friendly to Mrs. Hua, but she wouldn’t talk to anyone else.","She then looked at Feng Wu.","Of course, to her, Feng Wu was Hua Wushuang.","The empress dowager smiled and asked Mrs. Hua, “Has Wushuang made some progress recently?”","Mrs. Hua took the hint and smiled. “Ever since Your Majesty gave her the","Celestial Spirit Bead, her cultivation level has improved significantly.”","“What level is she now? Is she a Level-4 Spiritual King yet?” Her Majesty’s eyes lit up.","Feng Wu was a little troubled...","As a matter of fact, she was a Level-8 Spiritual King now. If the news got out, the empress dowager would probably be astonished.","However, before Feng Wu could say anything, Mrs. Hua grabbed her hand.","She smiled and said, “She’s indeed a...”","Suddenly, Mrs. Hua’s expression changed.","She wasn’t sensing the spiritual essence of a Level-4 Spiritual King, but a Level-8 one!","Was she mistaken? Could her granddaughter be a Level-8 Spiritual King?","“Wushuang, you’re...” Mrs. Hua stared at Feng Wu in disbelief and forgot to speak.","The empress dowager looked at Mrs. Hua in bewilderment before turning to Granny Gui.","Granny Gui nodded, stepped forward, and grabbed Feng Wu’s wrist.","Feng Wu had let her catch it on purpose. Otherwise, she wouldn’t have been able to.","“A Level-8 Spiritual King?!” Granny Gui cried out in surprise.","WHAT?!","Everyone stared at Feng Wu in disbelief. A Level-8 Spiritual King?!","Were they hearing things?","She was a Level-8 Spiritual King!","“Ahem...’"]},{"number":3546,"title":"Chapter 3546: A Level-8 Spiritual King","paragraphs":["Chapter 3546: A Level-8 Spiritual King","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Ahem...” Feng Wu covered her mouth and chuckled.","The empress dowager immediately asked, “What happened? Are you hurt?”","Mrs. Hua smiled bitterly. “The girl competed with a girl of the Feng clan yesterday, and that girl was a little cunning and injured her...’","Feng Wu waved her hands in a hurry. “Don’t worry. I’ll be fine after some rest.” The empress dowager held Feng Wu’s hand and talked to her affectionately.","Everyone here was smart enough to know what was going on. Judging by the look on the empress dowager’s face, they already knew what was going on.","The empress dowager took Feng Wu’s hand and smiled as they walked in. “Do you like the bracelets I gave you?”","Feng Wu looked at the pair of dragon and phoenix bracelets on her wrist. “They’re quite nice.”","The empress dowager brought it up on purpose as if she was worried that the others wouldn’t notice.","As a matter of fact, what she said worked wonders. As soon as she said that, many looked at Feng Wu’s wrist.","One look and one could tell what was going on.","Those who didn’t know better asked around in secret and soon learned the answer.","The bracelets were given only to the crown prince’s wife. Her Majesty had never given them to Feng Wu, but now, she had given them to Hua Wushuang. Did that mean...","“Good girl.” The empress dowager sat down and kept Feng Wu company.","She patted Feng Wu’s hand and said, “At first, I only knew that you were a kind, smart, and virtuous girl, but now, I see that you’re a genius.”","Feng Wu had no choice but to play along with the empress dowager.","The empress dowager went on. “They’ve been saying that Zuo Qingluan is the most talented girl with the True Phoenix Blood in the imperial capital. What level is she now?”","Mrs. Zuo came out in a hurry. “She’s a Spiritual King...”","Mrs. Zuo wanted to say that Zuo Qingluan was a Level-2 Spiritual King, but that was nothing compared to a Level-8 Spiritual King.","Since Zuo Qingluan wasn’t here, Mrs. Zuo gritted her teeth. “She’s a Level-5 Spiritual King!”","She didn’t dare to exaggerate, fearing that the others would see through her lie.","“What about Feng Wu?” the empress dowager asked.","Mrs. Zuo said, “She’s a Level-4 Spiritual King.”","“Tsk, tsk...” The empress dowager smirked. “Isn’t Feng Wu supposed to be a genius among geniuses? Isn’t she supposed to have the Divine Phoenix Blood? She’s only a Level-4 Spiritual King.”","The others didn’t know what to say.","At 14A Level-4 Spiritual King was already a genius.","However...","Everyone looked at “Hua Wushuang”.","This girl was a Level-8 Spiritual King!","Mrs. Hua kept staring at Feng Wu in excitement. She had never expected that her granddaughter would be so capable. The Hua family was going to rise again!","Their future was promising!","The empress dowager kept holding Feng Wu’s hand and smiled. “A genius girl like you has to marry into the royal family.”","Everyone laughed along with the empress dowager.","They all realized that the empress dowager was going to marry Hua Wushuang to the royal family, but...","“Wushuang, what do you think of the crown prince?” The empress dowager smiled at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","“Damn you, Jun Linyuan! You really want to marry Hua Wushuang, don’t you?” Despite her frustration, Feng Wu played along and feigned a shy tone.","“Your Majesty, wh- what are you talking about...” Covering her face with her hands, Feng Wu ran off shyly.","Feng Wu kicked an old tree angrily after she was far away from the crowd.."]},{"number":3547,"title":"Chapter 3547: Matchmaking (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3547: Matchmaking (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu ran out shyly, and everyone in the room laughed.","Who would care if it was sincere or fake?","As long as Her Majesty was happy.","Meanwhile, one of them watched Feng Wu leave and smirked.","It was Zuo Qingxi.","Zuo Qingluan’s brother.","A dangerous light flashed in Zuo Qingxi’s eyes.","At this moment, Hua Wuji walked to Zuo Qingxi’s side.","No one knew what Hua Wuji said to him, but the two of them chatted and laughed as they walked out the door.","Seeing them walking together, Lady Tao suddenly smiled and said to Mrs. Zuo,","“Your son seems to be quite close to the Hua family’s third daughter.”","Many people turned to look in that direction.","Sure enough, Zuo Qingxi and Hua Wuji were walking side by side.","Zuo Qingxi was brought here by Mrs. Zuo. As soon as she arrived, she introduced Zuo Qingxi, who was a Level-7 Spiritual King, to everyone, so everyone knew he was.","Mrs. Zuo frowned.","Hua Wuji? The third daughter of the Hua family? The girl who had a scar on her face and wasn’t valued by the Hua family? That wasn’t the standard of the Zuo family’s daughter-in-law.","However, since Mrs. Hua and the empress dowager were here, Mrs. Zuo couldn’t say anything. She only smiled. “Young people like to talk to each other.","It’s fine.”","Was it fine?","The empress dowager hadn’t really told them about the crown prince’s marriage arrangement, so everyone had been pretending not to know.","Talking about such things needed the right timing.","They couldn’t start talking about it abruptly.","Someone had to guide the topic in that direction.","For example, Lady Ye was a smart person. She was the first to speak. “Miss","Wushuang is getting prettier. She’s doing great in the capital city.”","Lady Li also said, “Not only is she good-looking, but she’s also a Level-8 Spiritual King! She’s already so powerful at such a young age. What will happen in the future?”","The other ladies also chimed in and praised Hua Wushuang.","Lady Ye stole a glance at the empress dowager.","Just as she had expected, the empress dowager smiled like a blooming flower when she heard the compliments.","Hence, Lady Ye, who was good at currying favor with authoritative figures, deliberately mentioned Feng Wu again. “Everyone in the Feng clan says that Miss Feng Wu is talented, but I don’t think so. If she’s so talented, how come she’s not as good as Miss Wushuang?","As expected!","Lady Ye realized that Her Majesty’s eyebrows were raised when she belittled Feng Wu. She was so happy!","Lady Ye had heard that the empress dowager was here to announce Hua Wushuang’s betrothal. She hadn’t believed it at the time, but from the looks of it now... She decided to probe around. If it was true, she might be able to become a matchmaker.","This matchmaker was very important. The Hua family would thank her, and Her Majesty would think highly of her in the future. Even her husband could take this opportunity to...","The more Lady Ye thought about it, the more eager she became. She covered her mouth and smiled. “Your Majesty, Miss Wushuang is getting better and better. I really can’t help but want to be her matchmaker.” The empress dowager smiled at her. “Matchmaker? Who are the lucky in-laws?","“Of course, it’s your family. Apart from the royal family, who else is worthy of our Level-8 Spiritual King? Don’t you think so?”","The empress dowager asked, “Who do you think is suitable for the royal family?”","Lady Ye giggled.. ‘Who else can it be?”"]},{"number":3548,"title":"Chapter 3548: Matchmaking (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3548: Matchmaking (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lady Ye smiled. “Who else can it be? Our crown prince, of course.”","After saying that, Lady Ye became even more smug.","She observed the empress dowager’s reaction and knew that the latter would be delighted.","As expected!","After she said that, Her Majesty smiled.","“Junjun...” The empress dowager smiled. “That’s a good idea.”","The others thought, “What do you mean by a good idea?","“You’ve already given the bracelets to Hua Wushuang. Isn’t this hint obvious enough?”","Lady Ye wanted to roll her eyes, but she only smiled. “I think they’re very compatible.”","Just then, someone in the crowd said, “Isn’t Feng Wu the crown prince’s fiancée?”","The person stopped talking after that, so when the empress dowager looked in the direction of the voice, she couldn’t identify who it was.","Just then, many people looked at the empress dowager in confusion.","The relationship between Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan spread like wildfire in the capital.","The fireworks in the sky above the imperial capital that day were still being talked about.","“Jun Linyuan the sovereign descends to the world.","Feng Wu the phoenix soars above the land.”","Together, such a peerless youth and such a beautiful girl were as beautiful as a poem or a painting, but now... Were they going to be torn apart?","The empress dowager pulled a long face and glared around. “The crown prince and Feng Wu are never engaged. If there’s a rumor, it’s all Feng Wu’s doing. Which one of you believes Feng Wu’s rumor? Step forward! I have something to tell you!”","Seeing that the empress dowager was infuriated, no one dared to say anything.","The madam who spoke just now was also trembling at this moment and didn’t dare to speak again.","The empress dowager snorted. “That Feng Wu has done a lot of harm. She’s tarnished the crown prince’s reputation.”","Lady Ye was also a little surprised.","She knew about Feng Wu and the crown prince but to her surprise...","“Your Majesty, so the rumors aren’t true?” Lady Ye smiled. “No wonder everyone misunderstood. It’s just that Feng Wu is a little close to His Royal Highness. ”","Before the empress dowager could sneer, Lady Ye said, “Then, do you think that Wushuang and His Royal Highness are a good match?”","The empress dowager had been waiting for Lady Ye to say that.","She said calmly, “I think the two of them are meant for each other...","However, before the empress dowager could finish, there was an ear-splitting scream.","It was a man’s voice.","Screams tore through the sky and shot into the clouds!","Even the people outside the Hua Residence heard it, let alone the people inside.","The empress dowager was so shocked that she didn’t finish her sentence.","Mrs. Zuo’s face turned pale.","She was the only one who recognized the scream as Zuo Qingxi’s!","Without hesitation, Mrs. Zuo ran to the backyard.","Everyone turned to look at the empress dowager after Mrs. Zuo left.","The empress dowager didn’t look happy, and neither did Mrs. Hua.","She was halfway through his sentence, but she was interrupted.. Who was it?!","But Mrs. Hua also knew that now wasn’t the time to talk about marriage. She forced a smile. “Your Majesty, I’m sure there’s nothing to worry about. We’ll soon know what happened.”","Before she spoke, Mrs. Hua had already ordered the nanny beside her to go to the backyard.","However, the empress dowager suddenly got curious. She stood up and said, “Let’s go to the backyard together..”"]},{"number":3549,"title":"Chapter 3549: Shocking News (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3549: Shocking News (1)","Mrs. Hua had no choice but to go with the empress dowager.","When they arrived at the backyard, they saw...","In Hua Wushuang’s courtyard, the door was open, and a group of maids and grannies surrounded it.","At this moment, these servants were all dumbfounded. Their faces were pale, and they were flustered and at a loss...","Seeing the empress dowager and Mrs. Hua arrive, they got down on their Imees.","Seeing this, Mrs. Hua’s heart skipped a beat... What exactly happened?","Just then, an angry voice came from inside!","“Zuo Qingxi, you bastard! How dare you treat me like this!","“You know that I’m about to become the crown princess Consort, and you want to destroy me!","“You said something about planting your seed in me and letting me take it in so that the crown prince will think it’s his baby. That’s all bullshit!","“How dare you say that Zuo Qingluan was supposed to be the crown prince’s wife? How dare you take advantage of me? Screw you!","“I’ll cut off your dirty thing. I’ll see how you sow your seeds from now on!","“You made me do this! Don’t blame me for being ruthless!”","When the people outside heard this, their faces turned pale...","Just then, Feng Wu threw out something wrapped in cloth.","The thing went through the door and smashed into the empress dowager’s face.","The empress dowager couldn’t dodge in time, and the thing hit her face, smearing her face with blood.","“What was that?!” The empress dowager was frightened by the soft thing.","Thud!","The empress dowager’s eyes widened when the thing fell to the ground, and what was inside fell out.","Before the empress dowager could finish, she fainted.","“Your Majesty!” “Your Majesty!”","“Help the empress dowager!” For a moment, all hell broke loose.","In the other room —","Staring at Zuo Qingxi on the bed, Feng Wu looked so aggrieved and angry that she looked exactly like she was almost violated.","Hearing the noise outside, she seemed to be anxious. She hurriedly wrapped her outer clothes around herself and rushed out of the door.","A large group of people surrounded the door...","Most of the people’s attention was drawn to the empress dowager, but many of them were still looking at Feng Wu.","To them, she was Hua Wushuang.","Hence, when Feng Wu came out, everyone was shocked by her appearance.","At this moment, “Hua Wushuang’s” clothes were in a mess. They were torn in several places, and she could barely cover her body. She had been slapped, and there was blood all over her body... It was a shocking sight.","Mrs. Hua was dumbfounded.","Before she could react, Feng Wu rushed out!","If she didn’trunn off now, she wouldn’t have another chance. What if Mrs. Hua stopped her and locked her up?","Not only did Feng Wu run out. but she also seemed out of control as if she had been drugged. “Someone, stop her!”","Mrs. Hua shouted.","Aunt Xi rushed forward, but Feng Wu already saw her coming. Hence, Aunt Xi tore off half of her sleeve while Feng Wu rushed out like a madman!","“Go after her!”","Mrs. Hua scolded angrily!","If the empress dowager hadn’t fainted here, she would have chased after “Hua Wushuang” herself!","Just then, the empress dowager woke up.","When she opened her eyes, the first thing she saw was “Hua Wushuang” frantically running away, and then she saw the thing on the ground from the corner of her eye...","Mrs. Hua’s expression froze!","She had been so busy just now that she had forgotten about the thing on the ground..","“Return to the palace! Return to the palace immediately!”","The empress dowager was furious.. Her face was flushed, and she was in a berserk state!"]},{"number":3550,"title":"Chapter 3550: Shocking News (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3550: Shocking News (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Granny Gui gave Mrs. Hua a sympathetic look and followed the empress dowager.","Mrs. Hua was so distressed that she tried to stop the empress dowager. “Your Majesty...”","Unexpectedly, the empress dowager, who had always been nice to her, was furious this time.","The empress dowager glared at Mrs. Hua. “Get lost!”","Having said that, the empress dowager left in a huff, followed by everyone else. They were afraid that if they left too late, they would be seen as Mrs. Hua’s accomplices.","Mrs. Hua was a thorough person. She Imew that something was wrong today.","She knelt down behind the empress dowager and said sadly, “Your Majesty, someone must have planned this. I’ll apologize to you when I find out the truth.”","In the past, the empress dowager would forgive Mrs. Hua for everything she did when the latter pretended to be meek and subservient, but this time, the empress dowager was obviously furious. Therefore, she didn’t stop or turn around when she heard Mrs. Hua’s words. She left in a huff.","Mrs. Hua’s heart sank. She knew what happened was unprecedentedly serious.","After the empress dowager left, Mrs. Hua flew into a rage. “Find out what happened!”","There were still many madams present. At this moment, they all wanted to leave, but right then, a tragic cry came from inside! Mrs. Zuo had already rushed into the house.","“Qingxi! My son!","“Damn Hua Wushuang! How could she do such a thing? Oh my god!","“The Hua family will pay for this!”","Mrs. Hua had a headache and walked straight into the house with anger in her eyes.","The tragic scene in the room almost made her faint.","The only grandson of the Zuo family, Zuo Qingxi, was lying on the bed.","At this moment, his face was pale and bloodless. His clothes were covered in blood, especially his lower body. A part of his body was missing...","It was really gone...","Wasn’t that the thing that hit the empress dowager in the face?","Mrs. Hua was still hoping for a fluke, but when she realized what had really happened, she slipped and almost fell!","“My lady...”","The maids quickly stepped forward to steady her.","Mrs. Hua was so powerful that she could support the entire Hua family. She wouldn’t show her emotions no matter what happened, but now her face was so pale... Shumo vaguely felt that they were in big trouble this time.","Mrs. Hua gave her daughter-in-law a warning look.","Lady Hua nodded and raised her hand to grab Zuo Qingxi.","But at this moment, Mrs. Zuo seemed to have gone crazy and bit Mrs. Hua’s hand!","Lady Wang was caught off guard.","Gosh...","Mrs. Zuo was so angry that she wanted to bite off a piece of Lady Wang’s flesh!","“Mrs. Zuo, you...”","Lady Wang stared at Mrs. Zuo in disbelief and tried to pull her hand back, but Mrs. Zuo wouldn’t let go!","The pain was excruciating.","It was only when the members of the Hua family rushed up that Mrs. Zuo was finally dragged away.","Mrs. Zuo looked like she had lost her mind.","Lady Wang frowned. “Mrs. Zuo, we haven’t gotten to the bottom of the matter yet. Why are you doing this?”","As she spoke, she hid behind Mrs. Hua.","However, Mrs. Zuo had lost control.","“We haven’t found out the truth yet?! Qingxi is lying here right now. How can you say that you haven’t found out the truth?!","“Your Hua Wushuang did it!","“Look at this! It’s a murder weapon!” Mrs. Zuo pointed at the shiny dagger on the ground.."]},{"number":3551,"title":"Chapter 3551: Shocking News (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3551: Shocking News (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Holding the bloody weapon, Mrs. Zuo glared at Lady Wang. “Your Hua Wushuang did it! Your Hua Wushuang did it!”","Lady Wang looked at her mother-in-law for help. What should she do?","The Hua family and the Zuo family were not the only ones present. Mrs. Dugu, Lady Li, and Lady Ye, who were on good terms with the Zuo family, were also there.","The Dugu family and the Zuo family were in-laws, so the Dugu family would definitely stand on the Zuo family’s side.","Zuo Chengfeng’s daughter married Duke Li’s family, so they were also in-laws.","As for Lady Ye, she was a smart person.","She had tried her best to set Hua Wushuang and the crown prince up, but after what had happened, that was no longer possible. Therefore, she immediately sided with the Zuo family.","Hence, all three ladies stood behind Mrs. Zuo and glared at Lady Hua.","Lady Wang felt a headache coming on. She turned to Mrs. Hua for help.","Mrs. Hua’s expression was extremely ugly!","In that instant, she could already tell which side these ladies were on.","They had sided with the Zuo family.","That was the smart move. The Hua family had only just joined the game, and they had risen to power in the capital because of the empress dowager.","At that thought, Mrs. Hua knew that the Zuo family wasn’t easy to deal with.","She softened her tone and said to Mrs. Zuo, “We still need to investigate this matter. Mrs. Zuo, can you leave your son to me?”","Holding the pale Zuo Qingxi in her arms, Mrs. Zuo wouldn’t let go.","Mrs. Hua frowned. “That part might be reattached.”","If that were the case, the Hua family and the Zuo family might be able to reconcile.","At that thought, Mrs. Hua stared at Mrs. Zuo seriously. “So, please give him to me!”","Mrs. Zuo had lost her control, but now she looked hopeful again. “Really? Is there really hope? Can you reattach it to Qingxi’s body?”","Lady Hua hurriedly said, “My mother-in-law is a Supreme Level medicine refiner. She taught Wushuang medical skills.”","Was that so?","Everyone looked at Mrs. Hua in surprise.","This Mrs. Hua really hid it well! If it weren’t for this, no one would have known...","The Hua family was incredible.","Mrs. Zuo gritted her teeth. “You said it! You said you could cure Qingxi! You said it yourself!”","Mrs. Hua frowned. She didn’t say anything!","However, in order to appease the crazy Mrs. Zuo, Mrs. Hua could only nod.","“Yes, I said it. Hurry up and let me take care of your son.”","Mrs. Hua turned around and glared at Moshu. “Hurry up and pick that thing up.","We need to treat him immediately!”","It seemed that Mrs. Hua was going to treat Zuo Qingxi personally.","When Lady Ye thought of the treatment, she felt awkward in every way.","But now, they only wanted to cure Zuo Qingxi, so both the Hua family and the Zuo family deliberately ignored this embarrassing question.","The gender of the doctor shouldn’t matter.","Mrs. Hua chased all the unrelated people out and began her treatment.","Outside the door, everyone waited nervously.","Seeing Mrs. Zuo put her hands together, Mrs. Hua comforted her in a hurry.","“It’s fine. My mother-in-law is a great doctor. She can revive the dead. Zuo Qingxi will be fine.”","Mrs. Zuo glared at Mrs. Hua and gritted her teeth. “If you can’t cure her, the","Zuo family will never forgive you!”","Everyone thought that the Zuo family still had Zuo Qingluan, but only Mrs.. Zuo knew that Zuo Qingluan was already..."]},{"number":3552,"title":"Chapter 3552: Shocking News (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3552: Shocking News (4)","Everyone thought the Zuo family still had Zuo Qingluan, but only Mrs. Zuo knew that Zuo Qingluan’s ability had been destroyed by Feng Wu and was now lying in Firmament Palace. No one knew if she would pull through.","Mrs. Hua didn’t expect Mrs. Zuo to be so difficult to deal with. Seeing that Mrs. Zuo was in a bad mood, she retreated with a frown.","At this moment, everyone was busy. Only Hua Wushuang’s maid, Songxiang, was kneeling on the ground and trembling.","She was probably the only person who had seen the inside story with her own eyes.","So at this moment, she was kneeling on the ground and trembling.","Lady Wang stepped forward and stared at Songxiang. “Songxiang, what’s happened?!”","“I... I...” Songxiang was flustered, and her body was trembling.","Mrs. Zuo was staring at her too, and so were the other ladies!","Lady Wang said to the others, “Songxiang is Wuhuang’s personal maid. She’s always with Wushuang, so she must know what has happened.” The other ladies nodded in agreement.","This incident was too sudden and too strange. Thus, he had to ask.","Songxiang said, “Miss Wushuang was injured by Feng Wu during the fight, and she hasn’t recovered yet. She’s been cultivating in seclusion ever since she came back...","“But because of Mrs. Hua’s birthday and Her Majesty the empress dowager’s arrival, Mrs. Hua said that she would ask Miss Wushuang to come out at the last moment. After she met the empress dowager, she could go back to her recovery.","“I did as Mrs. Hua said and only knocked on the door at the last moment, but I still startled Miss Wushuang. There was a trace of blood at the corner of her mouth, but she endured the discomfort and went to see Her Majesty. Then, there was the birthday celebration...”","Lady Wang frowned. “We all know what happened on the birthday. You don’t have to repeat it. Just tell us what happened after Wushuang left the hall! ” The other madams nodded.","Indeed, they wanted to know what Hua Wushuang had experienced after leaving the banquet.","Songxiang knelt on the ground, sobbing in fear. She said intermittently, “When Miss Wushuang left the hall, she wasn’t feeling well. She stood under the tree and coughed, but at this moment, the Young Master of the Zuo family walked toward her.”","Lady Wang went straight to the point. “Was it Young Master Zuo who approached Wushuang?”","Songxiang said, “Yes. I was a little slow when I ran out after Miss Wushuang, so I was a little far away. But I saw it with my own eyes. It was Young Master Zuo who went to look for Miss Wushuang. I wasn’t the only one who saw it. Many people passed by. There was Dancai, and Granny Li... They can both testify!”","Lady Wang was relieved. She told her servants to fetch the two servants. Then she turned to Songxiang and asked, “What happened next?”","Songxiang said, “I was a little far away, so I don’t know what Young Master Zuo told Miss Wushuang. I only saw Young Master Zuo bowing to her and saying something that made her laugh.”","Seeing the frowns on the madams’ faces, Songxiang hurriedly said, “Dancai and Granny Li can testify. They didn’t go far at that time. I even heard Granny Li say in a low voice, “Why is Young Master Zuo so flirtatious?”","Mrs. Zuo’s face darkened.","The development of the situation wasn’t what she wanted. She stared at Songxiang warningly. In the end, Songxiang brought in the other two witnesses...","“And then?” Lady Ye asked with a frown.."]},{"number":3553,"title":"Chapter 3553: Shocking News (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3553: Shocking News (5)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Songxiang said, “When I finally ran to Miss Wushuang. I heard Young Master Zuo say something.”","“What did he say?”","Songxiang said, “He said, ‘I have a cultivation technique that can quickly treat internal injuries. Why don’t we find a place and let me teach you?”‘ “Bullshit!” Mrs. Zuo kicked Songxiang, sending her flying.","Bang! Songxiang’s back hit the wall, and she almost fainted from the pain.","Lady Hua almost lost her temper! What a barbaric lady!","Lady Hua frowned and glared at Mrs. Zuo. “We still need to verify whether","Songxiang is telling the truth or not. But Mrs. Zuo, aren’t you going too far?!”","Mrs. Zuo smirked. “She’s slandering my son!”","Lady Hua said, “We’ll find out if it’s a slander. Mrs. Zuo, don’t you want to know the truth?!”","Speaking of which, Lady Hua was really pissed off today!","It was supposed to be Hua Wushuang’s big day, and she was going to have Jun Linyuan as her son-in-law.","He was going to be the future emperor.","But now, something like this had happened.","Hua Wushuang ran out in a frantic state. There was an injured Young Master Zuo lying here, injured in a sensitive spot.","Hence, no matter how patient Lady Hua was, she was about to explode.","She glared at Mrs. Zuo. “If you can’t control your temper, please stay away!”","After that, Lady Hua went over to Songxiang and fed her a bottle of medicine.","She even asked someone to bring her a chair.","Mrs. Zuo smirked. “Let’s see what she has to say!”","She had already sent someone back to the Zuo family to call for help. When the Zuo family came, they would get to the bottom of this!","Ignoring the sarcastic Mrs. Zuo, Lady Hua asked Songxiang, “Are you feeling better now?”","Two of Songxiang’s ribs were broken, and her face was even paler. However, she didn’t dare to say that she was in pain, so she nodded reluctantly. “I’m alright... ”","Lady Hua nodded, stared into her eyes, and said seriously, “Go on, then. What happened next?”","Songxiang knew what Lady Hua was hinting at.","She was a smart person and knew what to say. In fact, she believed she was telling the truth.","Songxiang continued, “Young Master Zuo said that he had a cultivation technique that he could teach Miss Wushuang, but Miss Wushuang didn’t believe him. She wanted to leave, but Young Master Zuo insisted on following her. I don’t know what he whispered to Miss Wushuang... In the end, Miss","Wushuang agreed and took him back to the courtyard.”","Mrs. Zuo smirked. “What a chaste girl!”","Lady Hua glared at Mrs. Zuo and then stared at Songxiang. “Did you hear what","Young Master Zuo said? Why did Wushuang agree to let him in?”","Songxiang thought for a moment and said, “Young Master Zuo’s voice was very soft at the time, and he mentioned the crown prince... I think he said he knew what the crown prince liked. That was why Miss Wushuang took him inside.”","Lady Hua said, “Keep talking!”","Songxiang said, “I wanted to go with them, but Young Master Zuo stopped me. He said that the conversation between him and Miss Wushuang was private. If another person joined them, the crown prince might know it, and the consequences would be unimaginable.”","Songxiang said, “Miss Wushuang is very concerned about the crown prince.","She listened to Young Master Zuo and let me stay outside.”","That actually made sense.."]},{"number":3554,"title":"Chapter 3554: Shocking News (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3554: Shocking News (6)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Mrs. Dugu and Lady Ye looked at each other, feeling that the Zuo family was in trouble because Songxiang was obviously blaming Zuo Qingxi.","Sure enough, Lady Hua cheered up a little and asked, “What happened next?”","Songxiang cried. “Not long after that, I heard Miss Wushuang’s angry shouts. There was also the sound of tables and chairs colliding, and the sound of clothes being torn...”","Mrs. Zuo snapped, “Bullshot! Didn’t you say that Hua Wushuang was a Level-8 Spiritual King?! Qingxi is only a Level-7 Spiritual King! How could he rape a Level-8 cultivator? The Hua family is so vicious! You’re unscrupulous! I’ve heard of Mrs. Hua’s evil tricks, but I didn’t expect the entire Hua family to be like this! I finally know what kind of people you are!”","Lady Hua’s face darkened.","Songxiang said, “I also heard Young Master Zuo threatening Miss Wushuang...”","Lady Hua asked, “What did he threaten her with?!”","Songxiang said, “Young Master Zuo said, ‘So what if you’re a Level-8 Spiritual","King? You’re seriously injured. How can you fight against me?!”‘","Lady Hua turned around and glared at Mrs. Zuo. “Wushuang is seriously injured. Normally, a Level-8 Spiritual King wouldn’t be afraid of a Level-7 one, but she couldn’t fight back in her current state! Zuo QIngxi has gone too far!”","Mrs. Zuo was furious. “The Hua family is the true villain here!”","Lady Hua staggered. “I can’t believe Zuo Qingxi could do that! He deserves to die! Why didn’t God strike him with lightning?!”","Mrs. Zuo flew into a rage and slapped Lady Hua. “Shut up! Hua Wushuang was the one who seduced Qingxi, and now you’re slandering him!”","Lady Hua was also furious. “Wushuang seduced your son?! Ha! Who does he think he is? Is he good-looking? Is he a genius cultivator? Wushuang is going to be the crown prince’s wife soon. Why would she seduce a piece of trash like your son?!”","Wrath made the two of them lose control. They rushed forward and grabbed each other’s hair!","Lady Ye and the others wanted to interfere, but they were almost dragged into the fight. Hence, they fell back and only shouted, “Stop fighting! Stop it!”","However, the more they shouted, the more ferocious the two noble ladies became. They grabbed each other’s hair and bit each other’s shoulders, fighting as hard as they could.","Mrs. Zuo said, “Who do you think Hua Wushuang is? She’s neither good-looking nor good-natured! Why would Qingxi fall for her? If he wanted a girl, he would have gone to Feng Wu. Feng Wu is a hundred times better looking than Hua Wushuang!”","Lady Hua said, “Zuo Qingxi is a piece of trash! He’s nothing compared to the crown prince. Why would Wushuang try to seduce him? You idiot!”","Mrs. Zuo said, “Haha! You keep bringing up the crown prince! Do you re think he’s your son-in-law? Has the empress dowager announced the marriage? Is it official? If there’s a line, Qingluan is way ahead of Hua Wushuang when it comes to marrying the crown prince!”","Lady Hua said, “I was wondering why Zuo Qingxi dared to do that. That He was going to ruin Wushuang so that Zuo Qingluan could become the prince’s wife.. The Zuo family is so vicious!”"]},{"number":3555,"title":"Chapter 3555: Shocking News (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3555: Shocking News (7)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lady Ye and the others looked at each other in astonishment.","They all recalled what Hua Wushuang had said when they first came to the courtyard.","She had accused Zuo Qingluan of doing this to her for Zuo Qingluan!","So that was why...","That was how it was!","Everyone looked at Mrs. Zuo differently.","Mrs. Zuo was furious!","“Impossible! Qingxi would never do that!”","Mrs. Zuo was the only one who knew whether Zuo Qingluan was in critical condition.","According to the Firmament Palace, there was a high chance that she would die... That was why Mrs. Zuo swallowed her anger and came to the Hua family to build a relationship with them. Therefore, she knew Zuo Qingxi would never do such a thing.","But the others didn’t believe her.","Especially Lady Hua.","Songxiang struggled to kneel on the ground and kowtowed to the ladies. “I swear to God that everything I said is true. I didn’t lie...”","“You’re lying!”","Mrs. Zuo didn’t believe her.","“I believe her!” Lady Hua wouldn’t back down.","Just then, the gate opened,","Everyone turned in that direction.","Mrs. Hua had been treating Zuo Qingxi. Now that she had come out, did it mean that Zuo Qingxi had been cured?","If that was the case...","Did that mean that the conflict between the Hua family and the Zuo family could be resolved?","Lady Ye would like to see the two families reconcile. After all, all these families were on the same side.","However, she realized that Mrs. Hua’s expression was a little ugly.","She quickly walked up and lowered her voice. “My lady, how is Zuo Qingxi..","Mrs. Hua didn’t say anything, but her thin lips were slightly pursed.","For a moment, there was a terrifying silence.","Mrs. Zuo rushed forward and grabbed Mrs. Hua’s hand. “How’s my son?! Mrs.","Hua, tell me. How’s my son?! Has he been cured?!”","Everyone looked at Mrs. Hua with hope in their eyes.","Mrs. Hua finally responded.","She didn’t say anything, but she shook her head.","That meant...","Mrs. Zuo gritted her teeth and said in a shrill voice, “He’s not cured?!”","She rushed up and grabbed Mrs. Hua’s shoulder, shaking her uncontrollably. “Why isn’t he cured? Aren’t you a Supreme Level medicine refiner? Aren’t you a great doctor? Didn’t you promise me that you would cure Qingxi? Why didn’t you?!”","The corners of Mrs. Hua’s mouth twitched. She wanted to say something, but she didn’t.","Lady Hua’s stomach lurched. Something was very wrong.","From what she knew of Mrs. Hua over the years, this old lady had always been cold and arrogant. No one dared to raise their voice in front of her, let alone shake her.","Those who dared to do this had long been killed.","But now, she was letting Mrs. Zuo do all those things. Something terrible must have happened, which was why the old lady felt so guilty.","At that thought, Lady Hua took a step forward. “Mother, Zuo Qingxi was the one who tried to rape Wushuang, which was why this happened. Songxiang already said that there are other witnesses.. If Zuo Qingxi can’t be cured, he deserves it, and the Hua family...”"]},{"number":3556,"title":"Chapter 3556: Shocking News (8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3556: Shocking News (8)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lady Hua was about to say that it had nothing to do with the Hua family when Mrs. Zuo flew into a rage!","She turned around and glared at Lady Hua. “I’ll never let you family live in peace before Qingxi is cured!”","At this moment, the exhausted Mrs. Hua suddenly said, “My condolences.”","Wait...","Wait...","When everyone heard this, they were all stunned.","Lady Hua was dumbfounded.","Mrs. Zuo didn’t know what to say. Her face was as pale as a sheet... Without another word, She turned around and ran inside!","Lady Hua looked at Mrs. Hua in disbelief.","Mrs. Hua had never seemed so grave. She looked at Lady Hua and nodded.","Lady Hua was speechless.","Did that mean... Zuo Qingxi was really... gone?","How was this possible?","Weren’t eunuchs castrated all the time? Why didn’t anyone die? Mrs. Hua, a Supreme Level medicine refiner, had treated Zuo Qingxi, but he was dead. What happened?!","At this moment, they heard an ear-splitting scream.","“My son!!!","“Qingxi!!!","“Wake up!","“Wake up and look at me!”","Mrs. Zuo’s anguished cry came from inside. She sounded so sad that it made everyone’s heart tremble, and chills ran down their spines.","The Dugu family and the Zuo family were in-laws, so Mrs. Dugu was the first to rush in.","She saw Zuo Qingxi.","He was lying on the bed, covered in blood...","His face was terrifyingly pale, his eyes were tightly shut, and his entire body was stiff...","Mrs. Dugu went forward to check his breathing.","He was indeed dead...","Mrs. Dugu took a step back in disbelief.","“How could this be... How could he be dead... Mrs. Dugu rushed out and stared at Mrs. Hua.","Mrs. Hua was about to leave.","“Mrs. Hua, please wait!”","Mrs. Dugu rushed out and blocked Mrs. Hua’s way. She stared at Mrs. Hua with a cold gaze. “Mrs. Hua, don’t you need to explain what has happened?!” This was also what Mrs. Hua was puzzled about.","Being a Supreme Level medicine refiner, she was very confident in her medical skills.","When Bao Er was dying, Mrs. Hua had been waiting for the last moment to turn the tide, but Feng Wu had taken advantage of the situation instead.","“I’ll give the Zuo family an explanation.”","With that, Mrs. Hua turned to leave. She didn’t want to argue with Mrs. Zuo, who had lost her mind. That would be too embarrassing.","But at this moment, the Zuo family rushed in!","Zuo Ming led the way, followed by the fifteen Spiritual Overlords of the Zuo family.","These fifteen Spiritual Overlords were the Zuo family’s last trump card. They had been mobilized from Jingyang Province, where the Zuo family’s main force was located, in order to kill Feng.","Zuo Chengfeng and Lady Wang had agreed to destroy the Feng clan and kill Feng Wu together. The two families would each send fifteen Spiritual Overlords.","That was about as powerful as all the tutors of the Imperial College put together.","But now, when Zuo Ming heard that something had happened to Zuo Qingxi in the Hua family, he brought all Spiritual Overlords with him! When Zuo Ming arrived, he heard Mrs. Zuo’s screams.."]},{"number":3557,"title":"Chapter 3557: Shocking News (9)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3557: Shocking News (9)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","He looked up at Mrs. Hua and instructed the 15 Spiritual Overlords, “Please guard the courtyard door. No one is allowed to leave!”","His wife must have suffered greatly. Otherwise, she wouldn’t be crying like this...","Zuo Ming panicked a little and ran into the room.","Hua Wushuang’s bed-chamber was now free of restrictions, and many people had entered it. However, now that things had come to this, no one could care less.","Zuo Ming rushed in, and when Mrs. Zuo saw him, she cried and shouted, “Hua Wushuang castrated Qingxi. Lady Hua accused him of raping Hua Wushuang and made her sound perfectly innocent. Mrs. Hua killed our son with her own hands, so we can’t hear his side of the story! My lord, our only living son is gone!”","Boom!","Zuo Ming’s head was spinning.","It was as if a bolt of lightning had struck him, making him dizzy.","How could this be... How could this be...","He used to have three sons and two daughters.","Zuo Qingxian was dead.","Zuo Qingliu was dead.","Zuo Qingyu was dead.","There was no telling whether Zuo Qingluan would survive, and there was a high chance that she would die too.","Zuo Qingxi used to be his only living son, but now... Why... Why did all those things happen?!","“Ahhh!!!”","The patriarch of the Zuo family roared at the sky and immediately spat out a mouthful of blood!","The Hua family...","Master Hua, Mrs. Hua’s eldest son, happened to arrive at that moment. When he saw this scene, his heart skipped a beat.","“Master Zuo...”","Master Hua tried to help Zuo Ming up, but Zuo Ming flew into a rage and punched him in the chest.","Master Hua was caught off guard and was hit in the chest by. He immediately flew out.","Mrs. Hua reacted quickly and caught Master Hua in time.","However, two of Elder Hua’s ribs had already been broken.","Without a word, Mrs. Hua covered his son’s chest with her jade-green light. His originally sunken chest was quickly repaired.","Zuo Ming rushed out and saw what was happening.","He glared at Mrs. Hua. “You’re a Supreme Level medicine refiner. Why didn’t vou save mv son?! Whv did vou kill him? Whv?! ”","Mrs. Hua couldn’t defend herself.","“Whether you believe it or not, I’ve really tried my best...”","If Mrs. Hua had known that she would be incriminated, how could she have tried to cure Zuo Qingxi? She wouldn’t have helped him at all!","“What do you want?” Master Hua rubbed his chest and stared at Zuo Ming calmly.","Zuo Ming bellowed, “A life for a life!”","Master Hua was also angry. “You mean, you want to kill my mother?!”","Zuo Ming stared at Mrs. Hua, who looked awful.","What they didn’t know was that a small bird was standing on a tree branch and looking at the scene with glowing eyes!","Little Phoenix didn’t believe It when Feng Wu told it that there was going to be a great show there. How great could it be? As it turned out, the show was awesome!","Little Phoenix enjoyed the show very much.","Right now, a battle was about to start.","Zuo Ming smirked. “I can forget about your mother for the time being. Hand Hua Wushuang over!”","Lady Hua whispered in Master Hua’s ear, “Zuo Qingxi wanted to rape Wushuang.. That’s why...”"]},{"number":3558,"title":"Chapter 3558: Shocking News (10)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3558: Shocking News (10)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","How could Master Hua hand over Hua Wushuang? “Zuo Qingxi tried to rape her!”","Zuo Ming smirked. “He’s dead. You can say whatever you want!”","Master Hua: “It was clearly Zuo Qingxi who tried to rape Wushuang first. Be reasonable!”","Zuo Ming asked, “Was Hua Wushuang raped?!”","Master Hua didn’t know what to say.","If he said yes, how could Wushuang show her face in public in the future?","“But Qingxi is dead!” Zuo Ming bellowed.","Master Hua didn’t know what to say.","“Get Hua Wushuang back here!” At this moment, Mrs. Hua was extremely angry!","The fifteen Spiritual Overlords of the Zuo family and the fifteen of the Hua family were confronting each other. A fight was about to break out, which Mrs. Hua didn’t want to see.","What Mrs. Hua didn’t notice was that there were a few people in the crowd who looked a little uneasy.","They were Hua Wuji and her parents.","At this moment, they looked at each other and all realized something.","What they did could never come to light.","What about Hua Wushuang?","More precisely, where was Feng Wu, who was wearing Hua Wushuang’s face?","While the empress dowager was there, all eyes were on her. Taking advantage of the situation, Feng Wu ran out of the room like a lunatic after leaving a few words.","Soon, she disappeared into the crowd.","Feng Xun and Yu Mingye were waiting for Feng Wu in the carriage not far away from the mansion. When they saw Feng Wu coming out, they drove over. Before anyone noticed, Feng Wu entered the carriage with a whoosh.","“Phew —”","Feng Wu let out a long breath.","That was close!","She had planned it for a long time.","It wouldn’t have been so intense, but she had heard that Mrs. Hua and the Old Master Zuo family were discussing the eradication of the Feng clan, so she made a more ruthless plan.","After she got in, Feng Wu said without hesitation, “Take me to Hua Wushuang!”","Poor Hua Wushuang. She had been detained in Fallen Star Yard because of her fight with Feng Wu.","After she was detained, Feng Wu drugged her. Hua Wushuang was so dizzy that all her memories were jumbled up.","What Feng Wu wanted was Hua Wushuang in this state.","Feng Xun was so anxious that he kept asking, “How did it go? Tell me! I’m so worried!”","Yu Mingye had the same anxious look on his face.","Feng Wu smiled mysteriously.","Feng Xun patted Feng Wu on the shoulder. “You naughty girl, we’ve been so anxious. Tell us what happened.”","Feng Wu smiled. “Everything is under control.”","Feng Wu smiled mysteriously as she told them everything about how she had set up Hua Wushuang and Zuo Qingxi.","“Oh my god!” Feng Xun cried out.","“Oh my god, you’re amazing! That’s great!” Yu Mingye’s eyes lit up. “Did you really cut his thing off?” Feng Wu asked, “Of course, I did.”","Feng Xun was speechless.","Yu Mingye covered his crotch with both hands and stared at her nervously.","Feng Wu snickered. “I was far away. I just flicked the tip of my sword, and Zuo Qingxi fell to the ground. I wasn’t going to do it, but Mrs. Hua and that old man were so mean that they wanted to destroy the Feng clan!”","“What’s that all about?” Feng Xun frowned.","Feng Wu told them what she had heard.."]},{"number":3559,"title":"Chapter 3559: Shocking News (11)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3559: Shocking News (11)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Damn it! That’s unbelievable! What did you do wrong? What did the Feng clan do wrong? How dare they do whatever they want just because their families are so powerful? They kill people as easily as they kill ants! I hate the Hua family!” Yu Mingye was furious.","Feng Wu said, “Don’t worry. The two families are fighting each other now. I’m afraid they won’t be able to hunt me down for a long time.”","Yu Mingye said, “But if Zuo Qingxi only gets castrated, I’m afraid it won’t be enough to turn the two families against each other. Someone will have to die.” Feng Xun nodded. “If it were me, I’d kill Zuo Qingxi in the Hua Manor.”","Feng Wu nodded.","Feng Xun said, “What do you mean by that?”","Feng Wu said, “Huh? It’s just as you suggested.”","Feng Xun asked, “What did I suggest?”","Feng Wu looked at him innocently. “That old lady from the Hua family is a Supreme Level medicine refiner that no one knows about. Other people might not know this, but I could tell right away when I stole their treasures. There are plenty of Supreme Level herbs there, so...”","Both Feng Xun and Yu Mingye looked at Feng Wu in confusion. So what? Feng Wu said, “So, what would you do if you were me?”","Feng Xun and Yu Mingye rested their chins on their hands and shook their heads. “I don’t know.”","Feng Wu said, “I put something in his wound, of course. When Mrs. Hua treated him, he bled profusely... In the end, he died at Mrs. Hua’s hands.”","‘You...”","Yu Mingye and Feng Xun looked at each other and saw the shock in each other’s eyes!","Oh my god..","This girl...","What was her brain made of?","How could she be so smart?!","“It would be great if the plan was carried out. The Hua family and the Zuo family would really fight each other, and there would be a blood feud that could never be resolved. But... will it really be like this? Won’t something go wrong?”","Both Feng Xun and Yu Mingye had the same thought.","Feng Wu’s idea was excellent. It was amazing!","Feng Wu pricked up her ears.","Feng Xun and Yu Mingye exchanged a look. What was she listening to?","Suddenly, Feng Wu smiled and looked at Feng Xun and Yu Mingye. “It worked.” What worked?","Feng Wu said, “It’s going according to the plan. Zuo Qingxi died in Mrs. Hua’s hands. Zuo Ming is confronting the Hua family with his fifteen Spiritual Overlords.”","“OIVIG!”","‘Whoa! ”","Feng Xun and Yu Mingye cried out in surprise. They were thrilled.","“I never thought I’d live to see this day!”","“You’ve screwed the Zuo family over this time. Xiao Wu, do you know that Zuo Qingxi is the only child in the Zuo family right now? You’ve made sure that the Zuo family doesn’t have any descendants!” Feng Xun was shocked.","He didn’t believe Feng Wu when she told him that she had a plan.","She wasn’t a Spiritual Overlord yet. What could she do?","But as it turned out, Feng Wu had dragged two powerful families into a quagmire right away, and they were going to fight to the death.","“Don’t they still have Zuo Qingluan?” Yu Mingye asked curiously.","Feng Xun said smugly, “Xiao Wu destroyed Zuo Qingluan’s True Phoenix Blood, and she was barely breathing when the Firmament Palace took her away. She won’t be able to find another True Phoenix Blood, so she’s crippled for good..”"]},{"number":3560,"title":"Chapter 3560: Shocking News (12)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3560: Shocking News (12)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Yu Mingye gave Feng Wu a thumbs up. “My little wife is amazing!”","“Whose wife is she? I’ll slap you if you keep talking nonsense!” Feng Xun smacked Yu Mingve on the head.","Rubbing his head, Yu Mingye glared at Feng Xun. “Hey, you’re not even in the","Spiritual Overlord Stage. Are you trying to provoke me?!”","“Screw you!: Feng Xun was so frustrated that he didn’t know what to say.","Was Yu Mingye born to piss him off?!","Seeing that the two of them were about to argue again, Feng Wu was speechless. She quickly changed the subject. “By the way, how’s Hua","Wushuang? Have you been brainwashing her?”","As a Semi-divine medicine refiner, Feng Wu had plenty of incredible potions.","For example, she modified the psychedelic drug and turned it into a brainwashing potion.","They drugged Hua Wushuang until the latter almost had a nervous breakdown. After that, They kept brainwashing Hua Wushuang so that Hua Wushuang believed that Zuo Qingxi wanted to rape her to ruin her engagement with Jun Linyuan. Just like that, they brainwashed Hua Wushuang over and over again...","“Don’t worry about that.” Yu Mingye patted his chest. “I’ve been brainwashing her every two hours. I guarantee that she bought that story. Apart from killing Zuo Qingxi and the Zuo family, she won’t have any other thoughts.”","Feng Wu nodded.","The drug was so powerful that it almost felt wrong to use it. If the Zuo family and the Hua family hadn’t joined forces to destroy the Feng clan, Feng Wu wouldn’t have used it.","Just then, there was a commotion outside.","“What’s going on?” Feng Wu frowned.","The driver was one of Yu Mingye’s elders.","“It’s the elders of the Hua family. They’re looking for someone everywhere. It’s probably Hua Wushuang.","“The carriage is blocked. We’re stopped here. We can’t get through. “They’ve blocked every street entrance. Every carriage is being searched.” Feng Wu hadn’t expected the Hua family to be so fast!","As they spoke, the Hua family’s search party happened to come over. The person in the lead was Aunt Xi.","Aunt Xi was a Spiritual Overlord.","It was as if she sensed something because her first reaction was to guard the path that led to the Feng clan.","“Get out of the carriage!” The person beside Aunt Xi shouted angrily.","Yu Mingye’s elder smirked. “Even His Majesty wouldn’t be so rude to us. Who do you think you are? Do you want to die?!”","The elder lashed out with his whip!","He was also a Spiritual Overlord.","The whip almost hit Aunt Xi in the face. Immediately, Aunt Xi’s face darkened.","“Is Young Master Yu Mingye of the Dark Dynasty in the carriage?” Aunt Xi suppressed her temper and asked nicely.","Yu Mingye snorted.","Aunt Xi bowed and said, “Young Master Yu, I’m really sorry. An important person of the Flower Valley is missing, so we set up checkpoints on the way. Since it’s your carriage, feel free to get through.”","Feel free?","Yu Mingye smirked. She was indeed afraid of him!","He was about to tell his elder to start the carriage when Feng Wu shook her head.","“If they don’t see the inside clearly, they’ll keep suspecting you. It’s not a good thing to be suspected because the Hua family and the Zuo family will probably drag other people into their conflict, and the Dark Dynasty can be useful.’","Feng Wu shook her head. “You two, get out of the carriage.”","Yu Mingye said, “But...”","“Out!” Feng Wu frowned and looked serious.","As soon as Feng Wu became serious, Yu Mingye behaved like a puppy and said obdiently.. “Alright...”"]},{"number":3561,"title":"Chapter 3561: Shocking News (13)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3561: Shocking News (13)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xun dragged Yu Mingye out of the carriage.","Feng Xun knew that Feng Wu must have a solution. The girl was never short of ideas.","After chasing out of the carriage, Yu Mingye was displeased to see Aunt Xi.","“How dare you! Do you think I’m hiding a criminal in my car? Come on. Let’s find out.” Yu Mingye swaggered over to Aunt Xi. Aunt Xi naturally revered the heir of the Dark Dynasty.","“I wouldn’t dare.”","“Why wouldn’t you? You’ve made us get out of the carriage. Why wouldn’t you search for it?” Crossing his arms, Feng Xun smirked.","“Young Lord Feng,” Aunt Xi said lightly.","Feng Xun said, “Let’s get it over with. We still have things to do.”","Aunt Xi stared at the carriage. The curtains were closed, so it was difficult for her to see what was inside.","She suddenly asked, “Young masters, where are you going?”","Feng Xun smirked. “Why, is the Hua family interfering with Northern Feng Mansion? Do I have to be interrogated on where I’m going?”","Aunt Xi didn’t dare provoke Feng Xun.","She could only change her question. “I wonder if you’ve seen Miss Wushuang.”","Yu Mingye raised an eyebrow. “Who’s that? I’ve never heard of or seen her before. What do you mean? You’re not accusing me of being involved with her, are you? Let me tell you. I’m the only heir of the Dark Dynasty. You can’t force me to marry someone from your family! I don’t want her!”","Aunt Xi was so angry that the blue veins on her forehead throbbed..","How could such an unreasonable person be the only heir of the Dark Dynasty?","“Young Master Yu, please don’t make fun of me.” Aunt Xi gritted her teeth. She was a Spiritual Overlord, yet she was being mocked like this. She felt that her pride had been trampled on the ground.","Yu Mingye said, “I’m not kidding. I’m very serious. We’re already out of the carriage. Why? Are you still not going to let us go?”","Aunt Xi: “I wouldn’t dare, but.. ‘","Yu Mingye stared at Aunt Xi!","He was a powerful Spiritual Overlord, and he had a noble status. That was why Yu Mingye looked scary when he was displeased.","Aunt Xi: “It’s just... Young Master Yu, I’m begging you...”","Just then, an impatient voice came from inside the carriage.","“Yu Mingye, what are you doing out there? Are we leaving or not?”","A pair of fair, slender hands lifted the curtain, and a slender girl walked out.","The girl was beautiful beyond description.","It was none other than Feng Wu herself.","When Feng Wu lifted the curtain, Aunt Xi stared at the carriage. She saw Feng Wu and the empty carriage behind her... No one could hide inside.","Hua Wushuang wasn’t there.","Feng Wu frowned when she saw Aunt Xi. “Aren’t you Hua Wushuang’s nanny?","You were with her when she challenged me.” Aunt Xi’s eyebrows twitched when she saw Feng Wu.","“Yes,” she replied coldly.","Feng Wu said, “What’s this? Are you stopping us from going that way? Do you own this road?”","Aunt Xi’s face turned livid at Feng Wu’s rebuke, but she didn’t want to lose her temper. In the end, she stepped aside and said, “Miss Feng Wu, please.”","Feng Wu frowned at her and went back to the carriage.","Yu Mingye followed her in a hurry.."]},{"number":3562,"title":"Chapter 3562: Shocking News (14)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3562: Shocking News (14)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“She’s guarding the path leading to our Feng clan. Perhaps she’s targeting you.”","Feng Xun had a headache.","What did he mean by “our Feng clan”? Yu Mingye was such a narcissist that he didn’t know when to stop.","Feng Xun kicked him. “Watch your mouth!”","Yu Mingye turned around and glared at him. “What’s wrong? I treat the Feng clan like my own family. What’s wrong with that?”","Feng Xun said, “Shut up!”","Just then, Aunt Xi said, “Miss Feng Wu.”","Feng Wu stopped and turned to look at Aunt Xi.","Aunt Xi stared at Feng Wu, trying to figure out her strength.","However, Feng Wu had the Concealing Jade.","When Feng Wu wanted people to know how strong she was, she would put away the Concealing Jade, and when she didn’t want people to know, she would put it on. Therefore, Aunt Xi couldn’t see Feng Wu’s cultivation level.","Aunt Xi stared at Feng Wu. “I wonder how strong Miss Feng Wu is now. Miss Wushuang is a Level-8 Spiritual King now.”","Aunt Xi tried to read Feng Wu’s expression, but Feng Wu was as calm as ever. She nodded and said, “Congratulations.”","Aunt Xi stared at Feng Wu. “Miss Feng Wu, did you see Miss Wushuang today?”","Feng Wu frowned. “Is she missing?","Aunt Xi was speechless.","Feng Wu said, “She’s become a Level-8 Spiritual King, but she’s missing?","“It’s been a few days since she competed with me. Why? Does the Hua family want to blame me for Hua Wushuang’s disappearance?”","Aunt Xi said, “... Of course not.”","Feng Wu nodded. “That’s good. If you do, I don’t mind going to His Majesty for help.”","Aunt Xi couldn’t help but think about what had happened between Duke Li and the Feng clan. It was obvious that His Majesty was biased toward Feng Wu.","As Feng Wu and Aunt Xi talked, more and more people gathered around them.","Feng Wu asked curiously, “What’s wrong with Hua Wushuang? Why is she suddenly missing? Did she...”","“Did she elope with someone?!” Yu Mingye cried out.","Aunt Xi’s expression was extremely ugly!","If she had known this would happen, she wouldn’t have provoked Feng Wu. This girl wasn’t someone to be trifled with.","Aunt Xi didn’t want the news of Hua Wushuang and Zuo Qingxi to get out because it would affect the reputation of the Hua family.","In the end, Aunt Xi had no choice but to let Feng Wu and the others go.","Fallen Star Yard.","Yu Mingye gloated. “Oh my, I’m dying of laughter. Actually, Aunt Xi has caught the real culprit, but she just let us go!”","Feng Xun darted at him with a dirty look. “Things are still at a stalemate. It’s not over yet. Xiao Wu is still in danger.”","After a pause, Feng Xun frowned again. “I think it’s even more dangerous now.”","Yu Mingye was shocked. “You’re making things up!”","Feng Xun said, “I’m not! I’m talking about human nature! If I were Mrs. Hua, and the two families are fighting right now, what should I do?”","Yu Mingye asked, “What should you do?”","Feng Xun said, “They used to be an alliance, so this is an internal conflict between them. Since they can’t resolve it, they’ll turn it into an external conflict. That way, they’ll be united against the common enemy, right?”","Yu Mingye’s heart skipped a beat.. “You mean...”"]},{"number":3563,"title":"Chapter 3563: Shocking News (15)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3563: Shocking News (15)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xun said, “It’s obvious that the Zuo family has been set up. If I were Mrs. Hua, I’d say that Hua Wushuang didn’t do it. If everyone says that they saw it, she’ll say that Hua Wushuang was impersonated.”","Yu Mingye said, “Holy crap! Don’t scare me!”","Feng Xun paced around the room anxiously and said, “I hope it’s not true, but why am I so flustered? You’ve never met the old lady of the Hua family, so you don’t know what she’s like. I’ve seen her before. She’s like a viper with a kind smile!","“She’ll fabricate evidence and say that Xiao Wu has disguised herself as Hua Wushuang. Then, she’ll kill Feng Wu and everyone else in the Feng clan with that excuse.”","Yu Mingye said, “I...”","Although he didn’t want to believe it, he somehow had a feeling that it was about to happen.","At that thought, Yu Mingye started running!","He rushed into the inner courtyard!","“Xiao wu, Xiao Wii!”","Yu Mingye found a remote woodshed where they kept Hua Wushuang.","Feng Wu put on the jade bracelets for Hua Wushuang, gave the latter a few shallow cuts, and dressed her in the bloody clothes. Hua Wushuang now looked the same as when Feng Wu rushed out of the Hua family.","It was also what Feng Wu looked like when she rushed into the carriage.","Yu Mingye led Feng Wu out.","Feng Wu looked at him in confusion. “What’s wrong?”","Yu Mingye said, “You’ve gone too far this time. Do you know...”","Yu Mingye told Feng Wu what Feng Xun had told him and said in a serious tone, “Not only isn’t the situation getting better, but the Hua family has also been given an excuse. Xiao Wu, don’t panic. I’ll take responsibility for this. As long as I’m alive, you won’t be alone!”","Feng Wu looked at Yu Mingye in surprise.","Although Yu Mingye was a silly boy, his concern for her was real.","Feng Wu smiled. “Don’t worry. How can I take precautions in advance? How can there be a miracle if I don’t have some trump cards?”","Yu Mingye’s eyes widened.","“So... so you had a plan?! You knew from the beginning what Mrs. Hua would do at this point?!”","Feng Wu nodded. “If I hadn’t expected it, I wouldn’t have challenged her. There’s no one to back me up.”","Yu Mingye said in frustration, “Yes, there is. At least, there’s me.”","Feng Wu smiled. “Got it. You’re there for me.”","Like an innocent child, Yu Mingye was delighted again. “What about your trump card?!”","Feng Wu pointed at the girl in front of her.","“Hua Wushuang? What kind of trump card is she? How are you going to use","At this moment, Hua Wushuang was in a daze. She was in a psychedelic state and looked like she was suffering from Qi Deviation.","Feng Wu smiled. “How can a trump card be called a trump card if you know what it is?”","Feng Xun arrived at that moment. Feng Wu waved at him and whispered something in his ear.","Feng Xun nodded and carried Hua Wushuang out.","Yu Mingye was a little jealous.. “What about me? What can I do for you?”"]},{"number":3564,"title":"Chapter 3564: Shocking News (16)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3564: Shocking News (16)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Yu Mingye was a little jealous. ‘What about me? What can I do for you?”","After some thought, Feng Wu said to Yu Mingye, ‘Why don’t you do it? Feng","Xun can stay here and cultivate.”","Yu Mingye said, “No problem. But what can he achieve in such a short time? Is he going to become a Spiritual Overlord? Don’t make me laugh!” Before Feng Wu could say anything, Yu Mingye waved at her. “I’m off.” He carried Hua Wushuang, who was in a daze, out of the door.","Feng Xun looked at Feng Wu in confusion. “Actually, Yu Mingye is right. If I stay here and cultivate, I won’t be able to achieve anything in a short time. I might as well...’","Feng Wu opened her hand and took out a few purple crystals.","Feng Xun said, “That’s... Holy crap! Don’t tell me they’re blood source crystals?!","You have them?!”","The blood source crystal was a peerless treasure for cultivation!","Feng Wu smiled. “It’s what helped me recover my cultivation.”","Feng Wu had dropped to a Level-4 Spiritual King, but she recovered to Level 6 and then rose to Level 8. It was all thanks to the blood source crystals she had found in the treasure room.","Feng Xun stared at Feng Wu. “Legend has it that 10,000 top-grade spirit stones can only be exchanged for one blood source crystal. You have four now! Where did you get them? Did you rob someone?” Feng Wu grinned at Feng Xun.","Feng Xun asked, “You really did?”","Feng Xun knew Feng Wu’s habits very well. She would never leave a room empty-handed. If she got into the Hua Manor... Feng Xun asked, “Did you get them from the Hua family?”","Feng Wu nodded.","Feng Xun said, “The Hua family is really unlucky. You walked in there like a weasel in a hen’s den.”","Feng Wu glanced at him and closed her palms. “You don’t want them, do you?”","“Hey, don’t! You’re my dearest sister!” Feng Xun begged her right away, and only then did he manage to get the four blood source crystals from her.","“I mean it. How did you get them? The Hua family should have put heavy guards on something as important as blood source crystals, right?”","Feng Wu smiled. “They have, but there are loopholes.”","Feng Xun said, “They’ll be furious when they know that they’ve lost the blood source crystal.”","Feng Wu smiled. “Of course, they will. That old lady of the Hua family has saved these crystals for her own breakthrough. Almost all cultivators below the Spiritual Overlord Stage use spiritual stones to make breakthroughs. Once we become Spiritual Overlords, it’ll be much easier for us to cultivate with the crystals. ”","Feng Xun said, “That old lady is going to explode. You’ve taken their most precious thing.”","Feng Wu said, “Who says it’s their most precious thing?”","Feng Xun said, ‘What?”","Feng Wu looked up to see Duan Chaoge running toward her.","“Xiao wu!”","Seeing Feng Wu, Duan Chaoge wouldn’t let go of her arm.","“I’ve been worried sick.” Duan Chaoge held Feng Wu in her arms. “I’ve finished what you told me to do.”","Feng Xun said, “That’s why I haven’t seen you for the past two days. You’ve been working for little Feng Wu.”","He looked at Feng Wu curiously. “What did you ask Chaoge to do for you this time?” Feng Wu smiled. “Heaven’s secrets can’t be divulged.”","“Tch!”","Feng Xun was so curious, but he also knew how tight-lipped Feng Wu was. If she didn’t want to tell him, no one could make her.."]},{"number":3565,"title":"Chapter 3565: Shocking News (17)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3565: Shocking News (17)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu took out a booklet from her ring and handed it to Duan Chaoge.","Duan Chaoge looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment, then took the booklet and read the cover.","True Flower Scripture.","Feng Xun’s eyes widened in surprise. “The True Flower Scripture?! If I remember correctly, it’s an ultimate skill that only the direct descendants of the Hua family can master! Hua Wushuang is the only one practicing it now. Even Hua Wuji isn’t qualified to learn it!","“This scripture teaches you the martial stances. I remember that Chaoge used to learn Unflower’s cultivation method!”","Feng Wu nodded. She was giving the True Flower Scripture to Duan Chaoge because it was a martial technique. Together with what Chaoge had learned before, it would double the effect.","Chaoge was over the moon.","“And this.” Feng Wu handed Duan Chaoge a jar of black ointment.","“What’s this?” Duan Chaoge asked curiously.","Feng Wu said, “I found this bodyforge ointment in the Hua clan’s vault. This one is all yours. And this is Bodyforging Technique.”","Duan Chaoge had both cultivation and martial techniques. Feng Wu decided to train her in both aspects from the very beginning so that she wouldn’t be in a hurry at a later stage.","Chaoge was about to put the things away when Feng Wu said, “Don’t wait. Go to your room and cultivate now. There’s going to be a fierce battle in the near future, and I don’t want you to get hurt.”","Duan Chaoge always listened to Feng Wu and would do whatever Feng Wu said.","She nodded obediently, went back to her room, and started her cultivation.","Feng Xun, on the other hand, stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","“The bodyforge ointment, the True Flower Scripture, and the blood source crystals... Xiao Wu, you didn’t empty the entire treasure room, did you?”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “How did you know?”","Feng Xun asked, “Really?!”","Feng Wu nodded indifferently.","Feng Xun was astonished.","“You... you...” Feng Xun didn’t know what to say.","He felt sorry for the Hua clan. How many years had it taken them to gather so many treasures? And she had taken them all at once!","“They shouldn’t have messed with you...” Feng Xun finally realized that the girl wasn’t the type to take things lying down. Just because she wasn’t capable enough didn’t mean that she would let them push her around. The Hua clan might suffer even more in the future.","Feng Wu smiled. “It’s just the things the Hua clan brought to the imperial capital. The Hua clan has been around for thousands of years. Their Flower","Valley must have a lot of good stuff.”","Feng Xun pointed at Feng Wu. “You... you’re after the Flower Valley as well?”","Feng Wu raised an eyebrow. “I’ll leave them alone if they don’t come after me, but what if they insist on destroying my clan and my entire family?”","Feng Xun agreed. “I hope they won’t take it too hard.”","The girl wasn’t just any ordinary girl. She was able to defeat the strong even though she was weaker than them.","Who would have thought that a mere Level-4 Spiritual King could turn the two major clans against each other and turn the imperial capital upside down?","Feng Xun said, “I need to go cultivate now. If I don’t work harder, Chaoge will catch up with me.”","As the successor of Unflower, Duan Chaoge was making rapid progress!","And there was Xuan Yi, who was about to make a breakthrough to the Spiritual Overlord Stage. Yu Mingye was already a Spiritual Overlord.","Feng Xun grew anxious and dashed off after that.."]},{"number":3566,"title":"Chapter 3566: Shocking News (18)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3566: Shocking News (18)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Seeing how flustered he was, Feng Wu chuckled.","So what if she had risked her life? As long as she could get stronger and make her family and friends stronger, everything would be worthwhile.","Feng Wu began to sort through the things she had obtained from the treasure rooms.","This time, she had cleared out two treasure rooms, and her storage space was filled to the brim.","There was indeed a lot of good stuff.","Apart from the elixirs and cultivation techniques, Feng Wu spotted a chest that was as tall as a grown man. She opened it to find steel needles that were almost a meter long.","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up as she studied the chest...","She gave away all the resources she could spare and stored the rest in her ring.","Just then, there was knocking on the door outside.","Everyone in Fallen Star Yard was cultivating, and Feng Wu was the only one who didn’t have anything better to do. Hence, she opened the gate with a wave of her hand.","A few people were standing outside.","Feng Wu recognized Feng Sang and Feng Yi.","Feng Yi held the hands of two children, a boy and a girl.","They were twins of four or five years old. Both were very pretty and cute as a button.","Feng Sang was a little embarrassed to see Feng Wu.","She said in a harsh tone, “My sister said... thank you for what you did last time!”","Feng Wu asked, “What are you referring to?”","Seeing that Feng Sang was going to snap, Feng Yi tugged at her sleeve, walked up to Feng Wu, and said, “My dear sister, it’s all thanks to you that I’m able to deal with Duke Li’s family. Otherwise, I wouldn’t be here today.”","Feng Yi asked around afterward and found out that her parents had been in the manor that day, but they were too scared to come out. They didn’t even open the door.","Only Feng Yi herself knew how desperate she felt.","Feng Wu saw the sincerity in Feng Yi’s limpid eyes, and she sounded very sincere.","Feng Wu felt a little guilty.","After inviting them to sit down in the courtyard, Feng Wu poured some tea for Feng Yi and said mildly, “I’ll be honest with you. In fact, I’m the reason that they’ve treated you like that. If the Spiritual Overlords aren’t coming after me, you wouldn’t have been incriminated. You’ll still live happily in Duke Li’s manor now.”","Feng Sang glanced at Feng Wu and snorted. “So, you do know that.”","Feng Yi threw a stern look at Feng Sang, then turned to Feng Wu with a gentle look on her face. Taking Feng Wu’s hand, Feng Yi smiled bitterly. “Without you,","I’d still be living in hell in the Duke’s Mansion. I’d wish I were dead.”","Only then did Feng Wu learn that Li Chaopan didn’t like Feng Yi at all. Her mother-in-law was very strict with her, and her father-in-law didn’t like her either. All the servants followed suit.","“If it hadn’t been for you, I wouldn’t have been able to see my children because my mother-in-law has been raising them in her courtyard.. ‘","Feng Yi only felt much better after she told Feng Wu about her marriage.","“Without you, I would have had a nervous breakdown one day, and I could have hanged myself. Xiao Wu, I’m really grateful.”","Feng Wu could sense Feng Yi’s gratitude from the bottom of her heart, but she didn’t like it when other people thanked her. She preferred to argue with her enemies and make them frustrated.","Feng Wu wasn’t good at small talky so she looked at the two children.","“Wait a minute..”"]},{"number":3567,"title":"Chapter 3567: Shocking News (19)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3567: Shocking News (19)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up when she saw the twins.","Feng Yi two children to greet Feng Wu.","Feng Wu waved her hand and asked, “These two kids... Can they start cultivating?”","Feng Yi winced at the mention of it.","She said with a sad look on her face, “Niuniu was born with no cultivation talent. Duke Li has sent someone to examine her, and they said that Niuniu could never cultivate, but because she was pretty, the old lady kept Niuniu with her so that she could marry her off in the future.","“As for Dabao, I heard that he’s one of the least talented types. Even if he cultivates, he can reach the Spiritual Master Stage at most. So...","“But Li Chaopan still has other children as well. His favorite is Luo’s child, a seven-year-old boy. He’s very talented and has started cultivating at such a young age. He’s already a Spiritual Master now.” Feng Yi sounded pained.","No wonder she had a hard life over there.","“His concubine’s child is seven years old now? You haven’t been married for seven years, have you?” Feng Wu asked with a frown.","Feng Yi nodded. “Luo gave birth to Li Chaopan’s eldest son before I married him.”","Feng Wu asked, “Why would you marry someone like that?”","Feng Yi stopped talking right away...","“When Lady Wang married you off, did she know that Li Chaopan already had a son by his concubine?” Feng Wu asked casually.","Feng Sang interjected in a hurry. “Duke Li kept it a secret, and we only found out about it afterward... My mother didn’t know at first.”","Feng Wu asked, “Really?”","Feng Sang said, “I think so.”","Feng Wu smiled a little and didn’t say another word.","Because Feng Wu was the one who had started the whole thing, she felt a little guilty toward Feng Yi. Seeing the two children, Feng Wu wanted to make it up to them.","She opened her palm to reveal two green pills.","“Eat it.” Feng Wu gave one to each child.","The two children looked at Feng Yi timidly.","Feng Yi knew that Feng Wu wouldn’t harm them, so she said to the two children, “Aunt Wu gave it to you. Be good and eat it.”","The two kids stuffed the pills into their mouths.","But Feng Sang frowned. “Don’t eat it yet. Who knows what it is?”","She then turned to Feng Wu. “What’s this?”","Feng Wu said lightly, “Good stuff.”","Feng Sang asked, “What good stuff? What if they kill the kids?”","Feng Wu glanced at Feng Sang. “If you ate that when you were little, you wouldn’t be so weak now.”","Feng Sang stared at Feng Wu and frowned. “What’s that supposed to mean?” Feng Wu said, “If you ate that when you were little, you wouldn’t have asked me what it meant.”","Feng Sang was speechless.","Feng Sang was about to argue with Feng Wu when Feng Yi said, “Don’t worry. Xiao Wu won’t harm us. Dabao, Niuniu, eat your pills.”","The two children swallowed the pills.","The pill melted as soon as it entered their mouths. The energy soon spread through their system.","Feng Sang asked nervously, “Are they going to be alright? Feng Wu, what did you give them?”","Feng Wu didn’t speak.","But soon, the two kids began to react.","“They’re sweating.” Feng Yi saw the sweat on Dabao’s forehead. When she touched it, she saw that her palms were covered with sweat, which was black in color.","Then, the same thing happened to Niuniu.."]},{"number":3568,"title":"Chapter 3568: Shocking News (20)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3568: Shocking News (20)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Sang had a vague idea. She looked up and stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","Feng Wu said, “Take them back and let them rest well. They’ll feel refreshed after they wake up and take a bath. The filth will be washed away.","Feng Yi followed Feng Wu’s instructions and carried the twins away.","But Feng Sang didn’t leave. She kept staring at Feng Wu in astonishment.","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at her. “Why are you still here?”","Feng Sang said, “Tell me the truth. What did you feed them?”","Feng Wu said, “Poison.”","Feng Sang stared at Feng Wu. “You won’t do that.”","Feng Wu said, “If you have time to keep an eye on me, go back and take good care of them.”","Feng Sang had a feeling, but she wasn’t sure, so she had to keep it to herself. “I’ll go back and take care of them. If anything happens to them, I’ll make you pay!”","Feng Wu waved her hand impatiently.","Feng Sang ran off as fast as she could.","Feng Wu thought, “I still have quite a few cleansing pills from the Hua clan.” If Feng Sang had been nicer, Feng Wu would have given her one, but she just had to be so grumpy.","Feng Sang ran back home to find the two kids sweating profusely. She was a little frightened, so she went to look for Feng Yanfeng.","Feng Yanfeng wasn’t here, but Lady Wang was.","Lady Wang rushed over as soon as she heard what had happened.","No matter how an adult changed, their nature would remain the same.","Lady Wang had always been a self-interested person. Although Feng Wu was on friendly terms with Lady Wang’s family, Lady Wang was still very alarmed.","“What’s wrong with my dear grandchildren? Did Feng Wu do something to them?!” Immediately, Lady Wang tried to blame everything on Feng Wu. Feng Sang explained in a hurry. “It doesn’t have to be poison!”","Lady Wang didn’t hear any of that. She rushed over to the two kids and saw that they were covered in black sweat. She already had a problem with Feng wu!","“Dabao, Niuniu, my dearest babies...” Holding them, Lady Wang wanted to take revenge on Feng Wu.","Feng Yi stopped her right away. “Mother, it’s not necessarily a bad thing. Xiao","Wu said they’ll be fine after they wake up and take a bath.”","Lady Wang flared up. “Of course, it’s a bad thing! Feel their foreheads! They’re burning up! What kind of mother are you? How can you speak up for an outsider?! Get Feng Wu here!”","Feng Yi pushed Lady Wang toward the door.","Lady Wang said, “What are you doing? What’s this?”","Feng Yi pushed Lady Wang out of the room, slammed the door shut, and locked it.","Lady Wang banged on the door. “Feng Yi, do you have any idea what you’re doing? Open up! Open this door right now!”","However, Feng Yi didn’t listen to Lady Wang this time.","Feng Sang looked at Feng Yi in admiration. “Sister, you’re so brave...”","Feng Yi shook her head. “Xiao Sang, you’re still young and haven’t experienced the hardships of life. You won’t understand a lot of things, and you won’t be able to see through other people like I used to.","“But after what happened, I finally realized something. Mothers aren’t born to be kind to their children, and some are snobbish..","“Actually, our mother knew that Li Chaopan had a concubine’s son before we were married, and she even knew that he wasn’t a decent person..”"]},{"number":3569,"title":"Chapter 3569: Shocking News (21)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3569: Shocking News (21)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“But she still kept it from me and insisted that I marry him. She did it all for the sake of the Duke Li’s status and prestige. Over the years, our parents have borrowed a lot of money from Duke Li. You don’t know this, do you? Because of that, Duke Li’s family doesn’t see me as a human being anymore.","“Our parents were at home on that day when I was sent back. They were afraid that Li Chaopan would ask them to pay back their debts, so they kept their doors shut. What kind of parents are they?","“Do you think there’s anyone in our family that can lead this family? Xiao Wu is our only hope now. She’s the one who can bring glory to our clan. She’s a genius. Why do you have to go against her?","“After hearing everything you told me, I think Xiao Wu is the one who’s on the right, whereas our family has never been reasonable. Not only that, but they’ve also been picking on t Feng Wu’s family. Xiao Sang, think about it. Isn’t that true?","“Therefore, I choose to trust Xiao Wu this time. I’m sure she won’t harm me. Feng Yi stared at Feng Sang and stressed each word.","Feng Sang took her words to heart and sighed. “Actually, I know perfectly well that Feng Wu is on the right. I just can’t get over what I’m feeling. Feng Wu was a genius when she was little. I wouldn’t have reacted differently if she had remained that way, but when she became useless and I thought I could defeat her, she rose again... Envy is the worst feeling.","“Of course, I’ve figured it out now. Feng Wu is so powerful that I can never catch up with her. I can’t even see how high up she is now and have given up on competing with her. So don’t worry. I won’t be jealous of her anymore. Once I stop comparing myself with her, I can see how capable she is.”","Feng Yi nodded. “That’s why our mother is wrong. We can’t follow her blindly. We should have our own opinions.”","Feng Sang said, “Yes!”","Outside, Lady Wang had no idea what decision her two daughters had made. If she did, she would probably be furious.","It seemed forever before the two children woke up.","After Feng Yi cleaned them up, they all put on fluffy sleeping gowns, which made them look even more adorable.","“Wait!” Feng Sang’s eyes widened when she examined them.","“What’s wrong?” Feng Yi was still concerned.","“Why do I feel spiritual essence in them? Wait, let me feel them again!”","Instinctively, Feng Sang thought that she was mistaken, but when she examined them again, she realized in astonishment that there really was spiritual essence!","“They;re Level-3 Spiritual Masters!” Feng Sang almost couldn’t stand still.","She stared at Feng Yi and said in disbelief, “Both Dabao and Niuniu are Level-3 Spiritual Masters!”","“What?”","Feng Yi was so shocked. “W- What did you say? Level-3 Spiritual Masters?","Aren’t they useless and can’t cultivate?”","Feng Sang said, “But... but they really are Level-3 Spiritual Masters. Wait here.","I’ll go get our father!”","Feng Sang opened the door and dashed off after that.","When Feng Sang opened the door, Lady Wang was finally able to come in.","She rushed into the room and smacked Feng Yi on the forehead.. “You traitor! Are you going to ignore your mother now? How dare you shut your mother","out..."]},{"number":3570,"title":"Chapter 3570: Litte Genius (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3570: Litte Genius (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lady Wang went on and on, but Feng Yi didn’t react at all.","Because she was still immersed in what Feng Sang said.","Level-3 Spiritual Masters?","Level-3 Spiritual Masters?!","How was this possible?","“Did you hear me?!”","Seeing that Feng Yi’s mind had wandered off, Lady Wang smacked her on the head with all her strength.","That woke Feng Yi up.","“Mother?” Feng Yi frowned at Lady Wang.","Lady Wang glared back at her. “I’m talking to you! Can’t you hear me? What’s wrong with you? You went to Fallen Star Yard, and you’re acting strangely! What did Feng Wu do to you? Why won’t you listen to your mother?”","Feng Wu? Green pills? Level-3 Spiritual Masters?!","Feng Yi turned around and stared at her two children with twinkling eyes.","Just then, Feng Sang arrived with Feng Yanfeng, and Feng Yiran arrived in a hurry as well.","“Father, look! See if they’re Level-3 Spiritual Masters!”","Feng Sang pushed Feng Yanfeng in front of the two kids.","The two children looked at their grandpa with their big innocent eyes.","Their grandfather wasn’t very friendly to them, so they were a little scared.","“Dabao, Niuniu, don’t be afraid. I’m just checking on you. Don’t worry.”","Feng Yanfeng wouldn’t believe it when Feng Sang told him about it.","Who was she kidding? The two kids were hopeless. One had little talent, and the other one had no talent at all. Feng Yanfeng decided that he would find a chance to marry Feng Yi off. As for the two kids, he would leave them in the Feng clan for the rest of their lives.","Feng Yanfeng examined them without much hope.","He had thought that he could just give them a quick examination so that Feng Sang wouldn’t get too excited. As it turned out, he really discovered something.","Lady Wang was still complaining to Feng Yanfeng about how disobedient Feng Yi was.","She was still talking nonstop when Feng Yanfeng bellowed, “Shut up!”","Lady Wang stared at Feng Yanfeng in disbelief...","“Are you scolding me?”","Feng Yanfeng didn’t have time for this and bellowed again, “Just shut up!” He was genuinely angry.","Lady Wang had always bullied the weak and feared the strong. When Feng Yanfeng flared up, she cringed and hid behind Feng Yi. She didn’t dare to utter a word.","Feng Yanfeng looked amazed as he murmured, “It’s real? How can this be? Is it that amazing?","Feng Yi went up to him. “Father?”","Feng Yanfeng said, “They’re only three and a half years old, but they’re already","Level-3 Spiritual Masters. That’s incredible!”","The kids hadn’t even started cultivating yet, and even if they had, they would have to work on strengthening their bodies first. No one had ever reached the Spiritual Master Stage before they were three or four...","Feng Yanfeng asked in a hurry, “What happened? Why is this happening all of a sudden?”","Feng Yi asked with tears in her eyes, “Father, is this good news?”","Feng Yanfeng’s eyes widened. “If that’s not good news, what is? This is great news! The Feng clan is going to have two geniuses! Do you still remember Li Chaopan’s eldest son? He was a Level-3 Spiritual Master when he was seven, and he was already considered very talented.. Your kids are already Level-3 Spiritual Masters now!”"]},{"number":3571,"title":"Chapter 3571: Litte Genius (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3571: Litte Genius (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Yanfeng urged, “So, what happened? Why are they like this all of a","sudden","She then told Feng Yanfeng about the two green pills that Feng Wu had given the kids.","Feng Sang added, “Feng Xiaoqi is going to be a Spiritual King soon...”","Feng Yanfeng was astonished!","He stared at Feng Sang.","Feng Sang nodded. “I ran into Feng Xiaoqi a few days ago. He said it himself. He’s one step away from the Spiritual King Stage.","“And there’s Duan Chaoge. She’s almost a Spiritual King!”","Feng Yanfeng gasped.","Feng Wu was surrounded by geniuses.","“Did Feng Wu give them the legendary Dragon Marrow Cleansing Pill? It’s the only thing that can turn a talentless person into a good cultivator. But such a precious thing...’","Lady Wang was confused. “Is it very precious?”","Feng Yanfeng said, “Of course! A treasure that can turn an inferior endowment into a spiritual one is priceless. You can’t buy it with spiritual stones. I didn’t expect that girl to be so generous...”","Lady Wang, however, was suspicious. “Is it a trap?”","Feng Yi said in a hurry, “No, Xiao Wu is kind to us.”","Lady Wang glared at Feng Yi. ‘What did that girl do to you to make you flatter her?”","Feng Yanfeng mumbled, “I’d flatter her if she gave me the Dragon Marrow","Cleansing Pill.”","Lady Wang looked at Feng Yanfeng suspiciously. “What did you say, my lord?”","Feng Yanfeng said, “Nothing.”","Lady Wang said, “I have a feeling that girl isn’t up for good. There must be a trap!”","Feng Yanfeng said, “I’ll talk to the elders. Since Feng Yi has divorced, her children are the Feng clan’s children.”","Feng Yanfeng went to the forbidden area at the back of the mountain himself.","There was silence.","Everyone silently looked at the two children.","Feng Sang was in a dilemma...","Dragon Transformation Marrow Cleansing Pill..","Feng Wu gave away two such pills! Two!","She casually gave it to the two children.","Feng Sang thought that if she had one...","She would love to get her hands on it.","Feng Sang and Feng Yiran looked at each other and saw the most intense desire in each other’s eyes.","Feng Yiran said, “Do you think she has more?”","Feng Sang said in frustration, “Even if she did, she wouldn’t give it to us. After all, we’ve offended her before.”","Feng Yiran lowered his voice. “That’s all in the past. She’s so powerful now, and she’s friends with such amazing people. I don’t think she’ll hold it against a nobody like us, do you?”","Feng Sang said, “In that case, let’s go and ask her for help.”","Although the two of them spoke in low voices, Lady Wang had heard everything clearly.","She exploded!","She smacked both of her children.","“What are you two talking about?! Ask Feng Wu for help? Huh? You’re going to beg Feng Wu for some pills? How dare you!” Lady Wang was infuriated!","Feng Sang got angry too. “She’s our sister!”","Lady Wang said, “She’s only your cousin!”","Feng Sang said, “Fine, she’s my cousin, but that’s close enough. I used to be close to her when we were young, but you kept telling us that Feng Wu was stealing our cultivation resources. We only became estranged because of you.” Lady Wang couldn’t believe what she had just heard.","She was so angry that she wanted to hit Feng Sang, but Feng Sang ran up to Feng Yiran and hid behind him.."]},{"number":3572,"title":"Chapter 3572: Little Genius (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3572: Little Genius (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lady Wang was infuriated. “Don’t forget that Feng Wu killed your sister!”","Feng Yiran looked at Lady Wang. “Mother, I’ve been meaning to tell you... Liu was the one who tried to kill Feng Wu first, and she kept doing it.” Lady Wang said, “But Feng Wu killed her!”","Feng Yiran said, “Feng Wu didn’t kill her. Liu fell down herself...’","Lady Wang was furious. ‘You... you... Are you trying to give me a heart attack?!”","Feng Yiran and Feng Sang, who had been united by her side, no longer saw Feng Wu as their enemy. They even wanted to betray her!","Feng Sang said, “Mother, why don’t you understand? Feng Wu is the Feng clan’s only hope now. We should...’","Lady Wang was infuriated. “I don’t care! I just want Feng Wu dead!”","Feng Sang and Feng Yiran looked at each other, their eyes filled with pain.","His mother had been married into the Feng clan for so long. Did she still not treat the Feng clan as her own family?","Just then, they heard footsteps outside. “Who ignores the benefit of the Feng clan and wants Feng Wu dead?!” The one who spoke was Elder Grain!","The other two elders of the restricted area were cultivating and busy dealing with the incoming Spiritual Overlords. Therefore, only Elder Grain came this time.","The moment Elder Grain arrived, the temperature instantly dropped.","Elder Grain stared at Lady Wang with his cold eyes. Lady Wang felt a chill run down her spine, and her body went limp. She almost fainted.","Elder Grain stared at Feng Yanfeng and said coldly, “You haven’t divorced your wife yet?”","Lady Wang dropped to her knees.","Feng Sang begged, “Elder Grain, Mother... will repent. She’ll repent. What she said was unintentional. She...’","Elder Grain glanced at Feng Sang and said nothing.","He walked in front of the two children and carefully examined them. Finally, a smile appeared on his face. “Good.”","Feng Yanfeng was thrilled. “Elder Grain, are they really Level-3 Spiritual Masters?”","Elder Grain nodded. “They’re more than that. In the next few days, it’s very likely that they’ll advance to Level 4. Xiao Wu really is the hope of our clan.”","In the end, Elder Grain looked at Feng Yi. “Are you willing to let us raise these two children in the forbidden area at the back of the mountain?”","Feng Yi had seen Elder Grain when she was young and had also been examined by him.","Back then, Elder Grain was disappointed and said that this child had little talent. Let her be an ordinary person.","Feng Yi nodded. “Of course!”","She quickly got the two children to kneel down and greet Elder Grain.","Lady Wang watched helplessly as Elder Grain led the two future prodigies away. She felt extremely aggrieved.","Feng Sang gave Lady Wang one last look. “Mother, I advise you to be kind. If you still want to go against Xiao Wu, you can do it yourself. I won’t follow you blindly anymore. I’m old enough to know what’s right and what’s wrong.” With that, Feng Sang turned around and left.","Feng Yiran walked up to Lady Wang and gave her a silent look. In the end, he said, “Mother, what happened to Liu should teach you a lesson. Just... think about it.”","Feng Yiran left after that.","Lady Wang watched them leave in silence. In the end, she burst into tears...","Seeing Lady Wang’s reaction, Feng Yi went up to her and knelt down beside her. She heaved a long sigh. “Mother, it’s time for you to be reasonable..”"]},{"number":3573,"title":"Chapter 3573: Where Are the Treasures (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3573: Where Are the Treasures (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Meanwhile in the Hua clan.","Mrs. Hua sat quietly in the Ink Cleansing Hall, holding the prayer beads in her hand and counting them one by one with her eyes closed.","No one dared to enter the house, let alone disturb him.","Everyone was perfectly silent and trembling in fear, afraid that the old lady would kill them all in anger.","Outside the hall stood the eldest Master Hua and Hua Wuyin, his brother, as well as their wives and children.","Everyone in the Hua family was gathered outside the door, waiting for the old lady’s instructions.","The old lady was the backbone of the clan. Once she was gone, the Hua family wouldn’t know what to do.","Master Hua was the most anxious because the one in trouble was his daughter, Hua Wushuang.","It took him some painstaking effort to persuade the Zuo family to leave.","At first, the Zuo family wouldn’t leave, but Master Hua told them that he would hand Hua Wushuang over to the Zuo family when he found her. Only then did the Zuo family leave reluctantly.","“Have you found Wushuang?” Master Hua asked anxiously when he saw Aunt Xi.","Aunt Xi shook her head at him.","Master Hua was instantly enraged. “What have you been doing?! How could you let Wushuang do such a thing? Now, you actually can’t find her?!”","Aunt Xi had just been humiliated by Yu Mingye, and now that she was back, she had to listen to this. How frustrating.","“Aunt Xi, come in.”","Mrs. Hua’s indifferent voice came from inside.","Aunt Xi knew that the old lady was in an extremely gloomy mood.","She carefully entered and quietly closed the door before walking to the old lady.","“How did it go?” Mrs. Hua stared at Aunt Xi.","Aunt Xi’s expression was ugly as she shook her head. “I couldn’t find Miss Wushuang. I’ve searched everywhere, but there’s no sign of her. It’s as if... she suddenly disappeared from this world.” Mrs. Hua said, “She has to be somewhere.”","Aunt Xi said, “But I really...”","Mrs. Hua said, “Unless she’s hiding somewhere, or someone is hiding her!”","Aunt Xi said, “Then do you think she’s been hidden against her will? Could it be the doing of the Zuo family...”","Mrs. Hua shook her head. “No. If the Zuo family had found her before us, Zuo","Ming and his wife wouldn’t have acted that way. They’re just average actors.”","Mrs. Hua pondered for a moment and said to Aunt Xi, “Did you encounter anything strange?”","Aunt Xi shook her head.","Mrs. Hua asked, “Not even a little?!”","Aunt Xi thought for a moment, then remembered Yu Mingye’s carriage and Feng Wu. So, she told Mrs. Hua about it.","“Feng Wu?” Mrs. Hua frowned.","Aunt Xi said, “Yu Mingye and Feng Xun were there, and they took her home in a carriage. It seemed... fine.”","Mrs. Hua asked Aunt Xi for more details, such as Feng Wu’s clothes and accessories, and Aunt Xi answered all of them.","Mrs. Hua thought about it, but still couldn’t figure out what was wrong with Feng Wu. However, she felt that something was amiss.","“Go to the treasure room and get the Self-questioning Mirror,” Mrs. Hua told","Aunt Xi.","Aunt Xi nodded and left quickly.","The Self-questioning Mirror was a magical mirror.","It was Mrs. Hua’s habit to ask the mirror if she was indecisive.","After Aunt Xi left, a name kept appearing in Mrs. Hua’s mind.","Feng Wu.","She finally understood what was wrong.","Rumor had it that Jun Linyuan and Feng Wu were close, and even Mrs. Hua had seen it with her own eyes.."]},{"number":3574,"title":"Chapter 3574: Where Are the Treasures (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3574: Where Are the Treasures (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Mrs. Hua hadn’t kept the empress dowager’s promise of marriage a secret, nor had the empress dowager. However, Feng Wu had been too quiet. How could she not do anything?","Did Feng Wu do something about what happened between Hua Wushuang and Zuo Qingxi? That was what Mrs. Hua thought.","She immediately started investigating!","But there was no trace at all.","The incident between Hua Wushuang and Zuo Qingxi was flawless. Everyone","witnessed Hua Wushuang attacking Zuo Qingxi with their own eyes.","Wait!","Mrs. Hua’s heart skipped a beat!","She knew her own medical skills very well. She was very confident in helping Zuo Qingxi with reattaching his body part because she had done it before!","Back then, she had caught her husband cheating. In a fit of anger, she cut off his member. Later on, she personally reattached it. That was why she tried to treat Zuo Qingxi.","But Zuo Qingxi was dead. That shouldn’t have happened.","Was something wrong with him before that?","Mrs. Hua frowned. Actually, when she examined Zuo Qingxi’s dead body, she didn’t find anything wrong with it, but some hidden injuries could be manifested after death.","No, she had to check Zuo Qingxi’s body again!","At this thought, Mrs. Hua stood up and was about to go to the Zuo family.","But soon, she came up with a brilliant idea.","What if Zuo Qingxi had no internal injuries?","No, she had to make one up.","Hadn’t Zuo Qingxi and Feng Wu had an argument before? Mrs. Hua decided that she could accuse Feng Wu of being the culprit and say that Zuo Qingxi had died because Feng Wu had injured him.","This wasn’t enough.","How was she going to pin more blame on Feng Wu?","Wasn’t Feng Wu a Semi-divine medicine refiner? If that were the case, she must have a drug that could control people’s minds. Mrs. Hua would say that Feng Wu had drugged Hua Wushuang, which was why Wushuang had lost her mind!","Wushuang acted like a mad person when she ran out.","What about the motive?","It couldn’t be more obvious. If Feng Wu wanted to have Jun Linyuan to herself, she only had to kill Hua Wushuang and drag the Zuo family into the mess. That way, she would be the winner.","Mrs. Hua was shocked by her own brilliant idea!","How could she be so smart?!","What if Feng Wu wouldn’t admit it?","Well, Mrs. Hua would make sure that Feng Wu had to admit everything.","“It should be Feng Wu’s honor to be the scapegoat for the Hua clan.”","Mrs. Hua decided to leave Feng Wu’s body intact to show her kindness.","Just as Mrs. Hua was happily imagining all the plans in her mind, Aunt Xi rushed in like a gust of wind!","Aunt Xi had always been a steady person. When had she ever been so flustered?","Thump!","Aunt Xi broke through a door and flew in!","Mrs. Hua looked up and stared at her with a frown.","Before Aunt Xi could get up from the ground, she was already shouting, “Ma’am, you have to take a look at the treasure room now!” Mrs. Hua’s heart sank. She had a very bad feeling.","“Quickly!” Aunt Xi was so anxious that she almost couldn’t think straight.","Mrs. Hua didn’t say anything else. She stood up and rushed to the treasure room.","The treasure room was built underground, and there were formations inside and outside. Only two people could come and go freely. One was Mrs. Hua, and the other was Aunt Xi.","Of course, Aunt Xi was only allowed to enter after receiving Mrs. Hua’s order and obtaining the password.","The room used a dynamic password that would be changed automatically every two hours.."]},{"number":3575,"title":"Chapter 3575: Where Are the Treasures (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3575: Where Are the Treasures (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","This was the spirit formation that Mrs. Hua had set up. She had always been proud of it.","Mrs. Hua and Aunt Xi rushed toward the treasury...","There was a group of people waiting in Mrs. Hua’s courtyard.","Her both sons were there.","Seeing that Mrs. Hua had left in a hurry, everyone followed her, afraid that they would miss something.","Hua Wuji held her mother’s hand. “Mother... This doesn’t seem right.","Grandmother has always been strong and steady, but now she’s staggering.","“And there’s Aunt Xi. She’s usually so arrogant and only cares about Grandma and Hua Wushuang, but just now, she ran into the door in a panic. Mother, why am I so flustered?”","“That’s the direction of the treasure room,” her mother said seriously. “When we came to the imperial capital, we brought many treasures from the Flower Valley. Many are all extremely precious things.”","Soon, they arrived at the treasure room.","Mrs. Hua used the dynamic password to enter. Aunt Xi didn’t dare to enter, but in the end, she braced herself and followed Mrs. Hua, while the others stayed outside.","Mrs. Hua went in alone. When she saw that the huge treasure room was empty, she was dumbfounded.","There was nothing left...","The shelves were all empty...","Mrs. Hua was already using a walking stick. However, at this moment, she was walking as fast as she could and rushed out to open all kinds of hidden mechanisms!","The first hidden compartment was empty!","The second hidden compartment was empty!","The third hidden compartment was empty!","The Mica Energy...","Self-questioning Mirror...","Blood source crystals...","Dragon Transformation Marrow Cleansing Pills...","All the treasures disappeared overnight!","The Flower Valley had accumulated the treasures for many years. How could they be gone?","Mrs. Hua almost fainted!","“What’s going on here?!","“Where’s everything?!","“Why are they all gone?!”","Mrs. Hua glared at Aunt Xi viciously and questioned her!","“Answer me!”","Mrs. Hua whipped Aunt Xi with her hard-wood walking stick. “Speak!”","Aunt Xi was sent flying and hit the wooden shelf with a bang. She was dizzy, and blood dripped from the corner of her mouth.","But Aunt Xi didn’t dare to fight back at all. She crawled over silently and knelt in front of Mrs. Hua.","“I... I really don’t know...","“After I sent the mica energy back last night, I left...","“Because you have the password, I thought no one would approach..","Mrs. Hua was very confident in her formation, and the treasure room was underground, so she only sent two experts to guard it.","“Come out!”","Those two experts were both elders at the Spiritual Overlord Stage. At this moment, they were kneeling in front of Mrs. Hua.","“Speak!” Mrs. Hua roared.","However, Mrs. Hua couldn’t get any useful information from them.","Because what they told Mrs. Hua was exactly what Aunt Xi said.","From the moment Aunt Xi left until just now, no one had entered.","“That’s impossible.” Mrs. Hua frowned. “Could there be an Invisibility Spell in this world?”","Who the hell was it?","As for the Invisibility Spell... Master Phoenix did have such a spell, but no mortals could use it.","As for invisibility tools...","Suddenly, Mrs.. Hua’s eyes flickered!"]},{"number":3576,"title":"Chapter 3576: Change of Plan (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3576: Change of Plan (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The Zuo family!","Legend had it that a powerful cultivator had received a feather from Master Phoenix. Later, he used the feather to make an invisibility cloak. From then on, the cloak was used in the mortal world.","Mrs. Hua had heard from Zuo Chengfeng a few years ago that he had obtained this cloak..","Could it be... Zuo Chengfeng?!","One needed the dynamic password to enter or leave the room.","Even with an invisibility cloak, one still had to open the door.","Mrs. Hua studied the door seriously. After a long time, she really managed to figure it out!","Since Aunt Xi entered last night till now, the door had only opened three times.","The first time was when Aunt Xi entered the room the night before.","The second time was when Aunt Xi entered the room just now.","The third time was when Mrs. Hua entered.","And someone had gone out three times!","Aunt Xi left the room twice. Mrs. Hua had never left the room since she came in, so that extra time... Who was it?!","The only explanation now was that the other party was wearing an invisibility cloak and followed behind Aunt Xi. After Aunt Xi left, they stole all the treasures!","At the thought of this, Mrs. Hua gripped the walking stick tightly with her withered hand, and anger burned in her eyes!","They couldn’t have followed Aunt Xi the second time because by then, the room was already empty.","Therefore, after eliminating all the impossibilities, the only possibility left was... That person followed Aunt Xi into the treasure room the night before!","Last night...","Mrs. Hua remembered that not long after Aunt Xi left, the old man from the Zuo family followed her in.","The Zuo family...","The Zuo family!","Mrs. Hua was so angry that her chest heaved!","She was discussing a collaboration with Old Master Zuo, but the old man actually set her up.","Mrs. Hua recalled that when she was young, Zuo Chengfeng courted her and swore he would marry no one but her. But now, he was so vicious that he even stole from the Hua familv’s treasure vault! Was the Zuo familv so Dettv now?!","Mrs. Hua wanted to question Zuo Chengfeng, but she controlled herself in the end.","Calm down.","What if it wasn’t him?","Although all the evidence pointed to him, what if it wasn’t him?","Mrs. Hua still wanted to work with the Zuo family.","She took a deep breath and walked out of the treasure room, closing the door solemnly.","Aunt Xi also walked out.","The others rushed over.","Her eldest son asked, “Mother, did something happen to the treasure room?”","The head of the Hua family was Mrs. Hua, and she was the one who called all the shots. Her son had no actual power and listened to everything his mother said.","Mrs. Hua shook her head lightly. “I just lost something. It’s fine. Go back to your own business.”","Did he just lose a little something?","Hua Wuji frowned suspiciously.","The old lady was such a calm person, but she lost a shoe while she was running just then. A little something? Hua Wuji didn’t believe it.","After Mrs. Hua returned to her room, she immediately summoned someone and gave him some instructions.","The person ran toward the Zuo family like a gust of wind.","In the Fallen Star Yard.","When Yu Mingye returned, he ran to Feng Wu in excitement.","Feng Wu glanced at him. “You’re back.”","Feng Wu had made another breakthrough while she was cultivating, and she had to thank the Hua family for the resources.","Otherwise, her body-forging technique wouldn’t have been able to improve so quickly.","Feng Wu had just finished cultivating when Yu Mingye returned.."]},{"number":3577,"title":"Chapter 3577: Change of Plan (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3577: Change of Plan (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“It’s done!” Yu Mingye gloated. “The Hua family is looking for Hua Wushuang, and so is the Zuo family. I put her in the Zuo family’s house, and sure enough, the Spiritual Overlord of the Zuo family found her first and took her away!","“The Spiritual Overlord of the Zuo family is quite powerful. He’s at least at Level 5. They call him Elder Lei.”","According to the convention of the Junwu Empire, one could be called an elder once they reached the Spiritual Overlord Stage.","Yu Mingye said, “By the way, didn’t you ask my elder to put the stuff in the Zuo family’s house and frame them? Don’t worry, my elder has done everything he can for you. I guarantee that the Hua family will be able to trace it back to the Zuo family.”","Feng Wu thought about the details and decided that she hadn’t missed anything, so she said, “Now, it’s time for the big show.”","Yu Mingye was thrilled. “What’s next? Tell me!”","What Feng Wu asked him to do was random. Yu Mingye still hadn’t figured out what Feng Wu was up to.","Feng Wu had four groups of people that she could use at the moment.","The first was Emperor Wu’s men, who were five senior Spiritual Overlords.","If it weren’t for the fact that she was in a life-and-death situation, Feng Wu wouldn’t have used them, because they would tell Emperor Wu everything she did.","It wasn’t that Feng Wu didn’t trust Emperor Wu, but that she didn’t want to owe Emperor Wu a favor.","No one wanted to owe an emperor a favor.","The second group was from Northern Feng Mansion, but because most of them had been taken away by Northern Feng General, only a few people were left to guard the mansion. Feng Wu didn’t want to use them unless she had to.","The third group was Yu Mingye’s men.","Yu Mingye only brought three of his elders with him, but they were all at the peak of the Spiritual Overlord Stage and were capable of fighting!","The fourth group was the three elders of the Feng clan.","Those three elders in the forbidden area were all that the clan had left.","Just then, Little Phoenix sent a report to Feng Wu. “Xiao Wu, they’ve found out about the treasure room. That old woman already knows about the theft! You were so right! She’s suspecting the Zuo family and has sent people to the Zuo family to check if they have the treasures!","“You have to be careful. From what that old woman said, she really wants to frame you!","“She wants to use your status as a Semi-divine medicine refiner and say that you poisoned Hua Wushuang. That’s why she did such a thing!","“Motive? She says you want to steal Jun Linyuan from Hua Wushuang! Hey, don’t scold me. I didn’t say that.”","Feng Wu went back to the Feng clan, but Little Phoenix stayed there. Because it could become invisible now, it had been lying next to the flower pot in Mrs. Hua’s room, reporting to Feng Wu.","“How did I know that? That old woman and Hua Wushuang’s father were discussing how to scheme against you and completely destroy the Feng clan!","“Alright, alright... I’ll keep an eye on her for you.","“Hey, the scout is back. He said that he did find something belonging to the Hua family’s treasure room in the Zuo family’s house. It’s confirmed that Zuo Chengfeng has betrayed the old lady!","“Also, they already know that Hua Wushuang is imprisoned by the Zuo family!","“The old lady is pacing around right now. She seems to be thinking of a way to deal with the Zuo family... Your crisis isn’t over yet.”"]},{"number":3578,"title":"Chapter 3578: Change of Plan (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3578: Change of Plan (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Little Phoenix had done a great job this time.","It could hide its aura after turning invisible. Unless its spiritual power fluctuated, even someone as powerful as Mrs. Hua wouldn’t be able to discover its existence.","“Hey, the old lady seems to have thought of a solution!","“She’s instructing her son to attack the Feng clan tonight and destroy you all!","“The old lady also admits that Jun Linyuan likes you. He’ll be furious if they kill you, so she decides to destroy the Feng clan and frame the Zuo family.","“What excuse? The influential families are all very well-informed. The old lady already knew that you destroyed Zuo Qingluan’s True Phoenix Blood. She’s going to use this as an excuse to frame the Zuo family.” Feng Wu said, “Keep an eye on the old lady.” Little Phoenix agreed.","It broke out in cold sweat for Feng Wu.","It had a feeling that Feng Wu’s original plan wasn’t like the old lady’s... It wondered if Feng Wu had a backup plan.","Meanwhile, in Fallen Star Yard.","Seeing Feng Wu’s solemn look, Yu Mingye was worried.","He waved his hand in front of Feng Wu. “Feng Wu? Are you alright?”","Feng Wu was communicating with Little Phoenix through brainwaves. As far as Yu Mingye was concerned, Feng Wu was in a trance.","“It’s a little troublesome.” Feng Wu stood up, put her hands behind her back, and paced around the yard.","She had more than ten Spiritual Overlords, but the Hua family had at least 15, and more were coming.","This was because there were still many Spiritual Overlords gathered in the imperial capital. These people were all waiting for an opportunity to kill Feng Wu. If the Hua clan contacted these people...","As smart as the old lady was, she would definitely try to use those people.","If Mrs. Hua personally took action, the Feng clan would be in danger.","Feng Wu looked around the house and studied every blade of grass, every tree, every flower.. Why did some people want others dead?","Why couldn’t they live a peaceful life?","It was a little different from the original plan, but she could modify it a little.","Sitting on the swing, Feng Wu closed her eyes and tried to think of a solution.","The Hua clan, the Zuo family, and all those Spiritual Overlords...","Plans popped up in Feng Wu’s head one after another, but they were all rejected.","Time was running out. The Hua clan would make their move tonight.","One Spiritual Sage and 15 Spiritual Overlords...","No, it was very likely that the Zuo family would also take advantage of the situation. In that case, two Spiritual Saints and 30 Spiritual Overlords would all come to the Feng clan.","Standing on the roof, Feng Wu watched the children play in the Feng clan. She saw the teenagers fooling around, Granny Zhao washing clothes, Uncle Qiu fixing the carriage, and... if she couldn’t stop them, the Feng clan would disappear from this world forever.","Just then, Feng Xiaoqi ran out. “Sister, what’s wrong? Why do you look so worried?”","reng wu (llan?c ten ner ramuy mat tne Hua ramuy ana me LUO ramuy naa joined forces to attack the Feng clan. They only thought that Feng Wu was being hunted down by the Spiritual Overlords.","“Kiddo, are you in trouble now?”","Holding her sword, the white fairy stood on the wall and looked down at Feng wu.","Feng Wu glanced at her and said, “I saw Chu Tianxiao.”","WHAT?!","The arrogant white fairy jumped off the wall and ran up to Feng Wu. “What did you say? Say it again! Where is he? Tell me now!”","Feng Wu snapped, “Didn’t you sell yourself to me for a hundred years? Protect me for a hundred years first..”"]},{"number":3579,"title":"Chapter 3579: Change of Plan (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3579: Change of Plan (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The white fairy said, “Do you have a death wish?!”","The white fairy didn’t care about anything else, but Chu Tianxiao was a thorn in her side, and no one could disrespect him.","Feng Wu said grumpily, “Fine, fine. I won’t bring it up again.”","The white fairy said, “Tell me!”","Feng Wu said, “I can find out about my third senior brother, but you have to help me with something first.”","The white fairy stared at Feng Wu.","Feng wu snrugged. “MY entire clan IS going to De wiped out. DO you tn1nK 1 still care about your love life?”","The white fairy agreed. “Go ahead.”","Feng Wu whispered something in her ear.","The white fairy frowned.","Feng Wu smiled. “If you don’t do it, I may never live to see the sun again. If that happens, you’ll probably never see my third senior brother...”","The white fairy said grumpily, “That’s all I’m going to do for you. I can’t do anything else. I haven’t recovered much yet.”","Feng Wu immediately said, “Alright! ”","As soon as Feng Wu talked to the white fairy, Little Phoenix prompted her. “Xiao Wu, have you thought of something? The old lady is really going to destroy the Feng clan tonight!”","Feng Wu said, “Don’t worry. I have my own plan.”","Hearing that, Little Phoenix was a little relieved, but it was still a little confused... What idea had the girl come up with?","Yu Mingye asked Feng Wu, ‘What happened?”","Feng Wu then told him about how the old lady was going to attack the Feng clan with all her might. Yu Mingye was astonished!","Yu Mingye asked, “If the Hua family wants to take down the Feng family, what about the Zuo family? Will they join hands?”","Feng Wu said, “That’s possible.”","Yu Mingye said, “So...”","“Sister, is that true?” Feng Xiaoqi didn’t Imow about it before, but he was shocked now.","Feng Wu looked at Feng Xiaoqi and nodded solemnly.","Feng Wu didn’t plan to let her family know if the battle hadn’t come to the Feng clan, but now, she had to inform them in advance.","“What should we do now?”","Xiaoqi wasn’t the only one who heard it. The rest of the family came out as well.","Qiuling, Granny Zhao, Uncle Qiu, Chaoge, Feng Xun...","Feng Wu said, “Don’t worry. I’ve figured it out. We’ll be fine.” But what choice did they have?","The others only thought that Feng Wu was comforting them.","According to Feng Wu, there were two Spiritual Saints and over thirty Spiritual Overlords. How were they supposed to fight this war?","It would be much faster to just lie down and accept their fate.","Feng Xun wanted to say something but hesitated. In the end, he said, “Let’s tell my father... He’s a Spiritual Saint...’","Feng Wu turned to Feng Xun with a stern look on her face. “No!”","Feng Xun said, “But...”","Feng Wu shook her head. “I suspect that the Dongsang Kingdom knows, which is why their attack became more ferocious, and even Feng has gone to the battlefield. That’s why Father and Feng couldn’t come back. Otherwise, Nest would be destroyed!”","Feng Xun didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu said, “Don’t worry. Have some faith in me. I’m not that easy to kill.”","She gave Feng Xun and Yu Mingye some instructions.","Everyone started working according to Feng Wu’s plan.."]},{"number":3580,"title":"Chapter 3580: Spirit Diagram Sword","paragraphs":["Chapter 3580: Spirit Diagram Sword","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu sat in her room and examined the details of her plan.","According to Feng Wu’s original arrangement, Hua Wushuang would be very useful.","She wanted to have the Zuo family kill Hua Wushuang in front of the old lady, but since things had changed, so be it. She had other plans.","The Zuo family, the Hua family, and the Spiritual Overlords...","Did they think that Feng Wu didn’t have a card up her sleeves?","Feng Wu rubbed the booklet in her hand and smiled a little.","Just as the powerful cultivators of the Hua family gathered around, ready to take care of the Feng clan tonight, a piece of news quietly spread among the other Spiritual Overlords.","The legendary Master Mu Jiuzhou’s Spirit Diagram Sword had appeared in the Hua family!","Oh god!","The news spread like wildfire among the Spiritual Overlords.","God Mu!","He used to be the ruler of this continent!","He was once the most capable man that ever lived!","When he was young, he used the Spirit Diagram Sword, which was an invincible cultivation technique.","He had never lost a battle!","But now, the Spirit Diagram Sword was in the Hua family’s treasure vault.","Who spread the rumor? It had to be the Zuo family.","The Spiritual Overlords asked the Zuo family for information, but the latter denied it.","The more they denied it, the more suspicious they looked.","Just then, someone leaked the information that the Zuo family had detained Hua Wushuang, and the information on the sword technique was from her.","The Zuo family had detained Hua Wushuang?","Hua Wushuang was the heir to the Hua family!","Soon, the news spread like wildfire.","However, it only got around among the capable cultivators, and ordinary people didn’t know about it.","But all the influential families had heard the news.","They were all talking about it.","Why did the Zuo family want to detain Hua Wushuang?","The more they asked, the more interesting it became...","The Hua family and the Zuo family had put in a lot of effort to suppress the incident between Hua Wushuang and Zuo Qingxi, but the Spiritual Overlords were intrigued and had to ask around.","They could catch an insider, hide behind a bush, and press a dagger to the latter’s throat to interrogate them.","There was a very nimble person among the itinerant cultivators called Bukong.","Bukong was well-connected and was the first to hear the news.","He wasn’t alone. He also had a friend, the Black and White Priest.","In the inn.","Bukong said, “It’s true. I’ve asked around. The Zuo family has indeed detained","Hua Wushuang!”","The Black and White Priest asked, “Why did the Zuo family detain Hua","Wushuang? Aren’t they afraid that the Hua family will take revenge?”","Bukong said, “What happened was quite interesting.”","Bukong then described what he had heard. “The Hua family and the Zuo family may be friends on the surface, but they’ve already become enemies.”","The priest said, “So, the Hua family really might have the Spirit Diagram","Sword.”","Bukong said, “The information sounds real. Not only is there a message, but there’s also a map. Look at this treasure room... It looks like a real place.” After that, he showed the map to the priest.","Seeing this, the priest nodded and said, “That’s right. It’s real. And the inscriptions...”","Bukong said, “And I found Hua Wushuang in secret and forced her to make a move.. She really used the stance from the Spirit Diagram Sword! She really used it!”"]},{"number":3581,"title":"Chapter 3581: Spirit Diagram Sword (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3581: Spirit Diagram Sword (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The Black and White Priest jumped to his feet. “Are you sure?!”","Bukong’s eyes widened in excitement. “Absolutely!”","The Black and White Priest said, “Great! We’re going to have this Spirit Diagram Sword! Although it was Master Mu’s swordplay when he was younger, it’ll benefit us for the rest of our lives if we can learn even one stance from","him!”","Bukong said, “That’s right. I thought the same. We have to get the Spirit","Diagram Sword! We should...”","Bukong and the Black and White Priest whispered to each other and soon came up with a plan.","As for Feng Wu...","When the Spirit Diagram Sword was involved, no one would care about Feng Wu anymore.","Firmament Palace’s reward? Forget about it.","The news soon reached the Hua family.","Mrs. Hua heard the news right away and was dumbfounded.","What Spirit Diagram Sword?","The Hua family didn’t have the Spirit Diagram Sword.","If the Hua family had it, they would have taken off already. She wouldn’t have to come all the way to the imperial capital just to fawn on the empress dowager.","Aunt Xi frowned. “But the rumor out there is so vivid. There’s even a map of the treasure room! It has everything!”","“Show me. ”","Mrs. Hua didn’t panic when she heard the news. She only picked up the map.","Her two sons were standing next to her.","The news came from her eldest son.","After reading the map, Mrs. Hua was lost in her thoughts.","Master Hua said anxiously, “Our vault is so well-hidden. Who could have spread the rumor? It couldn’t have been Wushuang! She doesn’t even know this place, let alone how to get in!”","The other Master Hua said, “How many people know how to get in?” Mrs. Hua felt a headache coming on.","Zuo Chengfeng had been there before. Could it be him? After some thought, Mrs. Hua decided that Zuo Chengfeng was the most likely suspect.","What was his motive?","He wanted to destroy the Hua family without getting his hands dirty.","Just like how she tried to kill Feng Wu to frame Zuo Chengfeng, Zuo Chengfeng was going to do the same to the Hua family!","Those Spiritual Overlords had become an influential force!","“You’re so cruel!” Mrs. Hua gritted her teeth.","It was true that Mrs. Hua didn’t like Feng Wu and wanted to destroy the Feng clan, but that wasn’t the main problem anymore.","To Mrs. Hua, her conflict with Zuo Chengfeng had just risen to the top of her list.","The most important thing now was to solve the problem of the Spiritual Overlords brought by the Spirit Diagram Sword.","“Mother, are we still going to attack the Feng clan tonight?” Master Hua asked Mrs. Hua.","Mrs. Hua’s face was livid.","She couldn’t for the life of her figure out why so many problems would pop up in the middle of her plan to kill Feng Wu, someone as weak as an ant. She just couldn’t bring herself to do it without solving the other problems.","“We’ll spare her life for now.” Mrs. Hua frowned. “Our top priority now is the","Zuo family and those Spiritual Overlords.”","Master Hua said, “Mother, shall we kill them all?”","Mrs. Hua glanced at him.","If it was only the Zuo family or the Spiritual Overlords, she could still fight them. But now, Mrs. Hua didn’t know if they had joined hands.."]},{"number":3582,"title":"Chapter 3582: Spirit Diagram Sword (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3582: Spirit Diagram Sword (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","That malicious old man!","Mrs. Hua decided to kill Zuo Chengfeng first.","Otherwise, who knew what more trouble this malicious old man would create!","Once Zuo Chengfeng was dead, those Spiritual Overlords would no longer be a threat.","Mrs. Hua happened to know that Zuo Chengfeng had been injured by Jun Linyuan and had yet to recover his strength.","Mrs. Hua told her plan to her eldest son and let him carry it out.","She went to the Zuo family on her own.","“Wow!”","Little Phoenix shouted in Feng Wu’s head in excitement, “Feng Wu, you’re amazing! !! That old lady really left according to your plan!","“She really has decided to kill Zuo Chengfeng first!","“She also told her son to spread the news that the Spirit Diagram Sword indeed exists, but it has been stolen by the Zuo family. It’s in the Zuo family now!","“Wow, the Zuo family is in so much trouble!","“And you know what? That old lady... She’s trying to seduce Zuo Chengfeng! Gosh, I need to catch up with her and see what she can do!","“I’ll send you the latest update!”","Feng Wu only let out a breath of relief when she heard what Little Phoenix said.","Finallv. she changed the battlefield from the Feng clan to the Zuo familv.","She couldn’t care less about the outcome of the battle.","However, if the battle took place in the Feng clan, even with the formations and traps she had set up, they might not be able to withstand it.","If formations were that powerful, the war in the Peace Grassland wouldn’t have lasted so long.","“Let’s go to the Zuo family and get ready!”","Mrs. Hua had no idea that everything she did was under Feng Wu’s control.","The Zuo family — Thump!","Zuo Chengfeng smashed his cup.","“Father...” Zuo Ming’s forehead was covered with cold sweat. “Everyone is saying that the Zuo family has robbed the Hua clan’s treasure room and stole the Spirit Diagram Sword!”","Zuo Chengfeng asked, “Have you found out who leaked the information?”","Zuo Ming said, “It was the Hua family. Bukong told me himself.”","Bukong was a Spiritual Overlord, and Zuo Ming had been trying to befriend him.","After a pause, Zuo Ming went on. “Father, Bukong asked...”","Zuo Chengfeng asked, “What?”","Zuo Ming said, “He asked if the Spirit Diagram Sword really is here and if he could borrow it.”","Zuo Chengfeng said, “Bastard!”","Zuo Ming broke into a cold sweat and was a little flustered.","He didn’t know if his father was scolding Bukong or himself.","Zuo Ming felt uneasy. He met Bukong when he was young, and they were about the same level. However, after a few decades, Bukong had reached the peak of the Spiritual Overlord Stage, and Zuo Ming hadn’t become a Spiritual Overlord yet. The difference between them was like heaven and earth, and Zuo Ming was overwhelmed with guilt.","Zuo Chengfeng coughed into his hand.","Zuo Ming went up to him in a hurry. “Father... you...”","Zuo Chengfeng waved his hand. “Don’t worry about it.”","Crossing his hands behind his back, he strolled around in the courtyard, and the look in his eyes grew grimmer!","Mrs. Hua had crossed the line!","They had agreed to destroy the Feng clan together.","It wasn’t that the Feng clan was so powerful that they had to work together to destroy it.","Zuo Chengfeng was only worried about Jun Linyuan’s revenge.","Therefore, he tried to drag the Hua family down with him and was going to blame everything on the Hua family.."]},{"number":3583,"title":"Chapter 3583: Spirit Diagram Sword (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3583: Spirit Diagram Sword (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Afterward, if Jun Linyuan wanted to take his revenge, he would have to be Hua Rouyue. However, after what happened at the birthday banquet, Zuo Chengfeng didn’t expect such a turn of events.","Hua Wushuang had ruined everything!","Zuo Chengfeng thought that someone was behind it at first, but when he caught Hua Wushuang and searched her memory, he found out what she did. When he saw the scene where she cut off Zuo Qingxi’s member, Zuo Chengfeng was furious!","What Zuo Chengfeng didn’t know was that Feng Wu had deliberately left that memory in Hua Wushuang’s head.","Feng Wu had set up all these traps, and they were all working now.","Zuo Chengfeng now believed that Hua Wushuang had killed Zuo Qingxi on purpose, and Zuo Qingxi was the only direct descendant of the Zuo family now. What was more, no one knew that Zuo Chengfeng had been raising and teaching Zuo Qingxi all these years. Zuo Qingxi was even more talented than Zuo Qingluan, who had True Phoenix Blood.","But now, Zuo Qingxi was dead...","Zuo Chengfeng had lost all hope.","Hua Wushuang!","Several times, Zuo Chengfeng wanted to throttle Hua Wushuang to take his revenge, but he fought back his impulse.","But now, the Hua family had made a scene again, saying that Zuo Chengfeng had entered their treasure room and stolen the Spirit Diagram Sword.","Zuo Chengfeng was so angry that he laughed.","When he tried to set Hua Rouyue up, she tried to set him up as well! Come to think of it, Hua Rouyue must have learned about what happened back then.","That abominable old woman! How dare she put on a show in front of him? She hated him so much, but she was still drinking tea with him and talking about working with him... She was such a good actress!","“Father? Father?”","Zuo Ming saw his father’s livid face and grim eyes. The look on his father’s face was murderous at times, and he would smile maliciously. Zuo Ming was frightened.","Zuo Chengfeng looked at Zuo Ming in frustration.","His good-for-nothing son had yet to become a Spiritual Overlord.","“Bring Hua Wushuang here. I’m going to investigate her again!” Zuo Chengfeng frowned. “Does she have the Spirit Diagram Sword on her?” Zuo Ming rushed out.","The Spiritual Diagram Sword was too important to be missed.","After Zuo Ming left, a figure landed in the courtyard.","Zuo Ming turned around and saw that it was Hua Rouyue, the old lady of the Hua family.","“Here we go!”","With its invisibility ability, Little Phoenix followed Mrs. Hua all the way from the Hua manor to the Zuo family, but no one noticed it.","Neither of the two Spiritual Saints could see the bird.","The Invisibility Spell was Little Phoenix’s natural skill, and Master Mu had created the Spiritual Concealment Technique for it. Therefore, when Little Phoenix activated the skill, even a Spiritual Saint might not be able to detect it. For instance, Zuo Chengfeng and Mrs. Hua sat opposite each other with a stone table between them.","The bold Little Phoenix turned invisible, activated its Spirit Concealment Technique, and lay down right on that table!","Zuo Chengfeng smiled when he saw Mrs. Hua. “Royue, you’re here.”","Hua Rouyue stared at Zuo Chengfeng with an indifferent look on her face. Raising her chin, she glanced at Zuo Chengfeng in an arrogant manner.","Oh my...","Little Phoenix complained to Feng Wu right away.. “I’ve come to the Zuo family with the old lady! Gosh, she’s doing great! She’s treating Zuo Chengfeng as if she’s the most beautiful woman in the world! I’m telling you, Zuo Chengfeng used to follow her everywhere! “"]},{"number":3584,"title":"Chapter 3584: Instant Change (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3584: Instant Change (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu was speechless. “Which is more important, your life or gossip?”","Little Phoenix said, “I love life as much as I love gossip!”","Zuo Chengfeng smiled at the old lady. “Rongyue, what’s wrong? I’m not mad at you yet, and you’re mad at me already?”","Mrs. Hua smirked. “Mad at me? Who gave you the right to do that?”","Zuo Chengfeng’s face darkened a little. “Qingxi is dead. Why do you think I’m mad at you? I have a lot of grandchildren, but most of them have died over the years, and I’ve trained Qingxi in secret. Don’t you know that?!”","The old lady said, “I didn’t kill your grandson!”","Zuo Chengfeng didn’t reply.","Old Mrs. Hua frowned. “I didn’t kill Zuo Qingxi! You know my medical skills. There was no way that I couldn’t cure him.”","Zuo Chengfeng smirked. “That’s right. You’re such a great doctor. How can my Qingxi be dead?”","Was he suggesting that she was the culprit?","Old Mrs. Hua smacked the table. “Zuo Chengfeng, are you slandering me now?","Is that how you talk to me?”","Zuo Chengfeng smirked but didn’t say anything.","Old Mrs. Hua didn’t know what to do. Back then, Zuo Chengfeng was in love with her, but they were both old now, and it was possible that he had a change of heart.","Old Mrs. Hua softened her tone and said earnestly, “I didn’t expect that Zuo Qingxi’s wound would burst open. I couldn’t stop the bleeding. It was as if someone had tampered with it.”","Zuo Chengfeng said, “Your granddaughter was the only one who had made contact with him before you.”","Mrs. Hua almost choked.","It seemed that Zuo Chengfeng was convinced that the Hua family had done it.","Old Mrs. Hua said, “Why would I kill him? We’ve only just agreed to work together. Why should I create such trouble? If it hadn’t been for that, we would have destroyed the Feng clan by now! I have reason to believe that the Feng clan is behind this and is trying to drive a wedge between our families!” The more she said, the more convinced she became.","Zuo Chengfeng, on the other hand, found the old lady’s suggestion idiotic.","Mrs. Hua asked, “You don’t believe me?”","Zuo Chengfeng said, “Are you an idiot? If the Feng clan really can do that, do you think we can destroy them so easily? Everyone says you’re smart and resourceful, but why do I find you so retarded?”","Old Mrs. Hua was so angry that she almost choked.","Zuo Chengfeng smirked again. “You’re only putting on airs because I used to be in love with you. Hua Rouyue, we’re both old enough to have grandchildren. Don’t you think you’re overdoing it by acting like a teenage girl?”","Old Mrs. Hua almost had a stroke!","Little Phoenix was thrilled. It was very talented in simulation, so it sent the conversation between Mrs. Hua and Zuo Chengfeng back to Feng Wu in their own voices.","Feng Wu smacked her forehead. What an interesting old lady.","Mrs. Hua was very flexible. Seeing that her plan wouldn’t work, she changed her attitude.","“Alright. If that’s the case, let’s talk like one head of the clan to another.” Sitting ramrod straight, Mrs. Hua stared at Zuo Chengfeng. “There’s only one way to prove the innocence of the Hua family: an autopsy, I’ll need to examine Zuo","Qingxi’s body.”","Zuo Chengfeng stared at Mrs. Hua.","Mrs. Hua had never been so serious.. She stared at Zuo Chengfeng and said, “The only way to resolve the misunderstanding between our families is to examine his body!”"]},{"number":3585,"title":"Chapter 3585: Instant Change (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3585: Instant Change (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Zuo Ming went to see Hua Wushuang.","However, he didn’t expect Hua Wushuang to be meeting someone at this moment.","To be more precise, someone was meeting Hua Wushuang.","It was none other than Feng Wu.","Feng Wu put the moves from the Spirit Diagram Sword into Hua Wushuang’s brain in a special way.","In fact, it was just a few feigned moves, not real ones.","Feng Wu had always had the Spirit Diagram Sword, but her beautiful master had told her that she could only dapple on it but shouldn’t go too deep. There was something wrong with the cultivation technique, which would damage her foundation and reduce her lifespan.","That was why her beautiful master had given Feng Wu the Spirit Diagram Sword as a reference book and didn’t allow her to study it in private.","Feng Wu only treated it as an extracurricular book and never thought that the Spirit Diagram Sword was that important.","It was only when Little Phoenix told her that she might be able to try the Spirit Diagram Sword that Feng Wu took out the cultivation technique. The result shocked her!","It turned out that her beautiful master was such a terrifying existence!","The Spirit Diagram Sword that he had abandoned in his early years could actually cause an uproar on the continent. So many people jumped at the opportunity like moths to a flame.","Feng Wu thought to herself that her beautiful master had asked her to memorize a lot of books back then. Could they all be profound techniques?","Feng Wu decided to find some time to study the cultivation techniques she had memorized.","Back then, her beautiful master had only asked her to memorize it. He passed out before he had the time to teach her. He still hadn’t woken up yet...","After infusing two moves of the Spirit Diagram Sword into Hua Wushuang’s mind, Feng Wu heard something outside and immediately hid herself.","Little Phoenix had transmitted the correct cultivation technique to Feng Wu through its brainwaves, so no one would be able to detect Feng Wu now that she had concealed her aura.","Squeak","The door was pushed open.","Feng Wu saw two figures running in.","One was a Daoist priest in a black and white robe, and the other was a round-faced chubby one.","Hua Wushuang was locked in a special dungeon. There were formations and mechanisms outside, and ordinary people couldn’t enter. Who were these two people?","Before the two of them could reach Hua Wushuang, they forced her to make a move.","Hua Wushuang had only just learned two moves from Feng Wu, and she used them right away.","She didn’t have a sword, so she grabbed a wooden stick and pointed it at the two of them!","Bukong said, “That’s the Spirit Diagram Sword! Brother Priest, it’s really a sword move from the Spirit Diagram Sword!","Black and White Priest nodded. “This girl is the living Spirit Diagram Sword.","Take her away!”","“Let’s go!”","Bukong grabbed Hua Wushuang and tucked her under his armpit, while Black and White Priest led the way!","Feng Wu nodded.","She knew they were a pair of Spiritual Overlords because she had been secretly getting people to keep an eye on this group of experts who were prepared to kill her at any time.","She recognized these two people. One was Black and White Priest, and the other was Bukong. These two people were very powerful among those Spiritual Overlords, probably the best among the group.","Seeing that they had taken Hua Wushuang away, Feng Wu smiled. That was great.","After they left the dungeon, Feng Wu saw they were about to run out.","How could she let them run away like this? Her effort would be in vain.","In the dark night sky, everything was silent.","Feng Wu shouted, “Someone’s taken Hua Wushuang and the Spirit Diagram","Sword! Hua Wushuang has the Spirit Diagram Sword!”"]},{"number":3586,"title":"Chapter 3586: Instant Changes (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3586: Instant Changes (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu’s words hit the nail on the head.","Hua Wushuang had the Spirit Diagram Sword on her, which meant that the Hua family had indeed owned the Spirit Diagram Sword.","Now that Hua Wushuang was in the Zuo family’s house, did that mean that the Zuo family was interrogating her for the Spirit Diagram Sword?","Buong, who was about to jump onto the wall, was shocked.","Damn it!","Who did that?","The most terrifying thing was that he didn’t see anyone nearby!","At this moment, the Zuo family had already discovered the pair!","They were rushing in their direction.","Bukong threw Hua Wushuang out of the wall. “Take her away!”","However, what shocked Bukong was that after Hua Wushuang was thrown away, she was actually bounced back by a strange force!","Bukong was stunned!","Wasn’t there his men outside to catch her? What was going on?","With a thud, Hua Wushuang fell onto a roof. The powerful force collapsed the roof and buried Hua Wushuang!","The Spiritual Overlords of the Zuo family were closing in!","“Bukong, Black and White Priest, how dare you!”","Zuo Ming was infuriated when he saw them. “How dare you! Take them down!” The current Zuo family was as heavily guarded as a prison.","There were fifteen Spiritual Overlords guarding the four directions, and four of them were following Zuo Ming.","The four Spiritual Overlords rushed forward and surrounded Bukong and Black and White Priest!","Black and White Priest told Bukong, “Go get the girl. I’ll deal with them!”","“Sure!”","Bukong immediately rushed toward the collapsed house!","At the same time, he shouted to the people outside, “Come and help me! I have the living Spirit Diagram Sword here!”","The Spirit Diagram Sword was too attractive!","Hearing Bukong’s words, three more people jumped in from the other side of the wall!","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","These three figures instantly rushed toward the collapsed house!","Whoever snatched Hua Wushuang would have the Spirit Diagram Sword!","Feng Wu knew that Hua Wushuang was key. She couldn’t let her die...","There were three more Spiritual Overlords from the Zuo family!","Because of the fierce battles, the walls of the Zuo family’s houses kept collapsing.","Zuo Chengfeng saw all of this.","He stared at Mrs. Hua. “Hua Rouyue, is this your so-called innocence?!” Hua Rouyue’s expression was extremely ugly!","She didn’t know what went wrong. No matter what plan she made, it was always destroyed before it could be carried out.","Hua Rouyue stared at Zuo Chengfeng. “Would you believe me if I said that the people fighting outside weren’t from the Hua family?”","Mrs. Hua had told Hua Huaiyu, her eldest son, to wait for Aunt Xi’s orders.","Little Phoenix had already heard that and told Feng Wu.","Feng Wu couldn’t beat Aunt Xi, but someone else could.","She had two Spiritual Overlords with her, and Jun Linyuan had put them by her side to protect her. Now was the time to use them.","These two Spiritual Overlords were Gao Gong and Yuan Pan.","In the imperial guards, they were called General Gao and General Yuan.","At this moment, the two of them worked together to take down Aunt Xi, who was alone.","Feng Wu snuck out of the Zuo family’s house. When she saw General Gao signaling her from a dark alley, she left without another word.","At that moment, the Spiritual Overlords and the Zuo family were fighting, so no one noticed her.","Moreover, Feng Wu had concealed her aura.","“Miss Feng Wu, Aunt Xi is here.” General Gao led Feng Wu into a yard.."]},{"number":3587,"title":"Chapter 3587: Instant Changes (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3587: Instant Changes (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","When he stared at Feng Wu, his gaze was sharp, and he exuded a cold aura.","He didn’t know how to describe Miss Feng Wu.","Ever since General Gao found out about Feng Wu’s plan, he had thought that Feng Wu had lost her mind!","She wanted to destroy the Zuo family, the Hua family, and the Spiritual Overlords all by herself!","He had done some calculations for Feng Wu. At the end of the day, there were only about ten Spiritual Overlords on their side, and their enemies had about four times that. How were they going to fight this battle?","Therefore, he had always disapproved of it with a cold expression.","General Gao felt that he would probably die this time.","In such a dangerous situation, Feng Wu couldn’t be bothered to make General Gao happy. She went straight to Aunt Xi.","Seeing Aunt Xi, Feng Wu smiled. “Very good.”","Aunt Xi was shocked to see Feng Wu.","Because Feng Wu was herself now and wasn’t disguised as anyone else.","Feng Wu looked at Aunt Xi, then at General Gao.","General Gao was shocked. “What do you want?!”","Feng Wu smiled. “General Gao, I’m sorry.”","General Gao was dumbfounded.","Feng Wu said, “You can be Aunt Xi.”","Although Aunt Xi was a woman, she was extremely tall and was strong like a man. She resembled General Gao a little.","General Gao said “How is that possible? I can’t do it! I can’t act!”","Feng Wu sat him down and said with a smile, “It’s fine. You only have one line.” After that, Feng Wu began to apply something to General Gao’s face.","Aunt Xi had been sober the whole time. She watched as Feng Wu glanced at her from time to time and then continued to apply something to General Gao’s face... Before long, a familiar face appeared in front of her.","Feng Wu took all the accessories off Aunt Xi and asked her to take off her black clothes for General Gao.","Although they were all wearing black clothes, the black clothes of the Hua family were different. In order to identify their own people, there was a secret mark on the collar. Only the Hua family knew. Staring at Feng Wu, Aunt Xi suddenly had an idea!","“You! It was you!”","Aunt Xi stared at Feng Wu as if someone had grabbed her by the throat. “I can’t believe you did that... I get it now!”","Aunt Xi stared at Feng Wu. “You were the one who killed Zuo Qingxi, weren’t you?! Since you can turn someone into me, you can pretend to be Hua Wushuang!","“So, you’re behind what happened to the Hua family in the past two days, aren’t you?!” Aunt Xi glared at Feng Wu and gritted her teeth.","She didn’t need Feng Wu’s answer because she had already made up her mind.","“No wonder my lady can’t figure out why Miss Wushuang suddenly became like that. It was all you!”","Feng Wu smiled and nodded.","Aunt Xi asked, “... You robbed the treasure rooms too?!”","Feng Wu looked at her and nodded.","Aunt Xi asked, “What about the Spirit Diagram Sword?! Is that your doing?”","Feng Wu looked at her and heaved a long sigh. “Why are you so smart?","“If you were more stupid, I wouldn’t have to kill you, but your guessed everything... How could I let you live?” Feng Wu looked at General Gao. “Kill her.”","Spiritual Overlords had great defensive ability. If Feng Wu wanted to kill Aunt Xi, she might not be able to break through her defenses.","General Gao glanced at Feng Wu and stabbed Aunt Xi in the chest without another word.","Aunt Xi died on the spot.","Let’s go.. It’s time for our war!”"]},{"number":3588,"title":"Chapter 3588: Last Resort (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3588: Last Resort (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","General Gao stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","“Are you sure you want to continue?”","Feng Wu said, “Of course!”","General Gao: “Are you really not afraid of death?!”","Feng Wu gave him an indifferent look. “It’s better than waiting for them to kill me.”","General Gao frowned. “They can’t be bothered to kill you now.”","Feng Wu said, “That’s why I’m fighting back. Do I have to wait for them to kill me when they’re free?”","General Gao was rendered speechless by Feng Wu’s words.","Feng Wu sighed. “I’m standing here because I fought for it. If I don’t, I’ll die. If you don’t want to help me...”","General Gao looked at Feng Wu in frustration.","Jun Linyuan had told them to protect Feng Wu with their lives.","“If you think you can win, then let’s fight. I don’t believe you, though.” General Gao gave Feng Wu one last look and walked out of the yard.","Led by Master Hua Huaiyu, the Hua family was lying in an ambush outside the Zuo family’s house.","Aunt Xi had gone in to gather information and was accidentally caught by General Gao and General Yuan.","When he saw “Aunt Xi” return, Hua Huaiyu lowered his voice and asked anxiously, “What’s the situation inside now?!”","General Gao played Aunt Xi, but he couldn’t imitate her voice like Feng Wu did, so he lowered his voice and only said one word. “Kill!”","The Hua family had been waiting impatiently for a long time. When they heard that, they immediately became restless!","Hua Huaiyu thought that Aunt Xi had received an order from Mrs. Hua, so he believed it without a doubt!","He raised his sword and pointed it at the sky. “Charge!”","They rushed into the Zuo family’s house.","At this moment, members of the Zuo family had already lost control from fighting!","All the Spiritual Overlords were fighting fiercely.","The Zuo family had more Spiritual Overlords, so they had the upper hand!","Zuo Ming smirked. “Bukong, you’ll regret coming to the Zuo family today! You can’t come and go as you please!”","At this moment, Bukong was surrounded by three Spiritual Overlords. He was already injured in many places and was forced into a sorry state!","Bukong cursed. “We’re just asking for the Spirit Diagram Sword. Zuo Ming, is the Zuo family going to make an enemy of all the Spiritual Overlords in the world?!”","Zuo Ming said, “The Zuo family doesn’t have the Spirit Diagram Sword!”","Bukong laughed coldly. “Hua Wushuang has it!’","Zuo Ming said, “Hua Wushuang isn’t from the Zuo family! ”","Bukong said, “That’s good. Just hand over Hua Wushuang and let us take her away!”","Zuo Ming said, “No way!”","Bukong said, “Zuo Ming, we’ve already spread the news that the Zuo family has the Spirit Diagram Sword through all kinds of channels. Do you think you can keep it a secret? Even if you kill us today, millions of people will covet the Spirit Diagram Sword in the future. They’ll bury you all!”","Zuo Ming was so angry that his eyes turned red.","He would never have thought that bringing Hua Wushuang back would bring him so much trouble!","At this moment, he really wanted to throw Hua Wushuang out.","But... the Spirit Diagram sword!","Bukong and the others were greedy, but wasn’t the Zuo family?","The Zuo family also wanted the Spirit Diagram sword!","Zuo Ming thought he could always defeat Bukong and his people.. After that, he could just force Hua Wushuang to write down the sword technique and kill her!"]},{"number":3589,"title":"Chapter 3589: Last Resort (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3589: Last Resort (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","At that thought, Zuo Ming bellowed, “Kill them all! Also, lock down the city! No one is allowed to leave the city without the Zuo family’s permission! Kill anyone who insists on leaving!”","Bukong sneered. “It seems that Hua Wushuang really has the Spirit Diagram Sword! Everyone, let’s go! Kill Zuo Ming and snatch the swordplay manual!” The two sides fought fiercely and suffered countless casualties.","There were already over half a dozen Spiritual Overlords lying on the ground, most of them weren’t from the Zuo family.","Almost all of them were injured, but none of them were dead.","It was too difficult to kill a Spiritual Overlord.","At this moment, the Spiritual Overlords who were after Feng Wu were at a disadvantage.","Seeing that the situation wasn’t looking good, Bukong immediately had the intention to retreat.","But at that moment, “Aunt Xi” rushed in and charged at Zuo Ming.","Many people recognized that this was “Aunt Xi”, who was working for Mrs.","Hua!","“Aunt Xi” was fighting Zuo Ming’s Spiritual Overlords.","Hua Huaiyu was instantly anxious!","What was wrong with “Aunt Xi”?","They had agreed that they would observe the situation when they came in, and then decide which side to fight against. “Aunt Xi” shouldn’t have attacked Zuo Ming like that! That would expose the Hua family’s other cultivators!","Zuo Ming’s eyes widened when he saw “Aunt Xi”.","He shouted, “The SDiritual Overlords of the Hua familv are attacking us! Kill them!”","Bukong turned around and saw Hua Huaiyu. He immediately smiled and said,","“Why are you so late? Didn’t you propose to destroy the Zuo family together? Do you want to be a free-rider? Hurry up and attack! ”","Hua Huaiyu looked at Bukong in shock.","What did he mean by that? Why didn’t he know that the Hua family had agreed to deal with the Zuo family together with these people? They had agreed to destroy the Feng family together!","But before Hua Huaiyu could explain, Zuo Ming took Bukong’s words seriously.","“Aunt Xi” had rushed in to kill him first, and then there were Bukong’s words. Zuo Ming had no choice but to believe him.","“The Hua family! We were wrong about you!”","“Kill the Hua family’s Spiritual Overlords! Kill them all! Don’t let anyone off!”","The situation changed, and all the Spiritual Overlords joined forces with the Hua family to fight against the Zuo family.","Fortunately, the Zuo family had mobilized many experts from the clan in Jingyang Province this time. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have been able to withstand the other party’s attack.","In the Zuo family’s yard.","Zuo Chengfeng stared at Mrs. Hua, who was sitting opposite him. The look in his eyes was terrifying!","“Hua Rouyue, is this the collaboration between the Zuo family and the Hua family you’re talking about?”","Mrs. Hua was stunned.","She had indeed asked Aunt Xi to come forward and join forces with the itinerant cultivators, but how could it be so effective? Was Aunt Xi that capable?","But now that things had come to this, there was nothing Mrs. Hua couldn’t admit.","She smiled and looked at Zuo Chengfeng. ” Zuo, so many years have passed in the blink of an eye. We’re both old.”","Zuo Chengfeng stared at Mrs. Hua and smiled coldly. “What do you want?” Mrs. Hua said, “Why don’t we test each other’s skills?”","Zuo Chengfeng stared at her with an eerie gaze. Those sharp eyes seemed to be able to pierce right through her heart!","Although Hua Rouyue said that she wanted to test his skills, what she meant was very obvious. She was going to attack.","Zuo Chengfeng suddenly laughed coldly. “Alright. Hua Rouyue, did you know it all along?","Hua Rouyue stared at him with a sharp gaze. “Know what?”","Zuo Chengfeng said, “About your husband!”","Hua Rouyue stared at him and nodded slowly. “Yes..”"]},{"number":3590,"title":"Chapter 3590: Last Resort (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3590: Last Resort (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Zuo Chengfeng, “I knew it.","“No wonder you’re attacking the Zuo family today. You’re taking revenge for your husband!","“That’s right. Your husband actually loved you very much. I deliberately took him to the brothels to have fun.","“I also deliberately tricked him into getting drunk, and he ended up drowning in the Qinyang River.","“I didn’t expect you to find out about the secret I did back then. I thought I could hide it from you for the rest of my life.”","Mrs. Hua’s expression remained calm. “So it really was you.”","Zuo Chengfengs expression changed slightly. “You didn’t know at first?”","Mrs. Hua’s gaze was unprecedentedly cold. “It doesn’t matter if I knew at first. What’s important is that I know now. Zuo Chengfeng, you killed the love of my life. I’ll skin you alive and drink your blood!","“Die!”","With that, Mrs. Hua made the first move.","Little Phoenix had been listening on the table, but it didn’t want to get hurt, so it went under the table.","It told Feng Wu the shocking news in a hurry. “Listen, listen! I didn’t know there was such a thing in the past!”","Feng Wu hadn’t expected that she would dig up such explosive information when she was just setting the Hua family and the Zuo family up. This was so interesting!","“Where are you? Why is it so noisy?” Little Phoenix asked Feng Wu curiously.","Feng Wu said, “I snuck into the Zuo family. By the way, where are Mrs. Hua and Zuo Chengfeng?”","Little Phoenix said, “They’re fighting in the subspace. If they start fighting here, the imperial capital will sink!”","Feng Wu asked, “Are you sitting idly now?”","Little Phoenix said, “I’m wondering if I should go into the subspace too.”","Feng Wu said, “There’s no need for that. With such a blood feud, they’ll never reconcile. Let them have their dogfight. By the way, get over here. We’re going to do something big!”","Little Phoenix hid itself and rushed in Feng Wu’s direction.","“I really like what you’re saying.”","When Little Phoenix arrived, it saw Feng Wu heading for a remote yard in the Zuo family’s house. It jumped onto Feng Wu’s shoulder and asked excitedly,","“What are we going to do next?”","Feng Wu said, “My job.”","Little Phoenix looked at Feng Wu in confusion. What was that supposed to be?","However, it quickly realized what the answer was.","What else could it be? Of course, it was to rob someone’s family treasure.","Little Phoenix almost drooled. It loved Feng Wu’s job. She got what she wanted for free, punished the bad guys, and made a fortune overnight!","“Where is it? Hey, stupid tiger, find it.”","Feng Wu had two pets, one of which was Little Phoenix.","The bird was raised by her beautiful master and would be Feng Wu’s flying mount in the future.","There was also a cub, which Feng Wu had raised herself and was used as a land mount. Unfortunately, the cub grew too slowly... It was still as small as a kitten, and Feng Wu couldn’t ride it at all.","Little Phoenix used to have a treasure-seeking skill too, but it had lost its sense after the phenomenal success of the stealth skill.","Therefore, Little Phoenix had to rely on the cub’s sharp senses and smell.","The cub ran ahead of Feng Wu, leading her to the remote yard.","Little Phoenix had seen many Spiritual Overlords fighting on its way to Feng Wu, and many of them were lying on the ground.."]},{"number":3591,"title":"Chapter 3591 - 3592","paragraphs":["Chapter 3591: Chapter 3592","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu followed the cub all the way to the remote yard with Little Phoenix.","The cub hopped around on a spot and looked at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu knew at once that something was amiss.","As expected, when Feng Wu examined it carefully, she realized that there was a mechanism here. After figuring out the pattern, Feng Wu smiled.","She couldn’t understand why these famous families trusted the inscription so much.","The Hua family had used three inscription locks, and so had the Zuo family. They were very high-level inscription locks, and Feng Wu estimated them to be at least Level 8.","The inscription lock could ward off many people, but not Feng Wu.","With the Phoenix Pen, Feng Wu had become even more powerful.","With a flip of her inscription pen, complicated inscription characters floated out from its tip.","The characters fell into the lock one after another in a single file.","Until the last character.","With a click, the inscription lock was opened. Feng Wu then lifted the ordinary-looking wooden board.","After the trap door opened, there was an escalator that meandered down. It was so long that one couldn’t see the other end.","Before Feng Wu could react, the cub had already rushed down the stairs.","Excited, Little Phoenix shouted in Feng Wu’s head, “I can sense spiritual essence! It’s so dense! What’s down there?!”","Little Phoenix didn’t wait for Feng Wu’s response. It dashed forward as fast as it could and wouldn’t stop.","Feng Wu rubbed her forehead in resignation.","Although she could sense some spiritual essence, she wasn’t as sharp as the two pets.","It was no wonder. They could sense treasures from afar, but she couldn’t.","Feng Wu restored the wooden board and locked the inscription lock again.","Although the Zuo family was busy fighting the Hua family and the factionless cultivators, no one knew if anyone would come here.","If this place wasn’t restored to its original state and someone else came in, Feng Wu would be doomed if they were Spiritual Overlords.","She walked all the way down the winding escalator.","As Feng Wu walked down, the lights on both sides of the wall lit up automatically, and misty rays of light filled the room.","Before Feng Wu arrived, she heard a rustling sound as if someone was drinking water.","When Feng Wu reached the bottom floor, she found Little Phoenix and the cub sticking out their butts and drinking from the pool.","Feng Wu looked around. The ground floor was empty. Apart from the pool, there was nothing else.","Feng Wu’s attention was drawn to the pond.","That was...","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up!","That wasn’t a pool of water but spiritual marrow!","The grades of spiritual stones, spiritual liquid, and spiritual marrow were arranged from low to high.","The blood source crystal was slightly more precious than the spiritual marrow, but it was also much harder to obtain.","At Feng Wu’s level, spiritual stones were of little use to her, and spiritual marrow was the best.","However, there was too little spiritual marrow around!","A spiritual stone mine that could produce half a kilo of spiritual marrow would be considered very rich, but there was at least 50 kg of spiritual marrow here.","Feng Wu was shocked!","She remembered that she had been to the auction house. The price of one kilo of spiritual marrow was enough to make her jaw drop. She suddenly had over 50kg here!","The cub and Little Phoenix took big gulps, afraid that they would fall behind each other.","But they were too..."]},{"number":3592,"title":"Chapter 3592: Breakthrough (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3592: Breakthrough (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, they were too young, and their stomachs were too small, so they were soon full.","The cub was unwilling to give up. It wanted to drink more, but in the next second, it almost fell into the pool.","Feng Wu grabbed it by the tail so that it wouldn’t fall in.","“Drink.” Little Phoenix urged Feng Wu. “It’ll help you with your cultivation. Maybe it’ll help you rise a level.”","Feng Wu said, “Shouldn’t I be refining my body right now? Can I still make a breakthrough?”","Little Phoenix said, “Of course, you can make a breakthrough. You can always train your body afterward. Besides, we’re in a big battle right now. If you improve your strength, you’ll be able to stay alive.”","Feng Wu agreed.","Without hesitation, she began to absorb the spiritual marrow in the pool.","She opened her mouth, and the spiritual marrow flowed from the pool into her mouth. The pure spiritual essence seemed to have built a thin bridge between the pool and her mouth.","Little Phoenix and the cub watched from the side, curious about how much Feng Wu could take.","They would rest for now. After Feng Wu finished absorbing it, they would drink as much as they could. If they were too full to drink more, they would pack up everything and take it away.","However...","Their eyes soon widened!","Because Feng Wu never seemed to stop!","There seemed to be a rainbow bridge between the spiritual marrow pool and Feng Wu’s mouth, and she kept going!","Little Phoenix turned to look at the spiritual marrow pool.","The two pets had only drunk less than half a kilo each, and they were already full. They had so much spiritual essence in their systems that their bodies hurt, and they didn’t dare drink more. However, Feng Wu...","She was still absorbed!","She hadn’t stopped!","The cub widened its eyes and looked at Little Phoenix in shock.","So did Little Phoenix.","It was unbelievable!","They all turned to look at the pool.","More than 50kg of spiritual marrow... Little Phoenix felt that Zuo Chengfeng must have spent countless years accumulating it. He had probably wanted to use it for his breakthrough.","If he saw this scene, he would be furious.","Feng Wu had already absorbed all the spiritual marrow in the pool!","Even the last layer stuck to the bottom of the pool was sucked into her mouth!","However, her stomach remained flat afterward. No one knew where the spiritual marrow went.","Little Phoenix and the others didn’t know that Feng Wu was undergoing a drastic change.","Feng Wu sat on the ground with her legs crossed and her eyes closed. Her fair face was slightly flushed, and all the interference from the outside world was blocked.","All the spiritual essence was turned into spiritual liquid in her dantian.","The torrent of spiritual marrow kept washing over it.","Her dantian, which was already much sturdier than others, had undergone a strange change at this moment. It actually grew into a white transparent ball the size of a bowl!","Other people’s dantian was the size of an egg, but Feng Wu’s dantian was the size of a bowl, and it glowed with a faint golden color.","The spiritual marrow was still continuously injected into her dantian, washing it over and over.","In the end, there was a buzz.","Feng Wu opened her eyes and gave Little Phoenix a strange look.","Little Phoenix said, “What?”","Feng Wu said, “I’m going to make a breakthrough.”","Little Phoenix said, “Go ahead.”","Feng Wu’s eyes glittered, and she stared at Little Phoenix. “It’s not going to be one level..”"]},{"number":3593,"title":"Chapter 3593: Breakthrough (2))","paragraphs":["Chapter 3593: Breakthrough (2))","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Little Phoenix said, “So, you mean...”","Feng Wu said, “Probably... not two levels either...”","Little Phoenix was shocked!","Feng Wu said, “I can’t hold it in anymore.”","Little Phoenix said, “Hold on! How many levels is it going to be? Don’t do anything rash!”","The bird was so anxious.","Feng Wu said, “At least... at least three levels...”","Feng Wu was now a Level-8 Spiritual King, and three more levels would make her a Level-2 Spiritual Overlord!","“There will be a lightning tribulation when you advance to the Spiritual Overlord Stage. You’re breaking through three levels in one go. The lightning tribulation must be terrifying. You’re doomed...” Little Phoenix cried. “Can’t you take your time?”","Feng Wu said anxiously, “I can’t hold on much longer!”","Little Phoenix said, “Well, well...”","Feng Wu asked, “Can I have someone take it for me?”","Little Phoenix said, “You can’t find someone who’s much stronger than you. Spiritual Saints won’t do, but Spiritual Overlords can. The more people you have, the more likely you’ll be able to survive...”","Feng Wu took a deep breath. “I see.”","After that, Feng Wu ran up the stairs.","The cub saw that Feng Wu was bulging like a cylinder, and it was very difficult for her to walk out.","“She’s in danger this time. Let’s go and protect her,” said Little Phoenix. “Of course, when she attracts the lightning tribulation, we have to hide in her space as soon as possible, or we’ll both be blown up, understand?”","The little tiger cub’s expression was nervous and solemn.","Feng Wu walked into the Zuo family’s house.","The Zuo family was now a bloody battlefield.","Zuo Chengfeng and Mrs. Hua were fighting in subspace, but the remaining Spiritual Overlords had been fighting crazily.","The Zuo family and the Hua family each had fifteen Spiritual Overlords, and there were fifteen itinerant cultivators. In the end, the Zuo family came up with another five Spiritual Overlords.","The ten Spiritual Overlords that Feng Wu had brought with her hadn’t joined the battle yet. They were just standing guard outside.","The itinerant cultivators had been trying to run away, but because Feng Wu’s Spiritual Overlords were guarding the area, they were caught as soon as they tried to leave. They had already caught five of them. The scene was a mess.","More than half of the Zuo family’s house had collapsed.","Zuo Chengfeng set up a protective shield before he left, so the battle didn’t affect the area outside the Zuo family. Otherwise, everything within dozens of kilometers would have been razed to the ground.","Boom!","There was a powerful explosion!","Flames were leaping toward the sky!","The Hua family and the itinerant cultivators worked together to fight the Zuo family. As a result, the Zuo family kept losing Spiritual Overlords, and there were fewer and fewer powerful cultivators left.","Zuo Ming and his wife almost burst into tears.","Those Spiritual Overlords were the Zuo family’s last trump cards!","The last five Spiritual Lords were all that they had.","“Father, when are you coming back?:” Zuo Ming clenched his fists and narrowed his eyes.","Just then, Bukong placed a sword at Zuo Ming’s neck.","“Zuo Ming, for the sake of our friendship, I won’t kill you. Hand over the Spirit Diagram Sword!” Bukong said coldly.","Zuo Ming couldn’t fight back at all. He gritted his teeth and said, “We don’t have the Spirit Diagram Sword! If someone does have it, it has to be the Hua family. Hua Wushuang knows the Spirit Diagram Sword, right? Take her away!”","Zuo Ming was frustrated.","Why did he have to bring Hua Wushuang here? He had caused so much trouble.. If this continued, the Zuo family would really be wiped out!"]},{"number":3594,"title":"Chapter 3594: Breakthrough (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3594: Breakthrough (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Zuo Ming gritted his teeth. “I don’t care about the Spirit Diagram Sword anymore. Take Hua Wushuang away. Whether you can get the Spirit Diagram Sword out of her is up to you!”","However, Bukong snorted. “Do you think I didn’t ask her? You’re broken Hua Wushuang’s mind. She’s crazy now, and we can’t get the Spirit Diagram Sword out of her! You must have gotten the Spirit Diagram Sword from her and then destroyed her brain so that no one can get it out! Tell me, where is the Spirit","Diagram Sword?!”","Zuo Ming was furious.","There was really no Spirit Diagram Sword!","What should he say to make them believe him?","At that moment, Mrs. Zuo had an idea. She cried. “Since the Hua family had let Hua Wushuang cultivate the Spirit Diagram Sword, they must have the manual! Go to the Hua family and ask for it. You shouldn’t have come after us! We really don’t have it. We can’t give you anything even if you kill all of us! If we have it, why don’t we give it to you? We could have focused on the Zuo family after getting rid of you all!”","Mrs. Zuo cried miserably. She had never been in such a sorry state in her life.","Hadn’t the Dugu family always been in an alliance with the Zuo family? Why hadn’t the Gudu family come to help? Mrs. Zuo’s heart sank.","Bukong believed Mrs. Zuo.","That’s right. Since Hua Wushuang knew the Spirit Diagram Sword, it meant...","Bukong and Black and White Priest immediately stopped and gestured for the itinerant cultivators to stop as well.","The remaining cultivators of the Zuo family were still fighting the Spiritual Overlords of the Hua family.","The Zuo family had twenty Spiritual Overlords. Although many of them were injured, they could still fight.","However, the Hua Family only sent fifteen this time. Furthermore, Aunt Xi, the leader, was nowhere to be seen. Hua Huaiyu was furious.","Seeing that their Spiritual Overlords were surrounded by the Zuo family and that the itinerant cultivators, Hua Huaiyu had an idea.","It was impossible to say that Hua Wushuang had never cultivated the Spirit Diagram Sword, because everyone already believed it.","So the only way now was— Blame someone else.","Blame someone else.","“Wushuang didn’t get the Spirit Diagram Sword from our family. If the Hua family had the Spirit Diagram Sword, I would have learned it long ago. Why haven’t I learned it yet? Because it doesn’t belong to the Hua family at all!","“A few days ago, Wushuang came to the palace, and Her Majesty gave her a treasure. Ever since then, Wushuang’s cultivation has improved greatly. She went from a Level-I to a Level-8 Spiritual King! So, the owner should have been the empress dowager!”","Hua Huaiyu was very bold. He had dragged the empress dowager into this mess. With so many people around, the empress dowager would definitely hear about this. The Hua family would probably lose her favor...","Bukong frowned. In other words, the empress dowager had the Spirit Diagram Sword.","Zuo Ming nodded in a hurry. “Yes, yes. The empress dowager must have given it to Wushuang. The Spirit Diagram Sword is amazing. It can make a person reach Level 8 of the Spiritual King Stage from Level 1! If the Zuo family had such a cultivation technique, my sons and daughters wouldn’t have died one after another.”","Bukong thought that that was indeed the case.","Hua Wushuang was already in his hands, so there was no point in continuing this battle.."]},{"number":3595,"title":"Chapter 3595: Heavenly Lightning Tribulation (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3595: Heavenly Lightning Tribulation (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Thinking of this, Bukong and the other Spiritual Overlords wanted to stop fighting.","However,","How could they call a truce just because they wanted to?","Feng Wu was sitting on the roof, filled to the brim with spiritual essence.","She sat cross-legged quietly and focused her mind. Golden light lingered around her, and electric arcs flickered, making her look like a lightning person.","But because everyone was busy fighting, no one noticed her existence.","Only at this moment, after everyone stopped fighting, did someone notice that something was wrong. “Hey, what’s that?”","“That looks like a person!”","“That person is so fat. He’s at least a meter wide, right?!”","“Hey, why does it look like a woman?”","“There’s lightning on her body? Is she absorbing lightning from the sky? Strange, I didn’t hear any thunder.”","Everyone looked up and saw black clouds rolling in the sky. Layers of clouds overlapped and became thicker and thicker as if they were about to fall.","“What on earth is going on here?!”","“If I remember correctly, this is...”","“Lightning tribulation?!”","“That person looks like she’s only at the Spiritual King Stage, but she attracted lightning tribulations? Who is she?”","Everyone asked Zuo Ming in unison.","Zuo Ming was confused. There was no such person in the Zuo family.","At this moment, Bukong suddenly frowned. “This person is using her own strength to attract the lightning tribulation. Does she want to kill us?!”","Bukong turned around and stared at Zuo Ming. “Is this one of your tricks?”","Zuo Ming had no idea. He looked at his elders suspiciously. Had they arranged","Hua Huaiyu sneered. “Is this a lightning tribulation when one rises from the Spiritual King Stage to the Spiritual Kingdom Stage? Unfortunately, we’re all at the Spiritual Overlord Stage. This lightning tribulation is useless to us!”","Dark clouds covered the sky. From time to time, lightning flashed, and it didn’t look powerful at all.","Everyone was a little worried at first, but they didn’t care anymore. They looked at Zuo Ming with disdain. “You think you can hurt us with that little lightning?”","Zuo Ming was about to explain when Bukong asked, “What’s going on? Why can’t we get out?”","He couldn’t get out?","The Black and White Priest looked at Bukong in confusion, but the latter said solemnly. “We really can’t get out. When did the Zuo family activate this formation? This wall doesn’t look high, but we can’t jump over it!”","The Black and White Priest also tried to jump over the wall.","The wall wasn’t tall, but it seemed like it would grow by itself. The higher he jumped, the higher the wall would rise. He couldn’t jump out at all!","The Black and White Priest punched the wall, and a spider web-like crack appeared on it. Everyone looked excited. That might work!","However, in the next moment, the spider web-like crack disappeared.","Everyone looked at the wall in shock!","What on earth was going on here?!","Even Zuo Ming looked surprised. What was going on?","The Zuo family indeed had a formation, and it had already been activated, but it wasn’t that powerful.","It wasn’t like he hadn’t seen it before.","The Black and White Priest stared at Zuo Ming. “Master Zuo, are you not going to let us go?”","Of course, Zuo Ming wanted them to leave. If they kept fighting, the Zuo family would be destroyed!","Before Zuo Ming could say anything, someone crie","“Oh my god! Everyone, look at the sky!”","Instantly, everyone looked up at the sky.","The sky was covered by dark clouds earlier.."]},{"number":3596,"title":"Chapter 3596: Heavenly Lightning Tribulation (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3596: Heavenly Lightning Tribulation (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The sky was black, so dark that it made people feel suffocated. It was as if the end of the world had arrived. At that moment,","There was a violent explosion.","Behind the dark clouds, the dazzling golden lightning ball instantly exploded!","The thunder ball was filled with rolling lightning and crackling electric arcs. The energy was like a vast sea!","Whoosh!","A bolt of lightning fell from the sky like an iron chain and struck the ground!","Rather than saying that the lightning was like a chain, it was more like a lightning river flowing down!","The surging lightning mercilessly struck the place with the most people on the field!","Hua Huaiyu stood at the center with the most people around him. Therefore, he was the first person to be hit.","When Hua Huaivu looked up, he could sense how terrifvinq the lightninq river","was, so he subconsciously dodged and moved dozens of meters away. However, not everyone was as vigilant as him.","An elder of the Hua family was struck by lightning because he couldn’t dodge in time. The lightning exploded!","The elder’s clothes instantly turned to dust, and all the hair on his body was charred. Even his defense of the Spiritual Overlord Stage was instantly destroyed. He was burnt, and intense pain spread throughout his body!","“Ah!” Half of the elder’s head was hit by the lightning.","Half of his face was normal, while the other half was charred black.","Everyone was shocked when they saw this scene!","“What’s his level...” Bukong took a deep breath.","Hua Huaiyu was also extremely depressed. He took a deep breath and said, ”","He’s a Level-3 Spiritual Overlord.”","Bukong exhaled. “That’s good news.”","He was much stronger than a Level-3 Spiritual Overlord.","However, Hua Huaiyu turned around and looked at Bukong. “Don’t you.. Imow?”","Bukong asked, “Know what?”","Hua Huaiyu said, “This lightning river seems to be at Level 3 of the Spiritual","Overlord Stage too.”","Bukong heaved a sigh of relief. Before he could say that it wasn’t too bad, Hua Huaiyu frowned and said, “I heard from my mother that the lightning tribulation is a reflection of a person’s own strength.”","Bukong asked, “... What do you mean?”","Hua Huaiyu said, “The power of the lightning tribulation is the same as your strength.”","Bukong’s expression changed drastically. “Holy crap!”","Hua Huaiyu had a bitter expression. “I hope I’m wrong. I hope... this isn’t a lightning tribulation.”","But at this moment, someone exclaimed, “Look! Look over there!”","Everyone turned to look at the roof.","Previously, the person sitting there looked like a balloon. At that time, no one could recognize who that person was, but now... “She’s a Level-9 Spiritual King. No, she’s already a Spiritual Overlord!”","“How did she make a breakthrough so quickly?!” Hua Huaiyu’s expression changed.","Bukong quickly asked, “What did you see?”","Hua Huaiyu was raised by Mrs. Hua, so he definitely knew a lot more than other people.","Hua Huaiyu’s expression was very ugly. His face was sinister and distorted!","He stared at the person and gritted his teeth. “I know who that is!”","“Feng Wu!” Hua Huaiyu took a deep breath. “That Feng Wu from the Feng clan!","That Feng Wu who competed with our Wushuang for the crown prince! That","Feng Wu with the Divine Phoenix Blood!”","“Feng Wu? How?” Bukong knew who Feng Wu was because the itinerant cultivators had gathered in the imperial capital to kill her.."]},{"number":3597,"title":"Chapter 3597: Heavenly Lightning Tribulation (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3597: Heavenly Lightning Tribulation (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, after hearing about the Spirit Diagram Sword, everyone made it their priority.","Feng Wu still had to be killed.","However,","“Isn’t she a Level-4 Spiritual King?” Bukong frowned.","Everyone had received the bounty, so they knew exactly how capable Feng Wu was.","“She’s going to advance to the Spiritual Overlord Stage now, right?” Bukong frowned. “Why is she making breakthroughs so quickly? She’s as fast as Hua Wushuang! ”","Hua Huaiyu’s heart skipped a beat as if an idea had flashed across his mind.","However, that thought disappeared too quickly, so he didn’t catch it in time.","Hua Huaiyu said, “She’s going to break through to the Spiritual Overlord Stage in such a short period of time. If we don’t kill her now, she’ll do it again. If we let her do that, it’ll be difficult to kill her in the future.","Bukong glanced at Hua Huaiyu. “Why should we care about her? We’re all peak","Spiritual Overlords. What’s the difference between a peak Spiritual King and a Level-I Spiritual Overlord? Hua Huaiyu, it’s so obvious that you’re using us as your borrowed weapons.:","Hua Huaiyu’s expression turned ugly.","Bukong smiled. “But don’t worry. We’re definitely going to kill Feng Wu, and we’re going to do it right now. She’s right here in front of us. If we don’t kill her now, I’ll think it’s a waste of this opportunity.”","Bukong said to everyone around him, “I’ve reserved Feng Wu’s head. Don’t try to steal it from me.”","However, someone objected. “Bukong, that’s not fair. You already have Hua Wushuang, so you almost have the Spirit Diagram Sword. And now you’ve claimed Feng Wu’s head. Why are all the benefits yours? Why did we come all the way to the imperial capital? To be your thugs?”","The Black and White Priest frowned slightly and told Bukong, “Don’t be too greedy. ”","All the people present were Spiritual Overlords. If they were too greedy, they would be easily surrounded.","Bukong said indignantly, “In that case. I’ll let you have Feng Wu. If you can’t kill her, I’ll do it then!”","As he spoke, Bukong carried Hua Wushuang to a remote corner.","Hua Huaiyu watched helplessly as his daughter was taken away, but he couldn’t say a word. Once he objected, the situation would be reversed... He could not let the Zuo family and the itinerant cultivators join forces.","Right now, many people were staring at Feng Wu and smirking. Outside the Zuo family’s door, Yu Mingye jumped to his feet!","“They’re going after Xiao Wu. I want to go in!”","However, the three elders stopped him. “Miss Feng Wu told me not to let anyone in without her permission.”","Standing on the top of a tree, Yu Mingye could see everything in the Zuo family’s yard.","He was so anxious that he was about to jump off the tree. “But they recognized her and are going to besiege her now! ”","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","From the rapid sound waves, one could tell how powerful the three of them were.","“That’s Hong Yang and Hong Feng, the brothers!”","“There’s also Priest Dust!”","“All three of them want Feng Wu’s head, but if Feng Wu dares to sit here, she’ll make sure that they won’t succeed.”","Black and White Priest was the strongest and most cautious among the itinerant cultivators. He wouldn’t take the lead.","He wanted to see what would happen to those three people.","The next second!","They attacked Feng Wu at the same time!"]},{"number":3598,"title":"Chapter 3598: Heavenly Lightning Tribulation (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3598: Heavenly Lightning Tribulation (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","One pointed his sword at Feng Wu’s forehead.","One tried to throttle her.","And the third aimed a fist at Feng Wu’s chest and tried to smash it!","The three of them were at least Level-3 Spiritual Overlords!","“Don’t be afraid!” Little Phoenix whispered in Feng Wu’s ear. “You’ll break through to Level 2 of the Spiritual Overlord Stage in an instant, and they’ll be struck by your lightning tribulation!”","Right now, Little Phoenix had a serious look on its face.","Feng Wu had never been in such danger!","Yu Mingye wanted to rush in, but he ran into the same problem as the other Spiritual Overlords in the yard!","He couldn’t get in.","The formation was completed when no one was looking. The people inside couldn’t leave, and the people outside couldn’t enter.","“Dragon Elephant Wave Formation?” The elder next to Yu Mingye was shocked!","Feng Wu went into the Zuo family’s house alone. All the Spiritual Overlords were assigned to guard the area around the Zuo family. At first, the elders didn’t think much of the formation and only felt that Feng Wu was messing around.","But now, when they realized no one could get in or out, they were really shocked!","The Dragon Elephant Wave Formation was a formidable major formation. That girl had casually set it up and actually succeeded? Why did it feel so unreal?","Many people thought that way. They all looked at the scene in front of them in surprise.","They had thought that they would have to fight a bloody battle in the end, but Feng Wu had only used them to set up the formation.","General Gao and General Yuan looked at each other and saw the shock in each other’s eyes.","General Yuan muttered to himself, “She... Can she survive this? She’s really bold!”","General Gao said, “I only know that if we don’t protect her well and let her die, we’ll be dead too!”","With that, General Gao kicked the towering wall. He used all his strength, but...","he still couldn’t shake it!","General Gao was really shocked!","In the Zuo family’s yard, three people were attacking Feng Wu!","At that critical moment!","Everyone was shocked to see that the three Spiritual Overlords were sent flying by a terrifying force!","Hong Feng, who was the weakest, spat out a mouthful of blood in midair.","His older brother, Hong Yang, was a little bit better. When he landed, he retreated desperately, leaving a long trail of footprints on the ground before finally stopping.","But the moment he stopped, boom!","The lightning river in the sky poured down!","Three thunderbolts were aimed at the three people who were attacking Feng wu.","They struck down like lightning whips.","Hong Feng was the first to be hit and looked like he had been burnt. His clothes were destroyed, and most of his body was charred black! The second one headed straight for Hong Yang.","The third headed for Priest Dust.","Hong Feng’s expression changed!","Under the strong light, everyone could see Hong Feng’s terrified face.","He drew his sword to fight against lightning.","But, boom!","The lightning river was like a lightning whip, sending Hong Feng flying into the air and crashing down!","Before he could land, the lightning poured down again like a downpour!","When the lightning dissipated, everyone saw a burnt corpse.","It only had a pitch-black skeleton left... There was nothing else.","Oh god!","Everyone was shocked by what they saw, be it the Spiritual Overlords in the Zuo family’s yard or those outside!"]},{"number":3599,"title":"Chapter 3599: Level-2 Spiritual Overlord (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3599: Level-2 Spiritual Overlord (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","They admitted that the thunder element was very powerful in attacks, but how could it be so terrifying?","They subconsciously looked up at the sky, only to see the lightning river in the sky pouring down like pillars of light!","“Four, five, six... More are coming!” Fear appeared on Bukong’s face!","These lightning rivers seemed to be tailor-made for them. Every single one of them was filled with energy, and lightning whistled as they covered the sky.","The lightning was so oppressive that it made one’s heart palpitate.","Electric arcs flashed on the lightning river!","These lightning bolts would still explode, badly mutilating people.","Every lightning river found its corresponding person and chased after him!","For example, Bukong was at the peak of the Spiritual Overlord Stage, then the power of his corresponding lightning was at the peak of the Spiritual Overlord Stage.","Bukong was so frightened that his face turned pale, and he broke out in cold sweat!","However, the lightning had locked onto him and was chasing after him!","No matter how fast Bukong was, the lightning was faster. He had only run for a while before he was caught.","The surging thunder energy hit the top of his head!","Bukong quickly put a defensive barrier over his head, but it was of no use.","A spiderweb-like crack appeared on the defensive barrier.","Bukong’s face was pale, and he was in a panic. He hurriedly used his spiritual essence to repair the cracks in the defensive barrier, but he couldn’t repair it as fast as if it was destroyed.","He had just recovered a little when the second bolt of lightning appeared above his head again!","Another lightning bolt struck down!","“Screw you!” Bukong almost spat out a mouthful of blood.","Bukong was at the peak of the Spiritual Overlord and could do whatever he wanted on the continent. The moment he entered the Zuo family, he had been very rude to the heads of the two families. However, the lightning tribulation almost made him helpless!","Bukong really couldn’t understand.","“What the hell is going on? Why is there such a lightning tribulation? Is it really Feng Wu? That’s impossible!” Bukong thought.","No matter how powerful Feng Wu was, she had only just become a Level-I Spiritual Overlord from a Level-8 Spiritual King. Almost everyone here had gone through the lightning tribulation of the Spiritual Overlord stage and didn’t find it a big deal.","But this lightning tribulation...","That bolt of lightning was aimed at Bukong!","Bukong panicked. He didn’t wait for the cracks in the protective barrier to be repaired before running away!","His first reaction was to run outside.","He thought if he left the Zuo family, he might be able to get rid of the strange lightning tribulation. However, Bukong wasn’t the only one who thought that way.","The 40-odd Spiritual Overlords here all wanted to escape.","All of them wanted to escape from the walls of the Zuo family.","However,","They couldn’t get out!","It was only then that they remembered that the Zuo family’s formation had been activated. The walls were sealed, and they couldn’t escape no matter what!","Hence, everyone began to look for Zuo Ming.","“Where’s Zuo Ming? Find that old bastard!”","Until now, Bukong still thought that the formation was activated by the Zuo family!","“That old bastard is so despicable! He’s going to lock all of us up and kill us with the lightning tribulation!” Bukong was furious. “Find Zuo Ming!”","Everyone was being chased by the lightning tribulation.","The lightning tribulation swept down from the sky and aimed at the person it had identified.. Every strike was accurate, and none of them missed..."]},{"number":3600,"title":"Chapter 3600: Level-2 Spiritual Overlord (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3600: Level-2 Spiritual Overlord (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Many of the Spiritual Overlords here were already covered in blood, and their bodies were charred black.","Soon, someone dragged Zuo Ming out and threw him to Bukong.","Zuo Ming was the weakest of them all, so the lightning tribulation that was chasing him was also the weakest. That was why he was still in good condition, but he wouldn’t be when Bukong caught him.","Bukong grabbed Zuo Ming and slapped him. “What the hell is the Zuo family doing? Stop the formation and let us out!”","Zuo Ming almost fainted from the slap. He tried to explain. “We didn’t activate the formation. No, it’s no longer under our control. If I could, I would’ve run away. Would I still be here?”","Bukong was speechless. That was right.","“So, what the hell is going on with this lightning tribulation? What the hell is the Zuo family doing?!” Bukong yelled at Zuo Ming.","Zuo Ming almost stopped breathing. “This isn’t our doing. If we could do that, I wouldn’t have let you hold me by my neck!”","Bukong was stunned again.","Zuo Ming pointed at the Zuo family’s elders that were running around and the charred bodies on the ground. Tears welled up in his eyes as he bellowed at the top of his lungs, “If it’s really the Zuo family’s doing, will we let our elders die?!”","Bukong was rendered speechless again. That was true...","Bukong said, “Then what the hell...”","Zuo Ming pointed at the girl on the roof, who looked like she was covered in divine light.","“It’s really her? That’s impossible!”","The idea had crossed Bukong’s mind because she was making a breakthrough right there.","However...","“This lightning tribulation is too intense. It’s not something a weak little girl like her can bring.” Bukong still didn’t believe it. He kept feeling that there was a mighty figure hiding in the Zuo family.","Zuo Ming was on the verge of tears. “A weak little girl? You think she’s weak?","She was only a Spiritual Lord a few months ago, and a few days ago, she was a Level-4 Spiritual King. Now, she’s a Level-8 Spiritual Overlord!","“Have you ever seen someone who broke through a whole stage in less than half a year? You call this weak? You call this impossible?!”","Envy filled Zuo Ming’s eyes as he yelled at Bukong, “Give her another six months, and she’ll become a Spiritual Saint!”","Bukong almost burst into laughter at Zuo Ming’s words. Had Zuo Ming gone crazy? Advance to the Spirit Saint stage in half a year?","“Do you know how many years I’ve been stuck at the Spiritual Overlord Stage?” Bukong sneered at Zuo Ming. “Spiritual Saint Stage? What a joke! You’d better wait until she reaches Level 2 of the Spiritual Overlord Stage first! In my opinion, she’ll need at least three to five years!”","Just then, someone cried out, “Holy crap! Look at Feng Wu! Look at her!”","Everyone turned to Feng Wu again.","All the spiritual essence in nature surged toward her!","“A Level-2 Spiritual Overlord...” Zuo Ming mumbled to himself. “She’s already a Level-2 Spiritual Overlord... In such a short time, she actually... She actually...” Bukong was also a little stunned.","He had just said those harsh words, but he was immediately proved wrong.","Because of Feng Wu’s breakthrough, the lightning tribulation stopped for a","moment, and the brief silence was eerie and terrifying.","Just then, someone asked, “Shouldn’t Feng Wu bear the lightning tribulation herself? Why are we getting attacked?”"]}]);
